            ['start_time'=>175.64,'end_time'=>185.9,'target_text'=>'Each PDF includes clear definitions, real examples, and simple organization to help you stop studying random words and focus','source_text'=>'Setiap PDF mengandungi definisi yang jelas, contoh nyata, dan susunan yang mudah untuk membantu anda berhenti mengkaji perkataan rawak dan fokus','order'=>57],
            ['start_time'=>186,'end_time'=>189.26,'target_text'=>'on the vocabulary that actually matters.','source_text'=>'kepada kosa kata yang benar-benar penting.','order'=>58],
            ['start_time'=>189.36,'end_time'=>194.12,'target_text'=>'You can get them from the link in the description or at volkaenglish.com.','source_text'=>'Anda boleh dapatkannya dari pautan dalam penerangan atau di volkaenglish.com.','order'=>59],
            ['start_time'=>194.52,'end_time'=>201.34,'target_text'=>'>> Okay, now we are walking up this very big driveway to a monument here.','source_text'=>'Okay, sekarang kita sedang berjalan naik melalui jalan masuk yang besar ini ke sebuah monumen di sini.','order'=>60],
            ['start_time'=>201.44,'end_time'=>207.18,'target_text'=>'I\'m not sure if you can see that monument in in the distance, but it is one of the most famous monuments here in Jakarta,','source_text'=>'Saya tidak pasti jika anda boleh nampak monumen itu di kejauhan, tetapi ia adalah salah satu monumen paling terkenal di Jakarta,','order'=>61],
            ['start_time'=>207.28,'end_time'=>209.78,'target_text'=>'Indonesia, and we are going to go look at it right now.','source_text'=>'Indonesia, dan kita akan pergi melihatnya sekarang.','order'=>62],
            ['start_time'=>209.88,'end_time'=>213.9,'target_text'=>'But let\'s describe a little bit on the way there and talk about emotions.','source_text'=>'Tapi mari kita terangkan serba sedikit sepanjang perjalanan ke sana sambil berbincang tentang emosi.','order'=>63],
            ['start_time'=>214,'end_time'=>218.18,'target_text'=>'So, can you guys tell me what the opposite of happy is?','source_text'=>'Jadi, bolehkah anda beritahu saya apa lawan bagi gembira?','order'=>64],
            ['start_time'=>218.28,'end_time'=>220.98,'target_text'=>'So, I\'m happy to be in Jakarta.','source_text'=>'Jadi, saya gembira berada di Jakarta.','order'=>65],
            ['start_time'=>221.08,'end_time'=>223.18,'target_text'=>'What would be the opposite of that?','source_text'=>'Apakah lawan baginya?','order'=>66],
            ['start_time'=>223.28,'end_time'=>224.38,'target_text'=>'>> Sad.','source_text'=>'Sedih.','order'=>67],
            ['start_time'=>224.48,'end_time'=>225.3,'target_text'=>'>> Correct.','source_text'=>'Betul.','order'=>68],
            ['start_time'=>225.4,'end_time'=>226.1,'target_text'=>'Sad.','source_text'=>'Sedih.','order'=>69],
            ['start_time'=>226.2,'end_time'=>228.1,'target_text'=>'I am sad today.','source_text'=>'Saya sedih hari ini.','order'=>70],
            ['start_time'=>228.2,'end_time'=>229.42,'target_text'=>'I\'m sad this happened.','source_text'=>'Saya sedih perkara ini berlaku.','order'=>71],
            ['start_time'=>229.52,'end_time'=>231.42,'target_text'=>'So, the So the is sad.','source_text'=>'Jadi, jawapannya adalah sedih.','order'=>72],
            ['start_time'=>231.52,'end_time'=>238.1,'target_text'=>'Those are probably two of the most common emotions you will ever hear and use.','source_text'=>'Itu mungkin dua emosi paling biasa yang akan anda dengar dan gunakan.','order'=>73],
            ['start_time'=>238.2,'end_time'=>240.02,'target_text'=>'Talk a little bit around us now.','source_text'=>'Bercakap sedikit tentang keadaan sekeliling kita sekarang.','order'=>74],
            ['start_time'=>240.12,'end_time'=>241.42,'target_text'=>'Look at this path.','source_text'=>'Lihat laluan ini.','order'=>75],
            ['start_time'=>241.52,'end_time'=>244.66,'target_text'=>'This path is very old and it\'s very uneven.','source_text'=>'Laluan ini sangat lama dan sangat tidak rata.','order'=>76],
            ['start_time'=>244.76,'end_time'=>248.98,'target_text'=>'You can easily trip and it is missing pieces of stone.','source_text'=>'Anda boleh terjatuh dengan mudah dan ia kekurangan kepingan batu.','order'=>77],
            ['start_time'=>249.08,'end_time'=>251.98,'target_text'=>'I don\'t think you could push a wheelchair on here.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa kerusi roda tidak boleh ditolak di sini.','order'=>78],
            ['start_time'=>252.08,'end_time'=>253.9,'target_text'=>'I think it will be very difficult.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa ia akan menjadi sangat sukar.','order'=>79],
            ['start_time'=>254,'end_time'=>261.26,'target_text'=>'People in wheelchairs probably get sad when they have to come on here because it\'s so bumpy and it probably hurts.','source_text'=>'Orang berkerusi roda mungkin berasa sedih apabila terpaksa lalu di sini kerana ia sangat berbonggol-bonggol dan mungkin menyakitkan.','order'=>80],
            ['start_time'=>261.36,'end_time'=>262.34,'target_text'=>'Do you agree?','source_text'=>'Adakah anda setuju?','order'=>81],
            ['start_time'=>262.44,'end_time'=>263.06,'target_text'=>'>> I agree.','source_text'=>'Saya setuju.','order'=>82],
            ['start_time'=>263.16,'end_time'=>265.42,'target_text'=>'Maybe they get a little disappointed as well.','source_text'=>'Mungkin mereka berasa sedikit kecewa juga.','order'=>83],
            ['start_time'=>265.52,'end_time'=>269.18,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, they probably get disappointed too and maybe frustrated.','source_text'=>'Ya, mereka mungkin berasa kecewa dan mungkin kecewa juga.','order'=>84],
            ['start_time'=>269.28,'end_time'=>275.94,'target_text'=>'They\'re like, \\\\\\\"Why is this path not smooth for people in wheelchairs?\\\\\\\" If they really wanted to though, they could go on the','source_text'=>'Mereka fikir, \'Kenapa laluan ini tidak rata untuk orang berkerusi roda?\' Tapi jika mereka mahu, mereka boleh menggunakan','order'=>85],
            ['start_time'=>276.04,'end_time'=>276.44,'target_text'=>'road.','source_text'=>'jalan raya.','order'=>86],
            ['start_time'=>276.48,'end_time'=>279.7,'target_text'=>'I don\'t think the road is really used by any vehicles.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa jalan raya tidak digunakan oleh sebarang kenderaan.','order'=>87],
            ['start_time'=>279.8,'end_time'=>282.26,'target_text'=>'It looks like a very quiet road overall.','source_text'=>'Ia kelihatan seperti jalan yang sangat sunyi secara keseluruhannya.','order'=>88],
            ['start_time'=>282.36,'end_time'=>284.26,'target_text'=>'But most families here seem happy.','source_text'=>'Tetapi kebanyakan keluarga di sini kelihatan gembira.','order'=>89],
            ['start_time'=>284.36,'end_time'=>286.78,'target_text'=>'I see one family and another over there.','source_text'=>'Saya nampak satu keluarga dan satu lagi di sana.','order'=>90],
            ['start_time'=>286.88,'end_time'=>293.22,'target_text'=>'I think they\'re just enjoying the beautiful weather and having fun with their family out here.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa mereka hanya menikmati cuaca yang indah dan berseronok dengan keluarga mereka di luar sini.','order'=>91],
            ['start_time'=>293.32,'end_time'=>297.38,'target_text'=>'Now I\'m going to teach you some of the most common emotions in pairs.','source_text'=>'Sekarang saya akan mengajar anda beberapa emosi biasa secara berpasangan.','order'=>92],
            ['start_time'=>297.48,'end_time'=>299.9,'target_text'=>'For example, happy and sad.','source_text'=>'Sebagai contoh, gembira dan sedih.','order'=>93],
            ['start_time'=>300,'end_time'=>305.46,'target_text'=>'That way it\'s easier to remember them because one is usually the opposite of another.','source_text'=>'Dengan cara itu lebih mudah untuk mengingatinya kerana satu biasanya adalah lawan kepada yang lain.','order'=>94],
            ['start_time'=>305.56,'end_time'=>308.02,'target_text'=>'The first pair, we already talked about it earlier.','source_text'=>'Pasangan pertama, kita sudah bercakap mengenainya tadi.','order'=>95],
            ['start_time'=>308.12,'end_time'=>309.18,'target_text'=>'It is happy.','source_text'=>'Ia adalah gembira.','order'=>96],
            ['start_time'=>309.28,'end_time'=>309.68,'target_text'=>'I\'m happy.','source_text'=>'I\'m happy.','order'=>97],
            ['start_time'=>309.76,'end_time'=>310.78,'target_text'=>'I\'m so happy.','source_text'=>'Saya sangat gembira.','order'=>98],
            ['start_time'=>310.88,'end_time'=>312.88,'target_text'=>'And sad.','source_text'=>'Dan sedih.','order'=>99],
            ['start_time'=>313.64,'end_time'=>314.38,'target_text'=>'I\'m sad.','source_text'=>'Saya sedih.','order'=>100],
            ['start_time'=>314.48,'end_time'=>315.54,'target_text'=>'Happy and sad.','source_text'=>'Gembira dan sedih.','order'=>101],
            ['start_time'=>315.64,'end_time'=>318.18,'target_text'=>'The second is calm.','source_text'=>'Yang kedua adalah tenang.','order'=>102],
            ['start_time'=>318.28,'end_time'=>319.26,'target_text'=>'I\'m calm.','source_text'=>'Saya tenang.','order'=>103],
            ['start_time'=>319.36,'end_time'=>321.32,'target_text'=>'And stressed.','source_text'=>'Dan tertekan (stressed).','order'=>104],
            ['start_time'=>321.72,'end_time'=>322.22,'target_text'=>'I\'m stressed.','source_text'=>'I\'m stressed.','order'=>105],
            ['start_time'=>322.32,'end_time'=>323.26,'target_text'=>'I\'m stressed out.','source_text'=>'Saya sangat tertekan.','order'=>106],
            ['start_time'=>323.36,'end_time'=>324.86,'target_text'=>'I feel so stressed.','source_text'=>'Saya berasa sangat tertekan.','order'=>107],
            ['start_time'=>324.96,'end_time'=>325.62,'target_text'=>'Stressed.','source_text'=>'Tertekan.','order'=>108],
            ['start_time'=>325.72,'end_time'=>326.98,'target_text'=>'How good is that acting?','source_text'=>'Bagaimana lakonan itu?','order'=>109],
            ['start_time'=>327.08,'end_time'=>327.7,'target_text'=>'>> That was good acting.','source_text'=>'Lakonan yang baik.','order'=>110],
            ['start_time'=>327.8,'end_time'=>328.54,'target_text'=>'>> Rate it 1 to 10.','source_text'=>'Nilaikan 1 hingga 10.','order'=>111],
            ['start_time'=>328.64,'end_time'=>329.54,'target_text'=>'Was that believable?','source_text'=>'Adakah ia boleh dipercayai?','order'=>112],
            ['start_time'=>329.64,'end_time'=>332.9,'target_text'=>'For these next ones, I want you guys to guess the emotion.','source_text'=>'For these next ones, I want you guys to guess the emotion.','order'=>113],
            ['start_time'=>333,'end_time'=>336.78,'target_text'=>'You don\'t need to guess it in English, but just think about what the emotion probably is.','source_text'=>'Anda tidak perlu meneka dalam Bahasa Inggeris, tetapi fikirkan emosi apa yang mungkin berlaku.','order'=>114],
            ['start_time'=>336.88,'end_time'=>339.26,'target_text'=>'Oh man, I cannot wait to go do that.','source_text'=>'Aduh, saya tidak sabar untuk pergi lakukan itu.','order'=>115],
            ['start_time'=>339.36,'end_time'=>343.26,'target_text'=>'I\'m so I\'m looking forward to it.','source_text'=>'Saya sangat — saya menantikannya.','order'=>116],
            ['start_time'=>343.36,'end_time'=>344.22,'target_text'=>'Excited.','source_text'=>'Teruja.','order'=>117],
            ['start_time'=>344.32,'end_time'=>345.5,'target_text'=>'I\'m excited.','source_text'=>'Saya teruja.','order'=>118],
            ['start_time'=>345.6,'end_time'=>348.08,'target_text'=>'Now, the opposite.','source_text'=>'Sekarang, yang sebaliknya.','order'=>119],
            ['start_time'=>349.16,'end_time'=>351.16,'target_text'=>'Oh, man.','source_text'=>'Aduh.','order'=>120],
            ['start_time'=>351.4,'end_time'=>352.9,'target_text'=>'I I don\'t really want to go.','source_text'=>'Saya tidak berapa mahu pergi.','order'=>121],
            ['start_time'=>353,'end_time'=>353.78,'target_text'=>'No, I\'m okay.','source_text'=>'Tak apa, saya okay.','order'=>122],
            ['start_time'=>353.88,'end_time'=>354.5,'target_text'=>'I don\'t I don\'t want to go.','source_text'=>'Saya — saya tidak mahu pergi.','order'=>123],
            ['start_time'=>354.6,'end_time'=>355.94,'target_text'=>'I don\'t want to go.','source_text'=>'Saya tidak mahu pergi.','order'=>124],
            ['start_time'=>356.04,'end_time'=>357.38,'target_text'=>'Nervous.','source_text'=>'Gugup.','order'=>125],
            ['start_time'=>357.48,'end_time'=>358.34,'target_text'=>'Nervous.','source_text'=>'Gugup.','order'=>126],
            ['start_time'=>358.44,'end_time'=>360.38,'target_text'=>'Excited and nervous.','source_text'=>'Teruja dan gugup.','order'=>127],
            ['start_time'=>360.48,'end_time'=>362.38,'target_text'=>'Yeah, I did that.','source_text'=>'Ya, saya lakukan itu.','order'=>128],
            ['start_time'=>362.48,'end_time'=>364.7,'target_text'=>'That was me and I did it.','source_text'=>'Itu adalah saya dan saya berjaya melakukannya.','order'=>129],
            ['start_time'=>364.8,'end_time'=>365.7,'target_text'=>'Proud.','source_text'=>'Bangga.','order'=>130],
            ['start_time'=>365.8,'end_time'=>367.18,'target_text'=>'I\'m proud.','source_text'=>'Saya bangga.','order'=>131],
            ['start_time'=>367.28,'end_time'=>368.42,'target_text'=>'Oh, man.','source_text'=>'Aduh.','order'=>132],
            ['start_time'=>368.52,'end_time'=>371.18,'target_text'=>'I I wish I didn\'t do that.','source_text'=>'Saya harap saya tidak melakukannya.','order'=>133],
            ['start_time'=>371.28,'end_time'=>372.26,'target_text'=>'Oh, no.','source_text'=>'Oh, tidak.','order'=>134],
            ['start_time'=>372.36,'end_time'=>373.62,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know.','source_text'=>'Saya tidak tahu.','order'=>135],
            ['start_time'=>373.72,'end_time'=>374.74,'target_text'=>'Embarrassed.','source_text'=>'Malu.','order'=>136],
            ['start_time'=>374.84,'end_time'=>375.82,'target_text'=>'Proud and embarrassed.','source_text'=>'Bangga dan malu.','order'=>137],
            ['start_time'=>375.92,'end_time'=>378.5,'target_text'=>'These next ones we\'re just going to rapid fire through them.','source_text'=>'Seterusnya kita akan teruskan dengan pantas.','order'=>138],
            ['start_time'=>378.6,'end_time'=>379.94,'target_text'=>'So, lock in.','source_text'=>'Fokus.','order'=>139],
            ['start_time'=>380.04,'end_time'=>382.7,'target_text'=>'Relaxed and worried.','source_text'=>'Tenang dan bimbang.','order'=>140],
            ['start_time'=>382.8,'end_time'=>384.98,'target_text'=>'Relaxed worried.','source_text'=>'Tenang dan bimbang.','order'=>141],
            ['start_time'=>385.08,'end_time'=>387.94,'target_text'=>'Surprised and confused.','source_text'=>'Terkejut dan keliru.','order'=>142],
            ['start_time'=>388.04,'end_time'=>391.06,'target_text'=>'Angry and frustrated.','source_text'=>'Marah dan kecewa.','order'=>143],
            ['start_time'=>391.16,'end_time'=>394.28,'target_text'=>'Grateful disappointed.','source_text'=>'Bersyukur dan kecewa.','order'=>144],
            ['start_time'=>395.28,'end_time'=>397.94,'target_text'=>'So, those are eight common pairs.','source_text'=>'Jadi, itu adalah lapan pasangan biasa.','order'=>145],
            ['start_time'=>398.04,'end_time'=>399.5,'target_text'=>'Eight common pairs.','source_text'=>'Lapan pasangan biasa.','order'=>146],
            ['start_time'=>399.6,'end_time'=>404.06,'target_text'=>'These are five different sentence structures to talk about emotions.','source_text'=>'Ini adalah lima struktur ayat yang berbeza untuk bercakap tentang emosi.','order'=>147],
            ['start_time'=>404.16,'end_time'=>407.5,'target_text'=>'The first is I\'m plus the emotion.','source_text'=>'Yang pertama ialah I\'m ditambah dengan emosi.','order'=>148],
            ['start_time'=>407.6,'end_time'=>408.74,'target_text'=>'I\'m happy.','source_text'=>'Saya gembira.','order'=>149],
            ['start_time'=>408.84,'end_time'=>410.26,'target_text'=>'I\'m sad.','source_text'=>'Saya sedih.','order'=>150],
            ['start_time'=>410.36,'end_time'=>411.58,'target_text'=>'I\'m excited.','source_text'=>'Saya teruja.','order'=>151],
            ['start_time'=>411.68,'end_time'=>415.82,'target_text'=>'The second way is I feel plus emotion.','source_text'=>'Cara kedua ialah I feel ditambah dengan emosi.','order'=>152],
            ['start_time'=>415.92,'end_time'=>417.54,'target_text'=>'I feel sad.','source_text'=>'Saya berasa sedih.','order'=>153],
            ['start_time'=>417.64,'end_time'=>419.7,'target_text'=>'I feel stressed.','source_text'=>'Saya berasa tertekan.','order'=>154],
            ['start_time'=>419.8,'end_time'=>423.86,'target_text'=>'The third I\'m feeling plus the emotion.','source_text'=>'Ketiga, I\'m feeling ditambah dengan emosi.','order'=>155],
            ['start_time'=>423.96,'end_time'=>426.34,'target_text'=>'I\'m feeling tired today.','source_text'=>'Saya berasa penat hari ini.','order'=>156],
            ['start_time'=>426.44,'end_time'=>428.86,'target_text'=>'I\'m feeling very stressed today.','source_text'=>'Saya berasa sangat tertekan hari ini.','order'=>157],
            ['start_time'=>428.96,'end_time'=>436.58,'target_text'=>'The fourth is I feel emotion because I feel happy because I\'m with my friends.','source_text'=>'Keempat ialah I feel [emosi] because — Saya berasa gembira kerana saya bersama kawan-kawan.','order'=>158],
            ['start_time'=>436.68,'end_time'=>439.74,'target_text'=>'I feel happy because','source_text'=>'I feel happy because','order'=>159],
            ['start_time'=>439.84,'end_time'=>441.7,'target_text'=>'I passed my test.','source_text'=>'saya lulus ujian saya.','order'=>160],
            ['start_time'=>441.8,'end_time'=>445.9,'target_text'=>'And the final way is it makes me feel emotion.','source_text'=>'Dan cara terakhir ialah it makes me feel [emosi].','order'=>161],
            ['start_time'=>446,'end_time'=>448.74,'target_text'=>'Listening to music makes me feel happy.','source_text'=>'Mendengar muzik membuatkan saya berasa gembira.','order'=>162],
            ['start_time'=>448.84,'end_time'=>450.66,'target_text'=>'It makes me feel sad.','source_text'=>'Ia membuatkan saya berasa sedih.','order'=>163],
            ['start_time'=>450.76,'end_time'=>452.82,'target_text'=>'It makes me feel excited.','source_text'=>'Ia membuatkan saya berasa teruja.','order'=>164],
            ['start_time'=>452.92,'end_time'=>458.34,'target_text'=>'So, those are five different sentence structures that you can use to talk about your emotions.','source_text'=>'Jadi, itu adalah lima struktur ayat berbeza yang boleh anda gunakan untuk bercakap tentang emosi anda.','order'=>165],
            ['start_time'=>458.44,'end_time'=>460.94,'target_text'=>'Try out some of them and put it in the comments.','source_text'=>'Cuba beberapa daripadanya dan tulis di ruangan komen.','order'=>166],
            ['start_time'=>461.04,'end_time'=>464.58,'target_text'=>'Now, when we speak in English we don\'t always say just I\'m sad.','source_text'=>'Kini, apabila kita bercakap dalam Bahasa Inggeris kita tidak sentiasa berkata \'I\'m sad\' sahaja.','order'=>167],
            ['start_time'=>464.68,'end_time'=>465.78,'target_text'=>'I\'m happy like this.','source_text'=>'Atau \'I\'m happy\' seperti ini.','order'=>168],
            ['start_time'=>465.88,'end_time'=>471.94,'target_text'=>'We usually add intensity words to say if we\'re feeling very sad or not very sad.','source_text'=>'Kita biasanya menambah perkataan penunjuk tahap intensiti untuk menyatakan sama ada kita merasa sangat sedih atau tidak begitu sedih.','order'=>169],
            ['start_time'=>472.04,'end_time'=>475.34,'target_text'=>'So, here are some intensity words you can use.','source_text'=>'Jadi, berikut adalah beberapa perkataan intensiti yang boleh anda gunakan.','order'=>170],
            ['start_time'=>475.44,'end_time'=>476.46,'target_text'=>'A little.','source_text'=>'Sedikit.','order'=>171],
            ['start_time'=>476.56,'end_time'=>478.06,'target_text'=>'I\'m a little tired.','source_text'=>'Saya sedikit penat.','order'=>172],
            ['start_time'=>478.16,'end_time'=>479.3,'target_text'=>'I\'m a little sad.','source_text'=>'Saya sedikit sedih.','order'=>173],
            ['start_time'=>479.4,'end_time'=>482.3,'target_text'=>'That just means not very much.','source_text'=>'Itu bermaksud tidak berapa banyak.','order'=>174],
            ['start_time'=>482.4,'end_time'=>484.1,'target_text'=>'I\'m a little sad today.','source_text'=>'Saya sedikit sedih hari ini.','order'=>175],
            ['start_time'=>484.2,'end_time'=>486.74,'target_text'=>'Compared to I\'m very sad today.','source_text'=>'Berbanding dengan saya sangat sedih hari ini.','order'=>176],
            ['start_time'=>486.84,'end_time'=>488.14,'target_text'=>'I\'m very sad today.','source_text'=>'Saya sangat sedih hari ini.','order'=>177],
            ['start_time'=>488.24,'end_time'=>489.5,'target_text'=>'I\'m so sad.','source_text'=>'Saya tersangat sedih.','order'=>178],
            ['start_time'=>489.6,'end_time'=>491.86,'target_text'=>'Another one is kind of.','source_text'=>'Satu lagi ialah jenis (kind of).','order'=>179],
            ['start_time'=>491.96,'end_time'=>493.5,'target_text'=>'I\'m kind of tired.','source_text'=>'Saya agak penat.','order'=>180],
            ['start_time'=>493.6,'end_time'=>494.98,'target_text'=>'I\'m kind of excited.','source_text'=>'Saya agak teruja.','order'=>181],
            ['start_time'=>495.08,'end_time'=>495.94,'target_text'=>'It\'s just not really a lot.','source_text'=>'Ia tidaklah terlalu banyak.','order'=>182],
            ['start_time'=>496.04,'end_time'=>496.94,'target_text'=>'I\'m kind of.','source_text'=>'Saya agak.','order'=>183],
            ['start_time'=>497.04,'end_time'=>498.02,'target_text'=>'Another one is pretty.','source_text'=>'Satu lagi ialah cukup (pretty).','order'=>184],
            ['start_time'=>498.12,'end_time'=>499.66,'target_text'=>'I\'m pretty excited to go.','source_text'=>'Saya cukup teruja untuk pergi.','order'=>185],
            ['start_time'=>499.76,'end_time'=>500.94,'target_text'=>'I\'m pretty sad.','source_text'=>'Saya agak sedih.','order'=>186],
            ['start_time'=>501.04,'end_time'=>502.26,'target_text'=>'I\'m pretty happy.','source_text'=>'Saya agak gembira.','order'=>187],
            ['start_time'=>502.36,'end_time'=>506.3,'target_text'=>'It\'s a little bit higher higher up than saying a bit.','source_text'=>'Ia sedikit lebih tinggi berbanding menyebut \'a bit\'.','order'=>188],
            ['start_time'=>506.4,'end_time'=>508.34,'target_text'=>'And even higher than that is I\'m really.','source_text'=>'Dan lebih tinggi daripada itu ialah \'really\' (sungguh).','order'=>189],
            ['start_time'=>508.44,'end_time'=>509.54,'target_text'=>'I\'m really excited.','source_text'=>'Saya sungguh teruja.','order'=>190],
            ['start_time'=>509.64,'end_time'=>511.06,'target_text'=>'I\'m really happy.','source_text'=>'Saya sungguh gembira.','order'=>191],
            ['start_time'=>511.16,'end_time'=>511.86,'target_text'=>'I\'m really.','source_text'=>'Saya sungguh.','order'=>192],
            ['start_time'=>511.96,'end_time'=>513.46,'target_text'=>'That\'s a stronger emotion.','source_text'=>'Itu menunjukkan emosi yang lebih kuat.','order'=>193],
            ['start_time'=>513.56,'end_time'=>517.1,'target_text'=>'That just shows a stronger emotion and intensity.','source_text'=>'Ia menunjukkan emosi dan intensiti yang lebih kuat.','order'=>194],
            ['start_time'=>517.2,'end_time'=>518.14,'target_text'=>'Really.','source_text'=>'Sungguh.','order'=>195],
            ['start_time'=>518.24,'end_time'=>520.42,'target_text'=>'And finally, very.','source_text'=>'Dan akhir sekali, sangat (very).','order'=>196],
            ['start_time'=>520.52,'end_time'=>522.82,'target_text'=>'I am very sad.','source_text'=>'Saya sangat sedih.','order'=>197],
