            ['start_time'=>342.64,'end_time'=>343.74,'target_text'=>'>> The Jade Emperor.','source_text'=>'>> Maharaja Jed.','order'=>115],
            ['start_time'=>343.84,'end_time'=>345.22,'target_text'=>'>> Nah, the I I know.','source_text'=>'>> Bukan, saya tahu.','order'=>116],
            ['start_time'=>345.32,'end_time'=>348.54,'target_text'=>'Jade Emperor sounds cool, but I don\'t think that was ever a real person, was it?','source_text'=>'Maharaja Jed bunyinya hebat, tapi saya rasa bukan watak orang sebenar pun dalam sejarah, kan?','order'=>117],
            ['start_time'=>348.64,'end_time'=>349.7,'target_text'=>'>> I don\'t think so.','source_text'=>'>> Saya rasa bukan.','order'=>118],
            ['start_time'=>349.8,'end_time'=>350.54,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, probably not.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, mungkin tidak.','order'=>119],
            ['start_time'=>350.64,'end_time'=>352.5,'target_text'=>'I think that was just in like myth or something.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa itu cuma dalam mitos atau dongeng.','order'=>120],
            ['start_time'=>352.6,'end_time'=>354.18,'target_text'=>'That\'s the biggest building here, no?','source_text'=>'Itu bangunan terbesar di sini, kan?','order'=>121],
            ['start_time'=>354.28,'end_time'=>359.46,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, that\'s the center of this Forbidden >> And that\'s where like the throne room is?','source_text'=>'>> Ya, itu bahagian tengah Kota Larangan >> Dan di situlah bilik takhta berada?','order'=>122],
            ['start_time'=>359.56,'end_time'=>360.82,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, that\'s where the throne room is.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, di situlah terletaknya bilik takhta.','order'=>123],
            ['start_time'=>360.92,'end_time'=>365.62,'target_text'=>'>> Because there\'s also another big like square on that side, but we already passed through it.','source_text'=>'>> Sebab ada juga satu lagi kawasan lapang yang besar di sebelah sana, tapi kita dah lalu tadi.','order'=>124],
            ['start_time'=>365.72,'end_time'=>368.46,'target_text'=>'That\'s where the entrance is, like the big main gate entrance.','source_text'=>'Di situlah pintu masuknya, seperti gerbang pintu masuk utama.','order'=>125],
            ['start_time'=>368.56,'end_time'=>370.94,'target_text'=>'But this is, I guess, the throne room.','source_text'=>'Tapi ini, saya rasa, ialah bilik takhta.','order'=>126],
            ['start_time'=>371.04,'end_time'=>374.22,'target_text'=>'Should we go up to the throne room or should we go to the side here?','source_text'=>'Patut kita naik ke bilik takhta atau kita pergi ke sebelah tepi sini?','order'=>127],
            ['start_time'=>374.32,'end_time'=>377.94,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, let\'s go take a look and see if we can look inside of the throne room.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, jom pergi tengok kalau-kalau kita boleh jenguk bahagian dalam bilik takhta tu.','order'=>128],
            ['start_time'=>378.04,'end_time'=>382.86,'target_text'=>'>> I know we were up there earlier, so we weren\'t actually able to look in the throne room, but our tour guide showed us a','source_text'=>'>> Saya tahu tadi kita dah naik ke atas, jadi kita tak dapat betul-betul tengok dalam bilik takhta, tapi pemandu pelancong kita tunjukkan','order'=>129],
            ['start_time'=>382.96,'end_time'=>383.36,'target_text'=>'photo.','source_text'=>'sekeping gambar.','order'=>130],
            ['start_time'=>383.4,'end_time'=>386.06,'target_text'=>'You could just like search up on Google what the throne room looks like.','source_text'=>'Anda boleh cari di Google macam mana rupa bilik takhta tu.','order'=>131],
            ['start_time'=>386.16,'end_time'=>386.56,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya betul.','order'=>132],
            ['start_time'=>386.56,'end_time'=>389.34,'target_text'=>'>> But you can\'t go up there cuz you can\'t get close enough.','source_text'=>'>> Tapi anda tak boleh naik ke sana sebab anda tak boleh pergi cukup dekat.','order'=>133],
            ['start_time'=>389.44,'end_time'=>391.66,'target_text'=>'You can\'t walk up to it, so you can\'t really see.','source_text'=>'Anda tak boleh berjalan rapat ke situ, jadi anda tak boleh nampak sangat.','order'=>134],
            ['start_time'=>391.76,'end_time'=>396.98,'target_text'=>'>> And there\'s no lights inside of there, so >> And there are guards and security, so you can\'t actually like go in there.','source_text'=>'>> Dan tiada lampu di dalam sana, jadi >> Dan ada pengawal serta keselamatan, jadi anda tak boleh masuk ke dalam.','order'=>135],
            ['start_time'=>397.08,'end_time'=>400.38,'target_text'=>'But yeah, there are so many people here and a lot of like field trips.','source_text'=>'Tapi ya, ada terlalu ramai orang di sini dan banyak rombongan sekolah.','order'=>136],
            ['start_time'=>400.48,'end_time'=>403.7,'target_text'=>'Like you see all those people in the blue shirts?','source_text'=>'Macam anda nampak semua orang yang berbaju biru tu?','order'=>137],
            ['start_time'=>403.8,'end_time'=>404.9,'target_text'=>'Let\'s join the crowd.','source_text'=>'Jom kita sertai orang ramai.','order'=>138],
            ['start_time'=>405,'end_time'=>406.78,'target_text'=>'You could see everyone going up there.','source_text'=>'Anda boleh nampak semua orang sedang naik ke atas sana.','order'=>139],
            ['start_time'=>406.88,'end_time'=>409.9,'target_text'=>'It\'s like a waterfall of people climbing up the stairs.','source_text'=>'Ia macam air terjun manusia yang mendaki anak tangga.','order'=>140],
            ['start_time'=>410,'end_time'=>412.1,'target_text'=>'Okay, let\'s have a shadowing segment here.','source_text'=>'Baiklah, jom kita buat segmen \'shadowing\' di sini.','order'=>141],
            ['start_time'=>412.2,'end_time'=>415.18,'target_text'=>'This is like actually crazy beautiful.','source_text'=>'Tempat ni memang sangat-sangat indah.','order'=>142],
            ['start_time'=>415.28,'end_time'=>418.5,'target_text'=>'Let\'s have a shadowing segment right now.','source_text'=>'Jom kita buat segmen \'shadowing\' sekarang juga.','order'=>143],
            ['start_time'=>418.6,'end_time'=>425.58,'target_text'=>'>> We are in the Forbidden City in Beijing, and the first thing I notice is the sheer scale of this place.','source_text'=>'>> Kita sedang berada di Kota Larangan di Beijing, dan perkara pertama yang saya perhatikan ialah keluasan tempat ini yang luar biasa.','order'=>144],
            ['start_time'=>425.68,'end_time'=>431.34,'target_text'=>'The courtyard is absolutely enormous and it is filled with people from every direction.','source_text'=>'Halamannya amat besar dan dipenuhi orang ramai dari segenap penjuru.','order'=>145],
            ['start_time'=>431.44,'end_time'=>439.46,'target_text'=>'Tourists are walking, climbing, stopping, and taking pictures while the grand palace buildings stretch across the background','source_text'=>'Para pelancong sedang berjalan, mendaki, berhenti, dan mengambil gambar manakala bangunan istana yang megah terbentang di latar belakang','order'=>146],
            ['start_time'=>439.56,'end_time'=>442.42,'target_text'=>'with their golden roofs and deep red walls.','source_text'=>'dengan bumbung keemasan dan dinding merah pekat.','order'=>147],
            ['start_time'=>442.52,'end_time'=>449.26,'target_text'=>'Even under the cloudy sky, everything still looks majestic, historic, and strangely powerful.','source_text'=>'Walaupun di bawah langit mendung, segalanya masih kelihatan megah, bersejarah, dan mempunyai aura kehebatan tersendiri.','order'=>148],
            ['start_time'=>449.36,'end_time'=>454.62,'target_text'=>'As I walk up these stone steps, I can feel the energy of the place all around me.','source_text'=>'Sambil saya melangkah menaiki anak tangga batu ini, saya dapat merasakan tenaga tempat ini di sekeliling saya.','order'=>149],
            ['start_time'=>454.72,'end_time'=>456.3,'target_text'=>'There is movement everywhere.','source_text'=>'Ada pergerakan di mana-mana sahaja.','order'=>150],
            ['start_time'=>456.4,'end_time'=>461.66,'target_text'=>'People chatting, umbrellas opening, groups gathering, and cameras clicking.','source_text'=>'Orang ramai berbual, payung dibuka, kumpulan berkumpul, dan kamera berbunyi.','order'=>151],
            ['start_time'=>461.76,'end_time'=>469.78,'target_text'=>'Some visitors are moving slowly so they can admire the architecture whereas others are hurrying so they can see as much as','source_text'=>'Sesetengah pengunjung bergerak perlahan-lahan supaya mereka dapat menghayati seni bina manakala yang lain bergegas supaya dapat melihat sebanyak mungkin','order'=>152],
            ['start_time'=>469.88,'end_time'=>470.86,'target_text'=>'possible.','source_text'=>'yang boleh.','order'=>153],
            ['start_time'=>470.96,'end_time'=>474.98,'target_text'=>'The atmosphere is busy but it is not empty noise.','source_text'=>'Suasananya riuh tetapi bukanlah bunyi yang kosong.','order'=>154],
            ['start_time'=>475.08,'end_time'=>481.34,'target_text'=>'What amazes me the most is how this place can feel both ancient and immediate at the same time.','source_text'=>'Perkara yang paling mengagumkan saya ialah bagaimana tempat ini boleh terasa purba dan semasa pada waktu yang sama.','order'=>155],
            ['start_time'=>481.44,'end_time'=>489.58,'target_text'=>'Centuries ago emperors and officials would have crossed spaces like this and now thousands of ordinary people are doing exactly','source_text'=>'Berabad-abad yang lalu para maharaja dan pembesar melintasi ruang seperti ini dan kini ribuan orang biasa melakukan perkara yang sama','order'=>156],
            ['start_time'=>489.68,'end_time'=>490.22,'target_text'=>'that.','source_text'=>'persis.','order'=>157],
            ['start_time'=>490.32,'end_time'=>493.7,'target_text'=>'It makes me think about time in a very vivid way.','source_text'=>'Ia membuatkan saya memikirkan tentang peredaran masa dengan cara yang sangat jelas.','order'=>158],
            ['start_time'=>493.8,'end_time'=>496.94,'target_text'=>'We are not merely looking at history from a distance.','source_text'=>'Kita bukan sekadar melihat sejarah dari kejauhan.','order'=>159],
            ['start_time'=>497.04,'end_time'=>504.02,'target_text'=>'We are physically standing inside it, walking through it and becoming however briefly part of its story.','source_text'=>'Kita secara fizikal sedang berdiri di dalamnya, berjalan melaluinya dan menjadi sebahagian daripada kisahnya walaupun seketika.','order'=>160],
            ['start_time'=>504.12,'end_time'=>509.94,'target_text'=>'Honestly, the Forbidden City is one of those places that feels bigger than photos can capture.','source_text'=>'Sejujurnya, Kota Larangan adalah salah satu tempat yang terasa jauh lebih luas daripada apa yang mampu dirakam oleh gambar.','order'=>161],
            ['start_time'=>510.04,'end_time'=>513.02,'target_text'=>'Okay, we\'re now at the top and this is the palace in front of us.','source_text'=>'Baiklah, kita kini berada di puncak dan ini adalah istana di hadapan kita.','order'=>162],
            ['start_time'=>513.12,'end_time'=>514.62,'target_text'=>'It\'s so beautiful.','source_text'=>'Ia sangat indah.','order'=>163],
            ['start_time'=>514.72,'end_time'=>517.46,'target_text'=>'You can see on the right side there there are animals.','source_text'=>'Anda boleh nampak di sebelah kanan sana ada patung haiwan.','order'=>164],
            ['start_time'=>517.56,'end_time'=>519.9,'target_text'=>'Same thing with the left side.','source_text'=>'Sama juga di sebelah kiri.','order'=>165],
            ['start_time'=>520,'end_time'=>521.66,'target_text'=>'Damn,','source_text'=>'Wah,','order'=>166],
            ['start_time'=>521.76,'end_time'=>522.42,'target_text'=>'it\'s beautiful.','source_text'=>'ia sangat cantik.','order'=>167],
            ['start_time'=>522.52,'end_time'=>523.1,'target_text'=>'What do you think?','source_text'=>'Apa pendapat awak?','order'=>168],
            ['start_time'=>523.2,'end_time'=>526.58,'target_text'=>'>> I think it\'s really nice but I really want to see inside.','source_text'=>'>> Saya rasa ia sangat cantik tapi saya teringin sangat nak tengok bahagian dalamnya.','order'=>169],
            ['start_time'=>526.68,'end_time'=>532.5,'target_text'=>'Like you could see inside there\'s no lights or anything so >> Yeah, it\'s very hard to see inside the throne room but there','source_text'=>'Macam anda boleh nampak di dalam sana tiada lampu atau apa-apa jadi >> Ya, sangat susah nak nampak dalam bilik takhta tapi memang','order'=>170],
            ['start_time'=>532.6,'end_time'=>533.98,'target_text'=>'is a throne in there.','source_text'=>'ada sebuah takhta di dalam sana.','order'=>171],
            ['start_time'=>534.08,'end_time'=>539.14,'target_text'=>'And you can see there is a security guard standing on the outside to make sure no one comes in.','source_text'=>'Dan anda boleh nampak ada pengawal keselamatan berdiri di luar untuk pastikan tiada siapa yang masuk.','order'=>172],
            ['start_time'=>539.24,'end_time'=>541.5,'target_text'=>'There also is a fence.','source_text'=>'Ada juga pagar penghadang.','order'=>173],
            ['start_time'=>541.6,'end_time'=>545.66,'target_text'=>'Look at the beautiful details and design of this palace.','source_text'=>'Lihatlah butiran dan reka bentuk yang cantik pada istana ini.','order'=>174],
            ['start_time'=>545.76,'end_time'=>548.46,'target_text'=>'It says please do not touch.','source_text'=>'Tertulis di situ \'sila jangan sentuh\'.','order'=>175],
            ['start_time'=>548.56,'end_time'=>549.38,'target_text'=>'>> Are they touching?','source_text'=>'>> Orang sentuh ke?','order'=>176],
            ['start_time'=>549.48,'end_time'=>550.38,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>177],
            ['start_time'=>550.48,'end_time'=>552.1,'target_text'=>'Yeah, that guy is security.','source_text'=>'Ya, orang tu ialah pengawal keselamatan.','order'=>178],
            ['start_time'=>552.2,'end_time'=>553.82,'target_text'=>'We kind of see inside there.','source_text'=>'Kita boleh nampak sedikit ke dalam sana.','order'=>179],
            ['start_time'=>553.92,'end_time'=>555.94,'target_text'=>'These look like marble steps, right?','source_text'=>'Ini nampak seperti anak tangga marmar, kan?','order'=>180],
            ['start_time'=>556.04,'end_time'=>556.66,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>181],
            ['start_time'=>556.76,'end_time'=>557.86,'target_text'=>'This looks like marble.','source_text'=>'Ini nampak macam marmar.','order'=>182],
            ['start_time'=>557.96,'end_time'=>561.42,'target_text'=>'So let\'s walk down these steps and here it says mind your step.','source_text'=>'Jadi jom kita turun tangga ni dan di sini tertulis \'hati-hati melangkah\'.','order'=>183],
            ['start_time'=>561.52,'end_time'=>563.3,'target_text'=>'That just means be careful.','source_text'=>'Itu bermaksud berhati-hati.','order'=>184],
            ['start_time'=>563.4,'end_time'=>566.98,'target_text'=>'And you can see there are more people down there that are coming out from that gate.','source_text'=>'Dan anda boleh nampak ada lebih ramai orang di bawah sana yang sedang keluar dari pintu gerbang itu.','order'=>185],
            ['start_time'=>567.08,'end_time'=>568.1,'target_text'=>'>> These are all marble, too.','source_text'=>'>> Ini semua marmar juga.','order'=>186],
            ['start_time'=>568.2,'end_time'=>569.22,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, this is marble.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, ini marmar.','order'=>187],
            ['start_time'=>569.32,'end_time'=>570.42,'target_text'=>'This is marble as well.','source_text'=>'Ini pun marmar juga.','order'=>188],
            ['start_time'=>570.52,'end_time'=>574.66,'target_text'=>'And you can see Leon is holding my hat because I am holding the camera.','source_text'=>'Dan anda boleh nampak Leon sedang pegang topi saya sebab saya sedang pegang kamera.','order'=>189],
            ['start_time'=>574.76,'end_time'=>576.22,'target_text'=>'So he\'s holding the hat now.','source_text'=>'Jadi dia yang pegang topi sekarang.','order'=>190],
            ['start_time'=>576.32,'end_time'=>581.22,'target_text'=>'Okay, what do you think of the Forbidden City so far?','source_text'=>'Baiklah, apa pendapat awak tentang Kota Larangan setakat ini?','order'=>191],
            ['start_time'=>581.32,'end_time'=>585.82,'target_text'=>'>> So far, I think it\'s one of the coolest like ancient sites I\'ve ever visited.','source_text'=>'>> Setakat ini, saya rasa ia antara tapak purba paling menarik yang pernah saya lawati.','order'=>192],
            ['start_time'=>585.92,'end_time'=>586.66,'target_text'=>'Like >> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Macam >> Ya betul.','order'=>193],
            ['start_time'=>586.76,'end_time'=>590.3,'target_text'=>'>> I would put this on the level of','source_text'=>'>> Saya boleh letakkan tempat ini setaraf dengan','order'=>194],
            ['start_time'=>590.4,'end_time'=>591.86,'target_text'=>'like the Great Pyramids or something.','source_text'=>'seperti Piramid Agung atau seumpamanya.','order'=>195],
            ['start_time'=>591.96,'end_time'=>593.34,'target_text'=>'I\'ve never been >> China.','source_text'=>'Saya belum pernah sampai >> China.','order'=>196],
            ['start_time'=>593.44,'end_time'=>597.26,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, well, Great Wall of China, but like the Great Pyramids in Egypt.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, Tembok Besar China, tapi macam Piramid Agung di Mesir.','order'=>197],
            ['start_time'=>597.36,'end_time'=>599.5,'target_text'=>'I haven\'t been there, but I would put that on the same level.','source_text'=>'Saya belum pernah pergi ke sana, tapi saya boleh letakkan ia pada tahap yang sama.','order'=>198],
            ['start_time'=>599.6,'end_time'=>601.5,'target_text'=>'Like it\'s just amazing.','source_text'=>'Sebab ia memang sangat menakjubkan.','order'=>199],
            ['start_time'=>601.6,'end_time'=>606.34,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I mean like the first time I ever saw the Forbidden City was on like a random YouTube video.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, maksud saya kali pertama saya melihat Kota Larangan adalah dalam sebuah video YouTube secara rawak.','order'=>200],
            ['start_time'=>606.44,'end_time'=>611.46,'target_text'=>'And after I saw it, I was like, \"Dude, I need to visit this place.\" It just looked so like beautiful.','source_text'=>'Dan selepas saya melihatnya, saya rasa, \'Bro, saya mesti kena melawat tempat ni.\' Ia nampak sangat indah.','order'=>201],
            ['start_time'=>611.56,'end_time'=>611.76,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya betul.','order'=>202],
            ['start_time'=>611.76,'end_time'=>617.18,'target_text'=>'>> And I\'ve also seen like other places on like Instagram or YouTube in China, but like in the mountains.','source_text'=>'>> Dan saya juga pernah nampak tempat-tempat lain di Instagram atau YouTube di China, tapi di kawasan pergunungan.','order'=>203],
            ['start_time'=>617.28,'end_time'=>618.5,'target_text'=>'Like it\'s a monastery or something.','source_text'=>'Macam biara atau sesuatu.','order'=>204],
            ['start_time'=>618.6,'end_time'=>619.14,'target_text'=>'Have you seen those?','source_text'=>'Awak pernah nampak tempat macam tu tak?','order'=>205],
            ['start_time'=>619.24,'end_time'=>620.54,'target_text'=>'And it\'s like snow covered.','source_text'=>'Dan ia dilitupi salji.','order'=>206],
            ['start_time'=>620.64,'end_time'=>624.82,'target_text'=>'>> Or they build like into the cliff and it\'s like, \"How do they even put that there?\" >> Yeah, I know.','source_text'=>'>> Atau mereka bina melekat pada tebing bukit dan kita tertanya-tanya, \'Macam mana mereka bina benda tu kat situ?\' >> Ya, saya tahu.','order'=>207],
            ['start_time'=>624.92,'end_time'=>626.22,'target_text'=>'It\'s really, really beautiful.','source_text'=>'Ia memang sangat-sangat indah.','order'=>208],
            ['start_time'=>626.32,'end_time'=>629.86,'target_text'=>'I think this is probably my favorite like historical palace I\'ve ever been to.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa ini mungkin istana bersejarah kegemaran saya yang pernah saya lawati.','order'=>209],
            ['start_time'=>629.96,'end_time'=>630.62,'target_text'=>'>> Definitely.','source_text'=>'>> Semestinya.','order'=>210],
            ['start_time'=>630.72,'end_time'=>632.22,'target_text'=>'>> And the name is like super cool.','source_text'=>'>> Dan namanya pun sangat gempak.','order'=>211],
            ['start_time'=>632.32,'end_time'=>633.54,'target_text'=>'The Forbidden City.','source_text'=>'Kota Larangan (The Forbidden City).','order'=>212],
            ['start_time'=>633.64,'end_time'=>634,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>213],
            ['start_time'=>634,'end_time'=>635.02,'target_text'=>'>> That\'s actually tough.','source_text'=>'>> Memang padu namanya.','order'=>214],
            ['start_time'=>635.12,'end_time'=>637.42,'target_text'=>'>> even know like the Chinese name, right?','source_text'=>'>> Tahu tak nama bahasa Cinanya?','order'=>215],
            ['start_time'=>637.52,'end_time'=>637.92,'target_text'=>'>> I don\'t know.','source_text'=>'>> Saya tak tahu.','order'=>216],
            ['start_time'=>638,'end_time'=>638.5,'target_text'=>'>> know it?','source_text'=>'>> Awak tahu ke?','order'=>217],
            ['start_time'=>638.6,'end_time'=>640.58,'target_text'=>'>> I don\'t know, but it\'s just the Forbidden City.','source_text'=>'>> Saya tak tahu, tapi namanya memang Kota Larangan.','order'=>218],
            ['start_time'=>640.68,'end_time'=>641.58,'target_text'=>'Super cool name.','source_text'=>'Nama yang sangat hebat.','order'=>219],
            ['start_time'=>641.68,'end_time'=>644.34,'target_text'=>'So, I want you guys to also answer these questions.','source_text'=>'Jadi, saya nak korang pun jawab soalan-soalan ni.','order'=>220],
            ['start_time'=>644.44,'end_time'=>647.38,'target_text'=>'How do you like feel, you know, walking through the city?','source_text'=>'Apa perasaan korang bila berjalan melintasi kota purba ini?','order'=>221],
            ['start_time'=>647.48,'end_time'=>651.3,'target_text'=>'>> Well, as of like right now, I feel a little bit tired.','source_text'=>'>> Dari sudut pandangan saya sekarang, saya rasa agak penat sedikit.','order'=>222],
            ['start_time'=>651.4,'end_time'=>659.26,'target_text'=>'I feel hot, but I\'m also excited to see what else we can look at in the Forbidden City cuz we\'ve explored maybe 20% of it.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa panas, tapi saya juga teruja nak tengok apa lagi yang ada dalam Kota Larangan sebab kita baru teroka mungkin 20% daripadanya.','order'=>223],
            ['start_time'=>659.36,'end_time'=>660.94,'target_text'=>'Like there\'s just so much more to see.','source_text'=>'Masih banyak lagi benda yang boleh dilihat.','order'=>224],
            ['start_time'=>661.04,'end_time'=>662.38,'target_text'=>'It\'s a It\'s a huge area.','source_text'=>'Kawasannya memang sangat luas.','order'=>225],
            ['start_time'=>662.48,'end_time'=>666.3,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, we\'ve been here for about almost 3 hours, I would say, right?','source_text'=>'>> Ya, kita dah berada di sini selama hampir 3 jam, saya rasa, kan?','order'=>226],
            ['start_time'=>666.4,'end_time'=>668.38,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, it\'s 11:15.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, sekarang pukul 11:15.','order'=>227],
            ['start_time'=>668.48,'end_time'=>671.82,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, we got here actually over 3 hours cuz we got here at 8:00.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, kita sampai sini sebenarnya lebih 3 jam sebab kita bertolak pukul 8:00.','order'=>228],
            ['start_time'=>671.92,'end_time'=>673.06,'target_text'=>'Or no, we left at 8:00.','source_text'=>'Eh tak, kita bertolak pukul 8:00.','order'=>229],
            ['start_time'=>673.16,'end_time'=>674.34,'target_text'=>'We got here at 9:00.','source_text'=>'Kita sampai sini pukul 9:00.','order'=>230],
            ['start_time'=>674.44,'end_time'=>677.22,'target_text'=>'We got here at 9:00 and it\'s almost been 3 hours.','source_text'=>'Kita sampai sini pukul 9:00 dan sekarang dah hampir 3 jam.','order'=>231],
            ['start_time'=>677.32,'end_time'=>677.78,'target_text'=>'>> Pretty much.','source_text'=>'>> Lebih kuranglah.','order'=>232],
            ['start_time'=>677.88,'end_time'=>683.66,'target_text'=>'>> But honestly, I don\'t feel too tired and I don\'t really feel like I\'m sweating, but I know my clothes is soaking wet.','source_text'=>'>> Tapi sejujurnya, saya tak rasa terlalu letih dan saya tak rasa sangat saya sedang berpeluh, walaupun saya tahu baju saya dah basah kuyup.','order'=>233],
            ['start_time'=>683.76,'end_time'=>685.62,'target_text'=>'I know I\'m sweating, but I can\'t really feel it though.','source_text'=>'Saya tahu saya berpeluh, cuma saya tak berapa perasan.','order'=>234],
            ['start_time'=>685.72,'end_time'=>686.7,'target_text'=>'>> Especially my back.','source_text'=>'>> Terutamanya bahagian belakang saya.','order'=>235],
            ['start_time'=>686.8,'end_time'=>689.78,'target_text'=>'The part that\'s sitting on my backpack, it\'s soaking wet.','source_text'=>'Bahagian yang bersentuhan dengan beg sandang saya, memang basah kuyup.','order'=>236],
            ['start_time'=>689.88,'end_time'=>691.14,'target_text'=>'>> This outfit is thick.','source_text'=>'>> Pakaian ni tebal.','order'=>237],
            ['start_time'=>691.24,'end_time'=>692.14,'target_text'=>'Feel it.','source_text'=>'Cuba rasa.','order'=>238],
            ['start_time'=>692.24,'end_time'=>693.26,'target_text'=>'Feel that material.','source_text'=>'Rasa kain bahan ni.','order'=>239],
            ['start_time'=>693.36,'end_time'=>693.78,'target_text'=>'>> Damn.','source_text'=>'>> Wah.','order'=>240],
            ['start_time'=>693.88,'end_time'=>695.34,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s so thick, dude.','source_text'=>'>> Tebal gila, bro.','order'=>241],
            ['start_time'=>695.44,'end_time'=>695.84,'target_text'=>'>> That\'s brutal.','source_text'=>'>> Memang menyeksa.','order'=>242],
            ['start_time'=>695.92,'end_time'=>701.66,'target_text'=>'>> That what I What I put it on, I was like, \"Dude, thank god today is like max like a high of 27, 28.\" >> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Masa saya pakai tadi, saya rasa, \'Bro, mujurlah hari ini suhu tertinggi sekitar 27, 28 darjah je.\' >> Ya betul.','order'=>243],
            ['start_time'=>701.76,'end_time'=>702.98,'target_text'=>'>> Because it\'s actually so hot.','source_text'=>'>> Sebab cuacanya memang sangat panas.','order'=>244],
            ['start_time'=>703.08,'end_time'=>707.58,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, it\'s nice and cloudy, too, which is good for like being outside, but also good for filming.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, mujur juga mendung dan berawan, yang bagus untuk aktiviti luar, dan juga sangat bagus untuk merakam video.','order'=>245],
            ['start_time'=>707.68,'end_time'=>709.54,'target_text'=>'It makes the video so much better.','source_text'=>'Ia jadikan kualiti video jauh lebih baik.','order'=>246],
            ['start_time'=>709.64,'end_time'=>713.66,'target_text'=>'>> been out like twice for like a couple minutes at a time, and it was so hot.','source_text'=>'>> Matahari keluar dalam dua kali untuk beberapa minit sahaja, dan waktu tu panasnya luar biasa.','order'=>247],
            ['start_time'=>713.76,'end_time'=>714.22,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Oh ya betul.','order'=>248],
            ['start_time'=>714.32,'end_time'=>717.18,'target_text'=>'>> I could not do it if the sun just came out and stayed out.','source_text'=>'>> Saya takkan tahan kalau matahari terik terus menyinar tanpa henti.','order'=>249],
            ['start_time'=>717.28,'end_time'=>719.34,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, you can feel it all over your body.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, rasa bahangnya ke seluruh badan.','order'=>250],
            ['start_time'=>719.44,'end_time'=>719.9,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya betul.','order'=>251],
            ['start_time'=>720,'end_time'=>724.82,'target_text'=>'But you guys missed it on camera cuz we couldn\'t record it, but monk came and asked for a photo, too.','source_text'=>'Tapi korang terlepas momen tu dalam kamera sebab kita tak sempat rakam, tadi ada seorang sami datang dan minta nak bergambar juga.','order'=>252],
            ['start_time'=>724.92,'end_time'=>731.54,'target_text'=>'So, so far I\'ve taken photos with students, really, really old people, or really, really elderly people.','source_text'=>'Jadi, setakat ini saya dah bergambar dengan pelajar, orang yang sangat-sangat berumur, atau warga emas.','order'=>253],
            ['start_time'=>731.64,'end_time'=>734.7,'target_text'=>'You can say old people, but it\'s a little like disrespectful, rude.','source_text'=>'Anda boleh sebut orang tua, tapi bunyinya agak kurang sopan atau kasar.','order'=>254],
            ['start_time'=>734.8,'end_time'=>738.02,'target_text'=>'It\'s better to just say >> Well, you could say older.','source_text'=>'Lebih baik gunakan istilah >> Anda boleh sebut yang lebih berumur.','order'=>255],
            ['start_time'=>738.12,'end_time'=>739.02,'target_text'=>'>> or older people.','source_text'=>'>> atau orang yang lebih tua.','order'=>256],
            ['start_time'=>739.12,'end_time'=>739.54,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>257],
            ['start_time'=>739.64,'end_time'=>742.42,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, that\'s a nicer way to say it rather than saying old people.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, itu cara yang lebih sopan untuk bercakap berbanding menyebut orang tua.','order'=>258],
            ['start_time'=>742.52,'end_time'=>743.46,'target_text'=>'That\'s a little bit rude.','source_text'=>'Itu agak kurang sopan.','order'=>259],
            ['start_time'=>743.56,'end_time'=>745.3,'target_text'=>'And third, a monk.','source_text'=>'Dan yang ketiga, seorang sami.','order'=>260],
            ['start_time'=>745.4,'end_time'=>746.86,'target_text'=>'>> What was his name?','source_text'=>'>> Siapa nama dia?','order'=>261],
            ['start_time'=>746.96,'end_time'=>747.46,'target_text'=>'>> I don\'t know.','source_text'=>'>> Saya tak tahu.','order'=>262],
            ['start_time'=>747.56,'end_time'=>749.1,'target_text'=>'>> Did he introduce himself?','source_text'=>'>> Dia ada perkenalkan diri tak?','order'=>263],
            ['start_time'=>749.2,'end_time'=>749.88,'target_text'=>'>> No, it was funny.','source_text'=>'>> Tak, kelakar betul.','order'=>264],
            ['start_time'=>749.98,'end_time'=>753.98,'target_text'=>'[laughter] He kind of just like gave his phone to his friend, tapped me, and he\'s like pointed to the phone.','source_text'=>'[ketawa] Dia cuma serahkan telefonnya pada kawannya, tepuk bahu saya, dan dia tunjuk pada telefonnya.','order'=>265],
            ['start_time'=>754.08,'end_time'=>756.02,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, he He told you you\'re taking a picture.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, dia cuma beritahu awak yang korang akan bergambar.','order'=>266],
            ['start_time'=>756.12,'end_time'=>758.22,'target_text'=>'>> \"Yeah, yes, yes, yes, sir.','source_text'=>'>> \'Ya, ya, ya, tuan.','order'=>267],
            ['start_time'=>758.32,'end_time'=>760.46,'target_text'=>'Yes, monk.\" And then we took a flick.','source_text'=>'Ya, sami.\' Lepas tu kita pun bergambar.','order'=>268],
            ['start_time'=>760.56,'end_time'=>761.02,'target_text'=>'Got flicked up.','source_text'=>'Dapat juga bergambar.','order'=>269],
            ['start_time'=>761.12,'end_time'=>762.62,'target_text'=>'Too bad we couldn\'t record that part.','source_text'=>'Sayangnya kita tak sempat rakam bahagian tu.','order'=>270],
            ['start_time'=>762.72,'end_time'=>766.1,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I wonder what kind of monk they were though, like Buddhist probably.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, saya tertanya-tanya sami aliran apa mereka tu, mungkin sami Buddha rasanya.','order'=>271],
            ['start_time'=>766.2,'end_time'=>769.26,'target_text'=>'>> I\'m pretty tired, but we have a lot more of the city to explore.','source_text'=>'>> Saya agak penat, tapi masih banyak bahagian kota yang kita belum teroka.','order'=>272],
            ['start_time'=>769.36,'end_time'=>775.06,'target_text'=>'We just [clears throat] wanted to take this moment to stop, have a native English conversation in a area where we\'re able','source_text'=>'Kita cuma [berdehem] nak ambil ruang masa ini untuk berhenti sekejap, berbual dalam Bahasa Inggeris natif di kawasan di mana kita boleh','order'=>273],
            ['start_time'=>775.16,'end_time'=>777.7,'target_text'=>'to talk clearly and slowly.','source_text'=>'bercakap dengan jelas dan perlahan.','order'=>274],
            ['start_time'=>777.8,'end_time'=>779.5,'target_text'=>'So,','source_text'=>'Jadi,','order'=>275],
            ['start_time'=>779.6,'end_time'=>780.18,'target_text'=>'what?','source_text'=>'apa dia?','order'=>276],
            ['start_time'=>780.28,'end_time'=>782.14,'target_text'=>'>> You just like spit all over me, though.','source_text'=>'>> Awak baru je tersembur air liur kat saya tadi.','order'=>277],
            ['start_time'=>782.24,'end_time'=>782.64,'target_text'=>'>> I?','source_text'=>'>> Saya?','order'=>278],
            ['start_time'=>782.73,'end_time'=>784.06,'target_text'=>'>> [laughter] >> I didn\'t even notice.','source_text'=>'>> [ketawa] >> Saya langsung tak perasan.','order'=>279],
            ['start_time'=>784.16,'end_time'=>785.7,'target_text'=>'>> Like that word >> Which one?','source_text'=>'>> Macam perkataan tu >> Yang mana satu?','order'=>280],
            ['start_time'=>785.8,'end_time'=>788.08,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s like a spit curl.','source_text'=>'>> Ada percikan air liur keluar.','order'=>281],
            ['start_time'=>790,'end_time'=>792.48,'target_text'=>'>> Let\'s get up and get going.','source_text'=>'>> Jom kita bangun dan teruskan berjalan.','order'=>282],
            ['start_time'=>796.16,'end_time'=>796.98,'target_text'=>'Okay.','source_text'=>'Baiklah.','order'=>283],
            ['start_time'=>797.08,'end_time'=>798.38,'target_text'=>'Yeah, let\'s go.','source_text'=>'Ya, jom gerak.','order'=>284],
            ['start_time'=>798.48,'end_time'=>799.62,'target_text'=>'Let\'s go.','source_text'=>'Jom gerak.','order'=>285],
            ['start_time'=>799.72,'end_time'=>800.66,'target_text'=>'>> Damn, bro.','source_text'=>'>> Fuh, bro.','order'=>286],
            ['start_time'=>800.76,'end_time'=>802.58,'target_text'=>'That\'s like 15 minutes of footage right there.','source_text'=>'Dah dapat rakaman sepanjang 15 minit kat situ.','order'=>287],
            ['start_time'=>802.68,'end_time'=>806.34,'target_text'=>'>> Let\'s go before more people ask for photo cuz then it\'s like it never stops.','source_text'=>'>> Jom kita gerak sebelum ada lebih ramai orang minta bergambar sebab kalau mula, memang tak berhenti.','order'=>288],
            ['start_time'=>806.44,'end_time'=>808.1,'target_text'=>'That\'s probably like the third batch.','source_text'=>'Itu mungkin kumpulan yang ketiga dah.','order'=>289],
            ['start_time'=>808.2,'end_time'=>808.86,'target_text'=>'That\'s pretty cool.','source_text'=>'Menarik juga.','order'=>290],
            ['start_time'=>808.96,'end_time'=>809.32,'target_text'=>'Let\'s keep going.','source_text'=>'Jom kita teruskan jalan.','order'=>291],
            ['start_time'=>809.32,'end_time'=>812.9,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s like what do they call that when one thing happens after the other?','source_text'=>'>> Apa nama panggilan bila satu perkara berlaku berturut-turut selepas perkara lain?','order'=>292],
            ['start_time'=>813,'end_time'=>814.86,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s just like a domino effect.','source_text'=>'>> Ia dipanggil kesan domino (domino effect).','order'=>293],
            ['start_time'=>814.96,'end_time'=>815.7,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, exactly.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, tepat sekali.','order'=>294],
            ['start_time'=>815.8,'end_time'=>817.94,'target_text'=>'>> One photo, two photo, 100 photos.','source_text'=>'>> Satu gambar, dua gambar, sampai 100 keping gambar.','order'=>295],
            ['start_time'=>818.04,'end_time'=>818.62,'target_text'=>'But I don\'t mind.','source_text'=>'Tapi saya tak kisah pun.','order'=>296],
            ['start_time'=>818.72,'end_time'=>820.78,'target_text'=>'I feel like if I\'m drip drip or drown.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa bila saya bergaya segak macam ni.','order'=>297],
            ['start_time'=>820.88,'end_time'=>822.96,'target_text'=>'I got motion.','source_text'=>'Saya ada tarikan dan aura tersendiri.','order'=>298],
            ['start_time'=>823.32,'end_time'=>824.7,'target_text'=>'I got motion, bro.','source_text'=>'Saya ada gaya tersendiri, bro.','order'=>299],
            ['start_time'=>824.8,'end_time'=>825.22,'target_text'=>'>> For real?','source_text'=>'>> Biar betul?','order'=>300],
            ['start_time'=>825.32,'end_time'=>826.82,'target_text'=>'>> I got motion in the Forbidden City.','source_text'=>'>> Saya ada aura gaya di Kota Larangan ni.','order'=>301],
            ['start_time'=>826.92,'end_time'=>828.5,'target_text'=>'Cuz I guess no one got the motion like this.','source_text'=>'Sebab saya rasa tiada orang lain yang bergaya macam ni.','order'=>302],
            ['start_time'=>828.6,'end_time'=>829,'target_text'=>'Check it out.','source_text'=>'Tengoklah sendiri.','order'=>303],
            ['start_time'=>829.08,'end_time'=>832.3,'target_text'=>'>> not seen anybody wearing gold.','source_text'=>'>> tak nampak sesiapa pun yang pakai warna emas.','order'=>304],
            ['start_time'=>832.4,'end_time'=>833.07,'target_text'=>'>> Come on, bro.','source_text'=>'>> Ayuhlah, bro.','order'=>305],
            ['start_time'=>833.17,'end_time'=>834.7,'target_text'=>'>> [laughter]','source_text'=>'>> [ketawa]','order'=>306],
            ['start_time'=>834.8,'end_time'=>837.82,'target_text'=>'>> Don\'t just watch this lesson and forget it.','source_text'=>'>> Jangan sekadar tonton video pembelajaran ini dan melupakannya begitu sahaja.','order'=>307],
            ['start_time'=>837.92,'end_time'=>845.14,'target_text'=>'Get the workbook for this video on my website and practice everything from the lesson more deeply.','source_text'=>'Dapatkan buku latihan (workbook) untuk video ini di laman web saya dan latih semua isi pelajaran dengan lebih mendalam.','order'=>308],
            ['start_time'=>845.24,'end_time'=>854.86,'target_text'=>'Inside, you\'ll review the grammar, vocabulary, tenses, sentence patterns, comprehension questions, and real English from this','source_text'=>'Di dalamnya, anda akan mengulang kaji tatabahasa, kosa kata, kala masa (tenses), pola ayat, soalan kefahaman, dan Bahasa Inggeris sebenar daripada','order'=>309],
            ['start_time'=>854.96,'end_time'=>859.3,'target_text'=>'video with clear explanations and exercises.','source_text'=>'video ini berserta penerangan yang jelas dan latihan praktikal.','order'=>310],
            ['start_time'=>859.4,'end_time'=>864.62,'target_text'=>'Watching helps you understand, but practicing helps you remember.','source_text'=>'Menonton membantu anda memahami, tetapi membuat latihan membantu anda mengingati.','order'=>311],
            ['start_time'=>864.72,'end_time'=>869.9,'target_text'=>'And when you buy five or more workbooks, you automatically get 30% off at checkout.','source_text'=>'Dan apabila anda membeli lima atau lebih buku latihan, anda akan mendapat potongan 30% secara automatik semasa pembayaran.','order'=>312],
            ['start_time'=>870,'end_time'=>873.7,'target_text'=>'The link is in the description or at vulcaenglish.com.','source_text'=>'Pautannya ada di ruangan deskripsi atau di volkaenglish.com.','order'=>313],
            ['start_time'=>873.8,'end_time'=>874.58,'target_text'=>'>> So what do you think is in there?','source_text'=>'>> Jadi apa yang awak rasa ada di dalam sana?','order'=>314],
            ['start_time'=>874.68,'end_time'=>875.86,'target_text'=>'What\'s the prediction?','source_text'=>'Apa ramalan awak?','order'=>315],
            ['start_time'=>875.96,'end_time'=>877.86,'target_text'=>'>> Probably a throne room, I would say.','source_text'=>'>> Mungkin bilik takhta, saya rasa.','order'=>316],
            ['start_time'=>877.96,'end_time'=>879.02,'target_text'=>'But there are just too many people.','source_text'=>'Tapi ada terlalu ramai orang.','order'=>317],
            ['start_time'=>879.12,'end_time'=>884.66,'target_text'=>'Let\'s just keep on going around cuz this city is really big, so >> Well, it looks like we can go inside of it.','source_text'=>'Jom kita terus berjalan pusing kawasan ni sebab kota ni sangat besar, jadi >> Nampaknya macam kita boleh masuk ke dalam.','order'=>318],
            ['start_time'=>884.76,'end_time'=>885.66,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, you think so?','source_text'=>'>> Oh, awak rasa boleh ke?','order'=>319],
            ['start_time'=>885.76,'end_time'=>888.02,'target_text'=>'>> Well, people are walking in from the side there, right?','source_text'=>'>> Orang ramai sedang berjalan masuk dari sebelah sana, kan?','order'=>320],
            ['start_time'=>888.12,'end_time'=>889.62,'target_text'=>'Okay, let\'s go and check it out.','source_text'=>'Baiklah, jom kita pergi tengok.','order'=>321],
            ['start_time'=>889.72,'end_time'=>891.14,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, damn.','source_text'=>'>> Wah, tengok tu.','order'=>322],
            ['start_time'=>891.24,'end_time'=>892.74,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, get in front of that group.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, masuk ke hadapan kumpulan tu.','order'=>323],
            ['start_time'=>892.84,'end_time'=>894.1,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, a lot of kids.','source_text'=>'>> Ramai budak-budak.','order'=>324],
            ['start_time'=>894.2,'end_time'=>895.22,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, no.','source_text'=>'>> Alamak.','order'=>325],
            ['start_time'=>895.32,'end_time'=>896.86,'target_text'=>'>> Ni hao.','source_text'=>'>> Ni hao.','order'=>326],
            ['start_time'=>896.96,'end_time'=>899.22,'target_text'=>'I was just laughed at by a group of kids.','source_text'=>'Saya baru je diketawakan oleh sekumpulan budak-budak.','order'=>327],
            ['start_time'=>899.32,'end_time'=>902.98,'target_text'=>'They looked at me, laughed, looked back at their friend, looked at me again, laughed.','source_text'=>'Mereka pandang saya, gelak, pandang kawan mereka, pandang saya balik, lepas tu gelak lagi.','order'=>328],
            ['start_time'=>903.08,'end_time'=>904.02,'target_text'=>'That\'s brutal.','source_text'=>'Pedih betul rasanya.','order'=>329],
            ['start_time'=>904.12,'end_time'=>905.54,'target_text'=>'>> What are you feeling right now?','source_text'=>'>> Apa yang awak rasa sekarang ni?','order'=>330],
            ['start_time'=>905.64,'end_time'=>906.58,'target_text'=>'>> I would low-key cry, bro.','source_text'=>'>> Saya rasa nak menangis je, bro.','order'=>331],
            ['start_time'=>906.68,'end_time'=>910.64,'target_text'=>'If a kid laughs at you, that means you doing something wrong.','source_text'=>'Bila budak-budak ketawakan awak, maknanya ada benda yang tak kena dengan diri awak.','order'=>332],
            ['start_time'=>911.12,'end_time'=>912.54,'target_text'=>'>> For real.','source_text'=>'>> Memang betul.','order'=>333],
            ['start_time'=>912.64,'end_time'=>915.1,'target_text'=>'>> Ooh, in here it\'s a lot cooler.','source_text'=>'>> Ooh, di dalam sini suasananya jauh lebih sejuk.','order'=>334],
            ['start_time'=>915.2,'end_time'=>918.94,'target_text'=>'It\'s a lot darker and a lot more peaceful.','source_text'=>'Ia jauh lebih gelap dan jauh lebih tenang dan damai.','order'=>335],
            ['start_time'=>919.04,'end_time'=>920.78,'target_text'=>'Yeah, the ceiling looks very old.','source_text'=>'Ya, silingnya nampak sangat purba.','order'=>336],
            ['start_time'=>920.88,'end_time'=>924.14,'target_text'=>'And this door leads into the throne room, but it\'s closed.','source_text'=>'Dan pintu ini menghala ke bilik takhta, tapi ia berkunci.','order'=>337],
            ['start_time'=>924.24,'end_time'=>925.26,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s unfortunate.','source_text'=>'>> Sayang sekali.','order'=>338],
            ['start_time'=>925.36,'end_time'=>929.06,'target_text'=>'Look at all those people cramming into the small opening.','source_text'=>'Tengoklah semua orang bersesak-sesak di bukaan pintu yang kecil tu.','order'=>339],
            ['start_time'=>929.16,'end_time'=>930.26,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya betul.','order'=>340],
            ['start_time'=>930.36,'end_time'=>932.06,'target_text'=>'Oh, >> Wow, look at that.','source_text'=>'Oh >> Wah, tengok pemandangan tu.','order'=>341],
            ['start_time'=>932.16,'end_time'=>933.94,'target_text'=>'Completely changes, eh?','source_text'=>'Suasananya berubah sepenuhnya, kan?','order'=>342],
            ['start_time'=>934.04,'end_time'=>935.5,'target_text'=>'But it\'s not that big.','source_text'=>'Tapi kawasannya tak berapa besar.','order'=>343],
            ['start_time'=>935.6,'end_time'=>938.7,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, the garden is not that big, but it is really busy.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, tamannya tidak berapa besar, tapi memang sangat sesak dengan orang.','order'=>344],
            ['start_time'=>938.8,'end_time'=>941.14,'target_text'=>'>> But it\'s nice to see some trees.','source_text'=>'>> Tapi seronok dapat melihat pepohon hijau.','order'=>345],
            ['start_time'=>941.24,'end_time'=>945.06,'target_text'=>'>> Okay, so now we\'re leaving the Forbidden City, you can see.','source_text'=>'>> Baiklah, sekarang kita sedang meninggalkan Kota Larangan, seperti yang anda lihat.','order'=>346],
            ['start_time'=>945.16,'end_time'=>949.1,'target_text'=>'Now we\'re going to go and return this outfit and then go to the museum.','source_text'=>'Sekarang kita akan pergi pulangkan pakaian ini dan kemudian pergi ke muzium.','order'=>347],
            ['start_time'=>949.2,'end_time'=>951.5,'target_text'=>'What the museum >> What about lunch?','source_text'=>'Muzium apa >> Bagaimana dengan makan tengah hari?','order'=>348],
            ['start_time'=>951.6,'end_time'=>953.66,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, we\'re going to actually go eat lunch first cuz I\'m hungry.','source_text'=>'>> Oh, sebenarnya kita akan pergi makan tengah hari dulu sebab saya dah lapar.','order'=>349],
            ['start_time'=>953.76,'end_time'=>956.26,'target_text'=>'>> The museum is called the National Museum.','source_text'=>'>> Muzium tu dinamakan Muzium Negara (National Museum).','order'=>350],
            ['start_time'=>956.36,'end_time'=>957.5,'target_text'=>'>> The National Museum.','source_text'=>'>> Muzium Negara.','order'=>351],
            ['start_time'=>957.6,'end_time'=>961.82,'target_text'=>'And I\'m pretty sure my shirt is soaking wet, but I just can\'t tell it cuz I\'m so hot.','source_text'=>'Dan saya pasti baju saya di dalam dah basah kuyup, cuma saya tak perasan sebab badan saya terlalu panas.','order'=>352],
            ['start_time'=>961.92,'end_time'=>963.3,'target_text'=>'But let\'s go, let\'s bounce.','source_text'=>'Tapi jomlah, kita gerak.','order'=>353],
            ['start_time'=>963.4,'end_time'=>966.82,'target_text'=>'This wall honestly looks even better on the outside, I\'m not going to lie.','source_text'=>'Dinding ini sejujurnya nampak lebih hebat dari sebelah luar, saya tak nafikan.','order'=>354],
            ['start_time'=>966.92,'end_time'=>969.18,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s just so massively tall, super massive.','source_text'=>'>> Ia memang tersangat tinggi dan bersaiz gergasi.','order'=>355],
            ['start_time'=>969.28,'end_time'=>971.7,'target_text'=>'>> at the guards over there, they\'re perfectly straight.','source_text'=>'>> tengok pengawal di sebelah sana, mereka berdiri tegak lurus dengan sempurna.','order'=>356],
            ['start_time'=>971.8,'end_time'=>973.34,'target_text'=>'>> They\'re like the Buckingham Palace guards.','source_text'=>'>> Mereka macam pengawal di Istana Buckingham.','order'=>357],
            ['start_time'=>973.44,'end_time'=>975.24,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya betul.','order'=>358],
            ['start_time'=>978.2,'end_time'=>985.74,'target_text'=>'>> We\'ve just left the Forbidden City and now we\'re walking around the whole city because we have to go back to where we started','source_text'=>'>> Kita baru sahaja keluar dari Kota Larangan dan sekarang kita sedang berjalan mengelilingi seluruh kota ini sebab kita kena kembali ke tempat permulaan tadi','order'=>359],
            ['start_time'=>985.84,'end_time'=>988.74,'target_text'=>'so I can drop off my costume that I rented.','source_text'=>'supaya saya boleh pulangkan pakaian yang saya sewa ni.','order'=>360],
            ['start_time'=>988.84,'end_time'=>996.06,'target_text'=>'So I rented this costume for the day and now I\'m done wearing it and it\'s very hot, so I\'m going to go drop it back off.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya sewa pakaian ini untuk seharian dan sekarang saya dah selesai memakainya serta cuaca sangat panas, jadi saya nak pergi pulangkannya semula.','order'=>361],
            ['start_time'=>996.16,'end_time'=>1002.66,'target_text'=>'And a lot of the time when you rent something like this or you rent a car or a bike or anything really, you have to put down','source_text'=>'Dan kebiasaannya bila anda menyewa sesuatu seperti ini atau menyewa kereta, basikal atau apa-apa sahaja, anda perlu meletakkan','order'=>362],
            ['start_time'=>1002.76,'end_time'=>1010.5,'target_text'=>'a deposit on it and that\'s just for the owner to keep just in case you don\'t return the item so that they can keep your deposit.','source_text'=>'wang deposit dan wang itu disimpan oleh pemilik sekiranya anda tidak memulangkan barang tersebut supaya mereka boleh menyimpan deposit anda.','order'=>363],
            ['start_time'=>1010.6,'end_time'=>1018.58,'target_text'=>'So I had to put a deposit on this outfit of 500 yuan, so when I go there, I\'ll have that refunded to me.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya terpaksa meletakkan deposit sebanyak 500 yuan untuk pakaian ini, jadi bila saya sampai di sana nanti, wang itu akan dipulangkan kepada saya.','order'=>364],
            ['start_time'=>1018.68,'end_time'=>1026.42,'target_text'=>'So a deposit isn\'t like a permanent payment, it\'s only like an insurance for the shop owner so that you don\'t run away with','source_text'=>'Jadi wang deposit bukanlah bayaran kekal, ia hanyalah jaminan insurans untuk pemilik kedai supaya anda tidak melarikan diri bersama','order'=>365],
            ['start_time'=>1026.52,'end_time'=>1027.38,'target_text'=>'the costume.','source_text'=>'pakaian tersebut.','order'=>366],
            ['start_time'=>1027.48,'end_time'=>1032.14,'target_text'=>'But yeah, Leon just said to walk down by the water and I do agree cuz it is very beautiful.','source_text'=>'Tapi ya, Leon baru sahaja cadangkan untuk berjalan di tepi air dan saya sangat bersetuju sebab pemandangannya sangat indah.','order'=>367],
            ['start_time'=>1032.24,'end_time'=>1034.94,'target_text'=>'Right now we\'re walking around the Forbidden City.','source_text'=>'Sekarang kita sedang berjalan di sekitar kawasan luar Kota Larangan.','order'=>368],
            ['start_time'=>1035.04,'end_time'=>1037.98,'target_text'=>'I\'m surprised no one is really walking along here.','source_text'=>'Saya hairan kenapa tiada sesiapa yang berjalan di sepanjang laluan ini.','order'=>369],
            ['start_time'=>1038.08,'end_time'=>1041.34,'target_text'=>'It\'s really really beautiful and this is very wide, too.','source_text'=>'Ia benar-benar sangat indah dan laluannya juga sangat lebar.','order'=>370],
            ['start_time'=>1041.44,'end_time'=>1042.78,'target_text'=>'And the water is kind of green.','source_text'=>'Dan air sungainya nampak agak kehijauan.','order'=>371],
            ['start_time'=>1042.88,'end_time'=>1046.18,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know if you can tell on the camera, but the water\'s kind of green.','source_text'=>'Saya tak tahu sama ada anda boleh nampak dalam kamera, tapi airnya agak hijau.','order'=>372],
            ['start_time'=>1046.28,'end_time'=>1048.06,'target_text'=>'And that\'s where we we exited from.','source_text'=>'Dan dari sanalah tempat kita keluar tadi.','order'=>373],
            ['start_time'=>1048.16,'end_time'=>1050.46,'target_text'=>'Now we\'re walking all the way back around.','source_text'=>'Sekarang kita sedang berjalan melingkar kembali ke tempat asal.','order'=>374],
            ['start_time'=>1050.56,'end_time'=>1051.06,'target_text'=>'>> in there?','source_text'=>'>> ada ikan di dalam tu?','order'=>375],
            ['start_time'=>1051.16,'end_time'=>1052.3,'target_text'=>'>> I think there is, yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Saya rasa ada, ya.','order'=>376],
            ['start_time'=>1052.4,'end_time'=>1055.78,'target_text'=>'Ooh, dude, that building right there is super beautiful.','source_text'=>'Wah bro, bangunan di sebelah sana tu memang sangat cantik.','order'=>377],
            ['start_time'=>1055.88,'end_time'=>1057.42,'target_text'=>'>> That\'s the Jade Emperor Pagoda.','source_text'=>'>> Itu Pagoda Maharaja Jed.','order'=>378],
            ['start_time'=>1057.52,'end_time'=>1058.42,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, really?','source_text'=>'>> Oh ya ke?','order'=>379],
            ['start_time'=>1058.52,'end_time'=>1060.32,'target_text'=>'>> No.','source_text'=>'>> Bukan.','order'=>380],
            ['start_time'=>1060.52,'end_time'=>1061.9,'target_text'=>'>> Cancel this guy.','source_text'=>'>> Jangan percaya mamat ni.','order'=>381],
            ['start_time'=>1062,'end_time'=>1063.62,'target_text'=>'>> There\'s a lot of algae in there, too.','source_text'=>'>> Ada banyak alga di dalam air tu juga.','order'=>382],
            ['start_time'=>1063.72,'end_time'=>1064.9,'target_text'=>'But it doesn\'t look that deep.','source_text'=>'Tapi ia tak nampak terlalu dalam.','order'=>383],
            ['start_time'=>1065,'end_time'=>1068.34,'target_text'=>'But I\'d say it\'s maybe like 5 ft deep, 6 ft deep.','source_text'=>'Saya anggarkan kedalamannya mungkin sekitar 5 atau 6 kaki.','order'=>384],
            ['start_time'=>1068.44,'end_time'=>1070.46,'target_text'=>'>> You can see the algae.','source_text'=>'>> Anda boleh nampak alga tu.','order'=>385],
            ['start_time'=>1070.56,'end_time'=>1071.74,'target_text'=>'We\'re just going to walk around.','source_text'=>'Kita cuma nak jalan-jalan pusing santai.','order'=>386],
            ['start_time'=>1071.84,'end_time'=>1073.34,'target_text'=>'It\'s honestly a really nice walk.','source_text'=>'Sejujurnya ini satu sesi berjalan kaki yang sangat menyenangkan.','order'=>387],
            ['start_time'=>1073.44,'end_time'=>1076.26,'target_text'=>'I feel like a lot of ancient palaces and stuff had a moat.','source_text'=>'Saya perhatikan banyak istana purba zaman dulu yang mempunyai parit kubu.','order'=>388],
            ['start_time'=>1076.36,'end_time'=>1079.22,'target_text'=>'Same thing with the Osaka Castle.','source_text'=>'Perkara yang sama juga dengan Istana Osaka di Jepun.','order'=>389],
            ['start_time'=>1079.32,'end_time'=>1081.46,'target_text'=>'Look at the lady on the bicycle.','source_text'=>'Tengok wanita yang berbasikal tu.','order'=>390],
            ['start_time'=>1081.56,'end_time'=>1082.18,'target_text'=>'It\'s funny.','source_text'=>'Kelakar betul.','order'=>391],
            ['start_time'=>1082.28,'end_time'=>1086.78,'target_text'=>'This area is a lot more peaceful than the Forbidden City, eh?','source_text'=>'Kawasan ini jauh lebih damai berbanding di dalam Kota Larangan, kan?','order'=>392],
            ['start_time'=>1086.88,'end_time'=>1087.94,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, it\'s quieter.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, suasananya lebih sunyi.','order'=>393],
            ['start_time'=>1088.04,'end_time'=>1089.1,'target_text'=>'>> A lot more peaceful.','source_text'=>'>> Jauh lebih damai dan tenang.','order'=>394],
            ['start_time'=>1089.2,'end_time'=>1093.3,'target_text'=>'There are just people riding their bikes on the streets, just families walking.','source_text'=>'Cuma ada orang yang mengayuh basikal di jalanan, keluarga yang sedang bersiar-siar.','order'=>395],
            ['start_time'=>1093.4,'end_time'=>1094.18,'target_text'=>'It\'s just so peaceful.','source_text'=>'Ia sangat damai.','order'=>396],
            ['start_time'=>1094.28,'end_time'=>1096.18,'target_text'=>'Look at these beautiful trees.','source_text'=>'Lihatlah pokok-pokok yang indah ini.','order'=>397],
            ['start_time'=>1096.28,'end_time'=>1101.54,'target_text'=>'The bottom part of the tree trunk and then the top, that green part, are the leaves.','source_text'=>'Bahagian bawah adalah batang pokok dan bahagian atas yang hijau itu adalah daun-daunnya.','order'=>398],
            ['start_time'=>1101.64,'end_time'=>1103.3,'target_text'=>'It\'s just really beautiful and peaceful.','source_text'=>'Ia sangat indah dan menenangkan.','order'=>399],
            ['start_time'=>1103.4,'end_time'=>1106.1,'target_text'=>'I like this area outside of the Forbidden City.','source_text'=>'Saya suka kawasan di luar Kota Larangan ini.','order'=>400],
            ['start_time'=>1106.2,'end_time'=>1107.82,'target_text'=>'So we have a 4-minute walk.','source_text'=>'Jadi kita ada perjalanan berjalan kaki kira-kira 4 minit lagi.','order'=>401],
            ['start_time'=>1107.92,'end_time'=>1109.02,'target_text'=>'>> Did you see those buses there?','source_text'=>'>> Awak nampak tak bas-bas di sana tu?','order'=>402],
            ['start_time'=>1109.12,'end_time'=>1112.42,'target_text'=>'They They have like a facade that makes them look like a trolley car.','source_text'=>'Bas-bas tu ada reka bentuk luaran yang membuatkannya nampak seperti trem.','order'=>403],
            ['start_time'=>1112.52,'end_time'=>1113.62,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s a shuttle bus.','source_text'=>'>> Ia bas ulang-alik.','order'=>404],
            ['start_time'=>1113.72,'end_time'=>1114.54,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>405],
            ['start_time'=>1114.64,'end_time'=>1115.26,'target_text'=>'>> But for tours.','source_text'=>'>> Tapi khas untuk pelancong.','order'=>406],
            ['start_time'=>1115.36,'end_time'=>1117.62,'target_text'=>'Maybe they bring you back to the main gate.','source_text'=>'Mungkin bas tu bawa anda kembali ke pintu gerbang utama.','order'=>407],
            ['start_time'=>1117.72,'end_time'=>1121.54,'target_text'=>'>> I think those buses go around in a loop around this whole Forbidden City.','source_text'=>'>> Saya rasa bas-bas tu bergerak dalam satu laluan gelung mengelilingi seluruh Kota Larangan ini.','order'=>408],
            ['start_time'=>1121.64,'end_time'=>1123.06,'target_text'=>'So you can just hop on them.','source_text'=>'Jadi anda boleh terus naik sahaja.','order'=>409],
            ['start_time'=>1123.16,'end_time'=>1125.46,'target_text'=>'They don\'t cost any money and you can just take them around.','source_text'=>'Ia tidak dikenakan sebarang bayaran dan anda boleh naik untuk pusing-pusing.','order'=>410],
            ['start_time'=>1125.56,'end_time'=>1126.58,'target_text'=>'You don\'t have to walk everywhere.','source_text'=>'Anda tak perlu berjalan kaki ke mana-mana.','order'=>411],
            ['start_time'=>1126.68,'end_time'=>1127.9,'target_text'=>'>> Should have done that.','source_text'=>'>> Sepatutnya kita naik bas tu tadi.','order'=>412],
            ['start_time'=>1128,'end_time'=>1132.5,'target_text'=>'Cuz we\'ve been walking for almost half an hour now and we\'re getting quite tired.','source_text'=>'Sebab kita dah berjalan kaki selama hampir setengah jam dan kita dah berasa agak penat.','order'=>413],
            ['start_time'=>1132.6,'end_time'=>1135.82,'target_text'=>'I think I almost have heatstroke, but we\'re going to go get some food to eat.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa saya hampir terkena strok haba, tapi kita nak pergi cari makanan untuk makan.','order'=>414],
            ['start_time'=>1135.92,'end_time'=>1136.34,'target_text'=>'You know what?','source_text'=>'Anda tahu apa?','order'=>415],
            ['start_time'=>1136.44,'end_time'=>1140.34,'target_text'=>'It\'s a nice walk, so if I do get heatstroke, I won\'t regret anything.','source_text'=>'Ini satu perjalanan jalan kaki yang menyeronokkan, jadi kalau saya kena strok haba pun, saya takkan menyesal apa-apa.','order'=>416],
            ['start_time'=>1140.44,'end_time'=>1141.42,'target_text'=>'>> No way.','source_text'=>'>> Mana boleh macam tu.','order'=>417],
            ['start_time'=>1141.52,'end_time'=>1141.92,'target_text'=>'>> Okay, guys.','source_text'=>'>> Baiklah, kawan-kawan.','order'=>418],
            ['start_time'=>1141.92,'end_time'=>1143.46,'target_text'=>'So now I\'m across the street.','source_text'=>'Sekarang saya dah melintas jalan.','order'=>419],
            ['start_time'=>1143.56,'end_time'=>1146.26,'target_text'=>'This is the store that I rented my stuff from.','source_text'=>'Ini adalah kedai tempat saya menyewa pakaian tadi.','order'=>420],
            ['start_time'=>1146.36,'end_time'=>1152.34,'target_text'=>'So I\'m now going to go in, return my stuff, get my deposit back, and then and go get something to eat and drink.','source_text'=>'Jadi sekarang saya nak masuk, pulangkan barang, ambil semula wang deposit saya, dan kemudian pergi cari makanan dan minuman.','order'=>421],
            ['start_time'=>1152.44,'end_time'=>1154.66,'target_text'=>'So, now I\'ll go in here.','source_text'=>'Jadi sekarang saya akan masuk ke sini.','order'=>422],
            ['start_time'=>1154.76,'end_time'=>1156.94,'target_text'=>'Okay, we\'re now in 7-Eleven here.','source_text'=>'Baiklah, kita kini berada di dalam kedai 7-Eleven di sini.','order'=>423],
            ['start_time'=>1157.04,'end_time'=>1158.58,'target_text'=>'I think we might get ice cream.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa kita mungkin nak beli aiskrim.','order'=>424],
            ['start_time'=>1158.68,'end_time'=>1162.94,'target_text'=>'We just dropped off the outfit and now we have a little snack in 7-Eleven.','source_text'=>'Kita baru sahaja pulangkan pakaian tadi dan sekarang kita nak makan snek ringan di 7-Eleven.','order'=>425],
            ['start_time'=>1163.04,'end_time'=>1166.78,'target_text'=>'This is a tuna mayo onigiri.','source_text'=>'Ini adalah onigiri tuna mayo.','order'=>426],
            ['start_time'=>1166.88,'end_time'=>1168.7,'target_text'=>'We also have a small Snickers.','source_text'=>'Kita juga ada sebuku kecil coklat Snickers.','order'=>427],
            ['start_time'=>1168.8,'end_time'=>1176.62,'target_text'=>'We have this chocolate bun thing with extra seasoning inside and also this plus C drink.','source_text'=>'Kita ada roti bun coklat ini dengan inti tambahan di dalam dan juga minuman Plus C ini.','order'=>428],
            ['start_time'=>1176.72,'end_time'=>1177.74,'target_text'=>'Let\'s see what Leon got.','source_text'=>'Jom tengok apa yang Leon beli.','order'=>429],
            ['start_time'=>1177.84,'end_time'=>1180.02,'target_text'=>'Leon got a sandwich.','source_text'=>'Leon beli sandwic.','order'=>430],
            ['start_time'=>1180.12,'end_time'=>1184.9,'target_text'=>'He also got a whole He got a whole loaf of fruit bread.','source_text'=>'Dia juga beli sebuku... Dia beli sebuku penuh roti buah.','order'=>431],
            ['start_time'=>1185,'end_time'=>1191.3,'target_text'=>'>> I saw a guy eating bread at the Forbidden City or the Forbidden Palace and I was like, \"Damn, I want to eat a whole loaf','source_text'=>'>> Saya nampak seorang mamat makan roti di Kota Larangan atau Istana Larangan dan saya terus rasa, \'Wah, saya nak makan sebuku penuh','order'=>432],
            ['start_time'=>1191.4,'end_time'=>1196.5,'target_text'=>'of bread as well.\" >> Okay, so now let\'s try this first, chocolate bread.','source_text'=>'roti juga.\' >> Baiklah, sekarang jom kita cuba roti coklat ini dahulu.','order'=>433],
            ['start_time'=>1196.6,'end_time'=>1200.1,'target_text'=>'It\'s in a package and you can see the package is filled with air.','source_text'=>'Ia berada di dalam bungkusan dan anda boleh nampak bungkusan itu kembung berisi udara.','order'=>434],
            ['start_time'=>1200.2,'end_time'=>1202.66,'target_text'=>'When I squeeze it, you can see the bag getting tighter.','source_text'=>'Bila saya picit, anda boleh nampak beg plastiknya semakin tegang.','order'=>435],
            ['start_time'=>1202.76,'end_time'=>1206.36,'target_text'=>'Now, let\'s peel the package open.','source_text'=>'Sekarang, jom kita koyakkan bungkusannya.','order'=>436],
            ['start_time'=>1207.32,'end_time'=>1214.26,'target_text'=>'I know my hands are probably dirty, so I don\'t want to touch the actual food and I don\'t have any wet wipes to clean my hands.','source_text'=>'Saya tahu tangan saya mungkin kotor, jadi saya tak nak sentuh makanan tu secara terus dan saya tiada tisu basah untuk bersihkan tangan saya.','order'=>437],
            ['start_time'=>1214.36,'end_time'=>1216.72,'target_text'=>'>> You want a wet wipe?','source_text'=>'>> Awak nak tisu basah ke?','order'=>438],
            ['start_time'=>1217.88,'end_time'=>1218.66,'target_text'=>'>> Mhm.','source_text'=>'>> Mhm.','order'=>439],
            ['start_time'=>1218.76,'end_time'=>1220.06,'target_text'=>'>> Chocolaty?','source_text'=>'>> Rasa coklat tak?','order'=>440],
            ['start_time'=>1220.16,'end_time'=>1220.74,'target_text'=>'>> Nope.','source_text'=>'>> Tak pun.','order'=>441],
            ['start_time'=>1220.84,'end_time'=>1223.62,'target_text'=>'It just looks like chocolate, but there\'s no chocolate flavor.','source_text'=>'Ia cuma nampak macam coklat, tapi tiada rasa coklat.','order'=>442],
            ['start_time'=>1223.72,'end_time'=>1224.62,'target_text'=>'>> Ooh.','source_text'=>'>> Ooh.','order'=>443],
            ['start_time'=>1224.72,'end_time'=>1226.58,'target_text'=>'>> This is a bottle.','source_text'=>'>> Ini sebotol minuman.','order'=>444],
            ['start_time'=>1226.68,'end_time'=>1230.58,'target_text'=>'This right here is a lid and I\'m going to twist the lid off.','source_text'=>'Yang di atas ini ialah penutup botol dan saya akan putarkan penutupnya.','order'=>445],
            ['start_time'=>1230.68,'end_time'=>1233.96,'target_text'=>'Now the lid is off and I\'m going to take a sip.','source_text'=>'Sekarang penutupnya dah terbuka dan saya nak teguk sedikit.','order'=>446],
            ['start_time'=>1234.44,'end_time'=>1234.9,'target_text'=>'Mhm.','source_text'=>'Mhm.','order'=>447],
            ['start_time'=>1235,'end_time'=>1238.58,'target_text'=>'The way I would describe this drink is this drink is not very sweet.','source_text'=>'Cara saya nak gambarkan minuman ini ialah ia tidak berapa manis.','order'=>448],
            ['start_time'=>1238.68,'end_time'=>1242.02,'target_text'=>'It\'s sour and a little bitter, just like lemon.','source_text'=>'Rasanya masam dan ada sedikit pahit, sama seperti buah lemon.','order'=>449],
            ['start_time'=>1242.12,'end_time'=>1245.46,'target_text'=>'So, I actually do like this drink and I would probably get it again.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya sebenarnya suka minuman ini dan saya mungkin akan membelinya lagi.','order'=>450],
            ['start_time'=>1245.56,'end_time'=>1246.74,'target_text'=>'>> Is it carbonated?','source_text'=>'>> Ada gas tak (berkarbonat)?','order'=>451],
            ['start_time'=>1246.84,'end_time'=>1247.34,'target_text'=>'>> No.','source_text'=>'>> Tak ada.','order'=>452],
            ['start_time'=>1247.44,'end_time'=>1250.32,'target_text'=>'Now, let\'s try this.','source_text'=>'Sekarang, jom kita cuba yang ini pula.','order'=>453],
            ['start_time'=>1251.64,'end_time'=>1253.62,'target_text'=>'I really don\'t want to touch this one, either.','source_text'=>'Saya memang tak nak sentuh yang ini secara terus juga.','order'=>454],
            ['start_time'=>1253.72,'end_time'=>1255.3,'target_text'=>'Ooh, it looks super nice and soft.','source_text'=>'Ooh, ia nampak sangat elok dan lembut.','order'=>455],
            ['start_time'=>1255.4,'end_time'=>1256.66,'target_text'=>'Let me know in the comments, guys.','source_text'=>'Beritahu saya di ruangan komen, kawan-kawan.','order'=>456],
            ['start_time'=>1256.76,'end_time'=>1261.38,'target_text'=>'Do you warm this up before you eat it or do you just eat this without warming it up?','source_text'=>'Adakah anda panaskan makanan ini sebelum makan atau anda makan terus tanpa dipanaskan?','order'=>457],
            ['start_time'=>1261.48,'end_time'=>1263.26,'target_text'=>'Me, personally, I don\'t warm it up.','source_text'=>'Bagi saya sendiri, saya tak panaskannya.','order'=>458],
            ['start_time'=>1263.36,'end_time'=>1265.96,'target_text'=>'I just eat it cold.','source_text'=>'Saya cuma makan sejuk begitu sahaja.','order'=>459],
            ['start_time'=>1267.36,'end_time'=>1274.1,'target_text'=>'>> I think that\'s how they do it in Japan cuz only Gary\'s meant to be like food you take to your school or to work and you','source_text'=>'>> Saya rasa macam tulah cara orang Jepun makan sebab onigiri memang direka sebagai makanan bekal untuk dibawa ke sekolah atau ke tempat kerja di mana anda','order'=>460],
            ['start_time'=>1274.2,'end_time'=>1275.34,'target_text'=>'don\'t have like somewhere to heat it up.','source_text'=>'tiada tempat untuk memanaskannya semula.','order'=>461],
            ['start_time'=>1275.44,'end_time'=>1276.78,'target_text'=>'It\'s not like a hot food.','source_text'=>'Ia bukan seperti hidangan panas.','order'=>462],
            ['start_time'=>1276.88,'end_time'=>1281.5,'target_text'=>'>> Cuz in Korea, they warm it up, but this is one of the best ones I\'ve ever had actually.','source_text'=>'>> Sebab di Korea mereka panaskannya, tapi ini adalah antara onigiri paling sedap yang pernah saya makan sebenarnya.','order'=>463],
            ['start_time'=>1281.6,'end_time'=>1281.92,'target_text'=>'Wow.','source_text'=>'Wah.','order'=>464],
            ['start_time'=>1281.92,'end_time'=>1283.42,'target_text'=>'Okay, shout out 7-Eleven.','source_text'=>'Baiklah, terima kasih 7-Eleven.','order'=>465],
            ['start_time'=>1283.52,'end_time'=>1284.62,'target_text'=>'This is really good.','source_text'=>'Ini memang sangat sedap.','order'=>466],
            ['start_time'=>1284.72,'end_time'=>1286.98,'target_text'=>'Anyway, let me know what you guys think of today\'s video.','source_text'=>'Apa-apa pun, beritahu saya apa pendapat korang tentang video hari ini.','order'=>467],
            ['start_time'=>1287.08,'end_time'=>1289.22,'target_text'=>'Did you enjoy seeing the Forbidden City?','source_text'=>'Adakah korang seronok melihat Kota Larangan?','order'=>468],
