            ['start_time'=>1297,'end_time'=>1301.42,'target_text'=>'This was one of the funniest and most unforgettable moments of the day.','source_text'=>'Ini adalah salah satu saat paling kelakar dan sukar dilupakan sepanjang hari ini.','order'=>471],
            ['start_time'=>1301.52,'end_time'=>1308.46,'target_text'=>'I was standing in front of the Forbidden City wearing traditional emperor clothing, and honestly, I did not expect such a','source_text'=>'Saya berdiri di hadapan Kota Larangan sambil memakai pakaian tradisional maharaja, dan sejujurnya saya tidak menyangka akan menerima sambutan yang','order'=>472],
