            ['start_time'=>1309.92,'end_time'=>1313.98,'target_text'=>'The outfit was bright, ornate, and impossible to ignore.','source_text'=>'Pakaian itu sangat terang, mewah berhias, dan mustahil untuk tidak dipedulikan.','order'=>474],
            ['start_time'=>1314.08,'end_time'=>1321.22,'target_text'=>'It had rich golden colors, elaborate details, and theatrical, almost regal presence.','source_text'=>'Ia mempunyai warna emas yang kaya, perincian yang halus, serta aura teatrikal yang hampir menyerupai kerabat diraja.','order'=>475],
            ['start_time'=>1321.32,'end_time'=>1328.86,'target_text'=>'The second I put it on, I stopped feeling like an ordinary tourist and started feeling like part of the scene itself.','source_text'=>'Sebaik sahaja saya memakainya, saya berhenti berasa seperti pelancong biasa dan mula berasa seperti sebahagian daripada latar tempat itu sendiri.','order'=>476],
            ['start_time'=>1328.96,'end_time'=>1333.74,'target_text'=>'Almost immediately, people began coming up to me and asking to take photos.','source_text'=>'Hampir serta-merta, orang ramai mula mendekati saya dan meminta untuk bergambar bersama.','order'=>477],
            ['start_time'=>1333.84,'end_time'=>1339.22,'target_text'=>'At first, I thought maybe one or two people would ask, but then more and more people came over.','source_text'=>'Pada mulanya saya fikir mungkin seorang atau dua orang sahaja yang akan meminta, tetapi kemudian semakin ramai orang datang menghampiri.','order'=>478],
            ['start_time'=>1339.32,'end_time'=>1345.26,'target_text'=>'Kids smiled, families laughed, and strangers confidently walked up to me with their phones ready.','source_text'=>'Kanak-kanak tersenyum, keluarga ketawa, dan orang asing dengan yakin berjalan ke arah saya dengan telefon yang sedia di tangan.','order'=>479],
