            ['start_time'=>176.56,'end_time'=>178.54,'target_text'=>'>> Although you were still a little bit late.','source_text'=>'>> Walaupun awak tetap lewat sikit.','order'=>75],
            ['start_time'=>178.64,'end_time'=>179.04,'target_text'=>'>> I don\'t know.','source_text'=>'>> Entahlah.','order'=>76],
            ['start_time'=>179.04,'end_time'=>185.58,'target_text'=>'I prefer to go out earlier like around 10:00 to hang out, especially like in this country cuz it\'s just so hot, you know?','source_text'=>'Saya lebih suka keluar awal macam pukul 10:00 untuk lepak, terutamanya di negara ni sebab panas gila, kan?','order'=>77],
            ['start_time'=>185.68,'end_time'=>187.42,'target_text'=>'Like I mean, we\'ve been out a couple times, right?','source_text'=>'Maksud saya, kita dah keluar beberapa kali, kan?','order'=>78],
            ['start_time'=>187.52,'end_time'=>188.62,'target_text'=>'We\'re always cooking.','source_text'=>'Kita selalu rasa macam terpanggang.','order'=>79],
            ['start_time'=>188.72,'end_time'=>190.46,'target_text'=>'It\'s always hot and I\'m always sweating.','source_text'=>'Sentiasa panas dan saya sentiasa berpeluh.','order'=>80],
            ['start_time'=>190.56,'end_time'=>194.06,'target_text'=>'And I got the all black fit on except for the shoes.','source_text'=>'Dan saya pakai pakaian serba hitam kecuali kasut.','order'=>81],
            ['start_time'=>194.16,'end_time'=>196.86,'target_text'=>'I have to have a little color and the socks.','source_text'=>'Kena ada sikit warna dan juga stoking.','order'=>82],
            ['start_time'=>196.96,'end_time'=>198.14,'target_text'=>'You\'re also wearing all black.','source_text'=>'Awak pun pakai serba hitam.','order'=>83],
            ['start_time'=>198.24,'end_time'=>199.02,'target_text'=>'Like, look at you, man.','source_text'=>'Tengoklah diri awak, bro.','order'=>84],
            ['start_time'=>199.12,'end_time'=>203.42,'target_text'=>'You just black shorts, black shirt, and a black button-up shirt over that, bro.','source_text'=>'Awak pakai seluar pendek hitam, baju hitam, dan kemeja butang hitam di luar, bro.','order'=>85],
            ['start_time'=>203.52,'end_time'=>204.46,'target_text'=>'And black socks.','source_text'=>'Dan stoking hitam.','order'=>86],
            ['start_time'=>204.56,'end_time'=>205.58,'target_text'=>'Dude, what are you wearing?','source_text'=>'Bro, apa yang awak pakai ni?','order'=>87],
            ['start_time'=>205.68,'end_time'=>208.54,'target_text'=>'>> My clothes are lightweight, so I don\'t really feel it.','source_text'=>'>> Pakaian saya ringan, jadi saya tak rasa sangat panas tu.','order'=>88],
            ['start_time'=>208.64,'end_time'=>208.88,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya ke.','order'=>89],
            ['start_time'=>208.88,'end_time'=>210.06,'target_text'=>'Did you put on sunscreen?','source_text'=>'Awak ada pakai krim pelindung matahari (sunscreen) tak?','order'=>90],
            ['start_time'=>210.16,'end_time'=>211.1,'target_text'=>'>> I did.','source_text'=>'>> Ada, saya pakai.','order'=>91],
            ['start_time'=>211.2,'end_time'=>213.26,'target_text'=>'>> You put on sunscreen every time you go out?','source_text'=>'>> Awak pakai pelindung matahari setiap kali keluar?','order'=>92],
            ['start_time'=>213.36,'end_time'=>213.98,'target_text'=>'>> Every time.','source_text'=>'>> Setiap kali.','order'=>93],
            ['start_time'=>214.08,'end_time'=>214.48,'target_text'=>'>> Why?','source_text'=>'>> Kenapa?','order'=>94],
            ['start_time'=>214.56,'end_time'=>215.82,'target_text'=>'>> Cuz I do not want to burn.','source_text'=>'>> Sebab saya tak nak kulit terbakar.','order'=>95],
            ['start_time'=>215.92,'end_time'=>219.98,'target_text'=>'And I also have pretty sensitive skin, so I have to take care of it.','source_text'=>'Dan kulit saya agak sensitif, jadi saya kena jaga betul-betul.','order'=>96],
            ['start_time'=>220.08,'end_time'=>225.9,'target_text'=>'>> If you guys want to practice your pronunciation and accent even more, make sure you check out my other channel, Vulca.','source_text'=>'>> Kalau korang nak latih sebutan dan loghat lagi banyak, pastikan korang tengok saluran saya yang satu lagi, Vulca.','order'=>97],
            ['start_time'=>226,'end_time'=>229.1,'target_text'=>'That is where I post my Reddit style shadowing videos.','source_text'=>'Di situlah tempat saya kongsikan video shadowing gaya Reddit.','order'=>98],
            ['start_time'=>229.2,'end_time'=>234.3,'target_text'=>'So, if you want to be entertained and also practice your English, check out the channel and subscribe.','source_text'=>'Jadi kalau korang nak terhibur dan pada masa yang sama latih Bahasa Inggeris, layari saluran tu dan langgan.','order'=>99],
            ['start_time'=>234.4,'end_time'=>236.7,'target_text'=>'This park is really nice, isn\'t it?','source_text'=>'Taman ni memang cantik sangat, kan?','order'=>100],
            ['start_time'=>236.8,'end_time'=>237.9,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I really like it.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, saya memang suka sangat.','order'=>101],
            ['start_time'=>238,'end_time'=>239.42,'target_text'=>'>> Have you been here before?','source_text'=>'>> Awak pernah datang sini sebelum ni?','order'=>102],
            ['start_time'=>239.52,'end_time'=>241.26,'target_text'=>'>> I\'ve been here a couple of times.','source_text'=>'>> Saya pernah datang sini beberapa kali.','order'=>103],
            ['start_time'=>241.36,'end_time'=>245.26,'target_text'=>'>> I mean, we\'ve been here together a couple of times, but I really like these apartments.','source_text'=>'>> Maksud saya, kita pernah datang sini sama-sama beberapa kali, tapi saya memang suka apartmen-apartmen ni.','order'=>104],
            ['start_time'=>245.36,'end_time'=>249.02,'target_text'=>'I think I think I would like to move into these apartments one day.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa saya teringin nak pindah masuk ke apartmen ni suatu hari nanti.','order'=>105],
            ['start_time'=>249.12,'end_time'=>250.14,'target_text'=>'What do you think?','source_text'=>'Apa pendapat awak?','order'=>106],
            ['start_time'=>250.24,'end_time'=>252.14,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, that might be too big for me.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, itu mungkin terlalu besar untuk saya.','order'=>107],
            ['start_time'=>252.24,'end_time'=>253.66,'target_text'=>'Say you order some food.','source_text'=>'Katakan awak pesan makanan.','order'=>108],
            ['start_time'=>253.76,'end_time'=>258.14,'target_text'=>'You have to go all the way down and then to your lobby to be able to get your food.','source_text'=>'Awak kena turun sampai ke bawah dan pergi ke lobi untuk ambil makanan awak.','order'=>109],
            ['start_time'=>258.24,'end_time'=>260.94,'target_text'=>'>> I think this has like 30 or 40 floors.','source_text'=>'>> Saya rasa bangunan ni ada dalam 30 atau 40 tingkat.','order'=>110],
            ['start_time'=>261.04,'end_time'=>265.98,'target_text'=>'But the tallest building in Vietnam is right over there.','source_text'=>'Tapi bangunan tertinggi di Vietnam ada betul-betul di sebelah sana.','order'=>111],
            ['start_time'=>266.08,'end_time'=>266.62,'target_text'=>'>> You can see that.','source_text'=>'>> Awak boleh nampak bangunan tu.','order'=>112],
            ['start_time'=>266.72,'end_time'=>269.02,'target_text'=>'That is the tallest building in Vietnam for now.','source_text'=>'Itulah bangunan paling tinggi di Vietnam buat masa sekarang.','order'=>113],
            ['start_time'=>269.12,'end_time'=>276.94,'target_text'=>'Cuz I know like Vietnam is like one of the fastest growing countries in terms of like economic growth, GDP in Asia.','source_text'=>'Sebab saya tahu Vietnam adalah antara negara yang paling pesat membangun dari segi pertumbuhan ekonomi dan KDNK di Asia.','order'=>114],
            ['start_time'=>277.04,'end_time'=>280.46,'target_text'=>'So maybe they\'ll have more skyscrapers in a couple of years.','source_text'=>'Jadi mungkin mereka akan bina lebih banyak pencakar langit dalam masa beberapa tahun lagi.','order'=>115],
            ['start_time'=>280.56,'end_time'=>281.66,'target_text'=>'Are you excited to go to China?','source_text'=>'Awak teruja tak nak pergi ke China?','order'=>116],
            ['start_time'=>281.76,'end_time'=>284.7,'target_text'=>'cuz we\'re literally going in like 3 days.','source_text'=>'Sebab kita memang akan bertolak dalam masa 3 hari lagi.','order'=>117],
            ['start_time'=>284.8,'end_time'=>285.66,'target_text'=>'Less than 3 days now.','source_text'=>'Kurang daripada 3 hari sekarang.','order'=>118],
            ['start_time'=>285.76,'end_time'=>286.46,'target_text'=>'>> 3 days.','source_text'=>'>> 3 hari.','order'=>119],
            ['start_time'=>286.56,'end_time'=>287.9,'target_text'=>'>> In 3 days, we\'re going to China.','source_text'=>'>> Dalam masa 3 hari, kita akan pergi ke China.','order'=>120],
            ['start_time'=>288,'end_time'=>289.26,'target_text'=>'>> I\'m looking forward to it.','source_text'=>'>> Saya memang tak sabar.','order'=>121],
            ['start_time'=>289.36,'end_time'=>291.74,'target_text'=>'Although, I\'m not looking forward to that flight.','source_text'=>'Walaupun saya tak berapa gemar penerbangan tu nanti.','order'=>122],
            ['start_time'=>291.84,'end_time'=>292.46,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s not that bad.','source_text'=>'>> Tak adalah teruk sangat.','order'=>123],
            ['start_time'=>292.56,'end_time'=>293.74,'target_text'=>'It\'s a direct flight.','source_text'=>'Ia penerbangan terus (direct flight).','order'=>124],
            ['start_time'=>293.84,'end_time'=>300.46,'target_text'=>'You wanted >> You wanted to take a flight that was like a 2 or 3 hour stopover and then get on a flight.','source_text'=>'Awak nak >> Awak nak ambil penerbangan yang ada transit 2 atau 3 jam lepas tu baru naik penerbangan lain.','order'=>125],
            ['start_time'=>300.56,'end_time'=>304.14,'target_text'=>'I was like, I just want a direct flight cuz why did you even want that flight, bro?','source_text'=>'Saya pula rasa lebih baik ambil penerbangan terus, lagipun kenapa awak nak pilih flight macam tu, bro?','order'=>126],
            ['start_time'=>304.24,'end_time'=>306.7,'target_text'=>'>> You always want to land at a good time and leave at a good time.','source_text'=>'>> Awak mestilah nak mendarat pada waktu yang elok dan bertolak pada waktu yang sesuai.','order'=>127],
            ['start_time'=>306.8,'end_time'=>308.22,'target_text'=>'That\'s like the most important part.','source_text'=>'Itulah bahagian yang paling penting.','order'=>128],
            ['start_time'=>308.32,'end_time'=>308.78,'target_text'=>'>> No, bro.','source_text'=>'>> Mana ada, bro.','order'=>129],
            ['start_time'=>308.88,'end_time'=>309.58,'target_text'=>'Get out of here.','source_text'=>'Tak masuk akal.','order'=>130],
            ['start_time'=>309.68,'end_time'=>315.82,'target_text'=>'When when I was thinking of that, I was like, I just want it to be a direct flight cuz it\'s only 5 hours to Beijing from Ho','source_text'=>'Masa saya fikir pasal tu, saya rasa lebih baik penerbangan terus sebab cuma 5 jam ke Beijing dari Bandar Ho','order'=>131],
            ['start_time'=>315.92,'end_time'=>316.54,'target_text'=>'Chi Min City.','source_text'=>'Chi Minh.','order'=>132],
            ['start_time'=>316.64,'end_time'=>319.74,'target_text'=>'That\'s why I made the decision instead of you making the decision.','source_text'=>'Sebab tu lah saya yang buat keputusan dan bukannya awak yang buat keputusan.','order'=>133],
            ['start_time'=>319.84,'end_time'=>321.02,'target_text'=>'I made the decision.','source_text'=>'Saya yang buat keputusan.','order'=>134],
            ['start_time'=>321.12,'end_time'=>323.42,'target_text'=>'Direct flight there, direct flight back.','source_text'=>'Penerbangan terus ke sana, penerbangan terus balik sini.','order'=>135],
            ['start_time'=>323.52,'end_time'=>326.06,'target_text'=>'But we do still have to buy a checked suitcase.','source_text'=>'Tapi kita masih kena beli bagasi daftar masuk (checked suitcase).','order'=>136],
            ['start_time'=>326.16,'end_time'=>327.34,'target_text'=>'If I forget, remind me.','source_text'=>'Kalau saya terlupa, tolong ingatkan saya.','order'=>137],
            ['start_time'=>327.44,'end_time'=>327.9,'target_text'=>'Okay.','source_text'=>'Okay.','order'=>138],
            ['start_time'=>328,'end_time'=>328.46,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Oh ya.','order'=>139],
            ['start_time'=>328.56,'end_time'=>329.82,'target_text'=>'>> Are you excited for China?','source_text'=>'>> Awak teruja tak nak ke China?','order'=>140],
            ['start_time'=>329.92,'end_time'=>330.46,'target_text'=>'>> Definitely.','source_text'=>'>> Mestilah.','order'=>141],
            ['start_time'=>330.56,'end_time'=>331.74,'target_text'=>'>> What did you say we\'re going to go see?','source_text'=>'>> Awak kata kita nak pergi tengok apa nanti?','order'=>142],
            ['start_time'=>331.84,'end_time'=>334.54,'target_text'=>'You said you had a whole list and I also sent you my list.','source_text'=>'Awak kata awak ada senarai penuh dan saya pun dah hantar senarai saya pada awak.','order'=>143],
            ['start_time'=>334.64,'end_time'=>336.46,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, we have a lot of things to do.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, banyak benda yang kita nak buat.','order'=>144],
            ['start_time'=>336.56,'end_time'=>337.74,'target_text'=>'The Great Wall of China.','source_text'=>'Tembok Besar China.','order'=>145],
            ['start_time'=>337.84,'end_time'=>338.3,'target_text'=>'>> Wall of China.','source_text'=>'>> Tembok Besar China.','order'=>146],
            ['start_time'=>338.4,'end_time'=>339.58,'target_text'=>'>> The Forbidden City.','source_text'=>'>> Kota Larangan.','order'=>147],
            ['start_time'=>339.68,'end_time'=>340.54,'target_text'=>'>> Forbidden City.','source_text'=>'>> Kota Larangan.','order'=>148],
            ['start_time'=>340.64,'end_time'=>341.58,'target_text'=>'Summer Palace.','source_text'=>'Istana Musim Panas (Summer Palace).','order'=>149],
            ['start_time'=>341.68,'end_time'=>342.94,'target_text'=>'>> Summer Palace.','source_text'=>'>> Istana Musim Panas.','order'=>150],
            ['start_time'=>343.04,'end_time'=>344.06,'target_text'=>'>> Heaven and earth.','source_text'=>'>> Syurga dan bumi.','order'=>151],
            ['start_time'=>344.16,'end_time'=>344.62,'target_text'=>'Is that something?','source_text'=>'Ada tempat macam tu ke?','order'=>152],
            ['start_time'=>344.72,'end_time'=>345.82,'target_text'=>'Heaven and Heaven Palace.','source_text'=>'Syurga dan Istana Syurga.','order'=>153],
            ['start_time'=>345.92,'end_time'=>346.54,'target_text'=>'>> Heaven Palace.','source_text'=>'>> Istana Syurga.','order'=>154],
            ['start_time'=>346.64,'end_time'=>349.1,'target_text'=>'Maybe >> 3,000.','source_text'=>'Mungkin >> 3,000.','order'=>155],
            ['start_time'=>349.2,'end_time'=>356.78,'target_text'=>'That is the amount of words you need to understand up to 95% of spoken English.','source_text'=>'Itulah jumlah perkataan yang korang perlukan untuk faham sehingga 95% perbualan Bahasa Inggeris.','order'=>156],
            ['start_time'=>356.88,'end_time'=>363.74,'target_text'=>'But if you want to keep improving after that, I\'ve now added the next 2,000 most common English words.','source_text'=>'Tapi kalau korang nak terus tingkatkan penguasaan selepas itu, saya dah tambah 2,000 perkataan lazim seterusnya.','order'=>157],
            ['start_time'=>363.84,'end_time'=>371.5,'target_text'=>'So you can build the full 5,000word set and understand up to 98% of spoken English.','source_text'=>'Supaya korang boleh bina set penuh 5,000 perkataan dan faham sehingga 98% perbualan Bahasa Inggeris.','order'=>158],
            ['start_time'=>371.6,'end_time'=>381.02,'target_text'=>'So now you can start with the 30,000word PDF, continue with the next 2,000word PDF, or get both together as the full 5,000','source_text'=>'Jadi sekarang korang boleh mulakan dengan PDF 3,000 perkataan, sambung dengan PDF 2,000 perkataan seterusnya, atau dapatkan kedua-duanya sekali sebagai set penuh 5,000','order'=>159],
            ['start_time'=>381.12,'end_time'=>388.86,'target_text'=>'most common English words PDF that will allow you to understand up to 98% of spoken English.','source_text'=>'perkataan Bahasa Inggeris paling lazim dalam PDF yang akan membolehkan korang faham sehingga 98% pertuturan Bahasa Inggeris.','order'=>160],
            ['start_time'=>388.96,'end_time'=>395.98,'target_text'=>'And in these new versions, there are now images as well to help you learn even faster.','source_text'=>'Dan dalam versi baharu ini, ada gambar disertakan sekali untuk bantu korang belajar dengan lebih pantas.','order'=>161],
            ['start_time'=>396.08,'end_time'=>406.3,'target_text'=>'Each PDF includes clear definitions, real examples, and simple organization to help you stop studying random words, and focus','source_text'=>'Setiap PDF mengandungi maksud yang jelas, contoh sebenar, dan susunan mudah untuk bantu korang berhenti belajar perkataan rawak, dan fokus','order'=>162],
            ['start_time'=>406.4,'end_time'=>409.74,'target_text'=>'on the vocabulary that actually matters.','source_text'=>'pada kosa kata yang benar-benar penting.','order'=>163],
            ['start_time'=>409.84,'end_time'=>414.6,'target_text'=>'You can get them from the link in the description or at vulca.com.','source_text'=>'Korang boleh dapatkannya melalui pautan di ruangan deskripsi atau di vulca.com.','order'=>164],
            ['start_time'=>414.88,'end_time'=>416.14,'target_text'=>'>> We\'re going to go check them all out.','source_text'=>'>> Kita akan pergi teroka semua tempat tu.','order'=>165],
            ['start_time'=>416.24,'end_time'=>416.64,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>166],
            ['start_time'=>416.64,'end_time'=>419.26,'target_text'=>'>> And obviously eat all the unique Beijing foods.','source_text'=>'>> Dan sudah tentulah kita nak makan semua makanan unik di Beijing.','order'=>167],
            ['start_time'=>419.36,'end_time'=>422.94,'target_text'=>'>> I read all your comments, so I\'ve seen your uh recommendations.','source_text'=>'>> Saya baca semua komen korang, jadi saya dah nampak cadangan-cadangan korang.','order'=>168],
            ['start_time'=>423.04,'end_time'=>428.06,'target_text'=>'Some people have been saying obviously pecking duck Beijing style hot pot with like lamb and peanut sauce.','source_text'=>'Ada orang yang cadangkan itik panggang Beijing (Peking duck), stimbot gaya Beijing dengan daging kambing dan kuah kacang.','order'=>169],
            ['start_time'=>428.16,'end_time'=>428.94,'target_text'=>'That sounds amazing.','source_text'=>'Nampak sangat menyelerakan.','order'=>170],
            ['start_time'=>429.04,'end_time'=>430.94,'target_text'=>'I love I personally love lamb.','source_text'=>'Saya secara peribadi memang suka daging kambing.','order'=>171],
            ['start_time'=>431.04,'end_time'=>433.34,'target_text'=>'But yeah, great wall of China, Forbidden City, Temple of Heaven.','source_text'=>'Tapi ya, Tembok Besar China, Kota Larangan, Kuil Syurga (Temple of Heaven).','order'=>172],
            ['start_time'=>433.44,'end_time'=>433.9,'target_text'=>'That\'s what it was.','source_text'=>'Itulah tempatnya tadi.','order'=>173],
            ['start_time'=>434,'end_time'=>435.74,'target_text'=>'Temple of Heaven, Summer Palace.','source_text'=>'Kuil Syurga, Istana Musim Panas.','order'=>174],
            ['start_time'=>435.84,'end_time'=>438.06,'target_text'=>'I want to do the hop on hop off bus as well.','source_text'=>'Saya nak naik bas pelancong \'hop on hop off\' juga.','order'=>175],
            ['start_time'=>438.16,'end_time'=>442.94,'target_text'=>'DJI, get a DJI Osmo Pocket 4 Pro so I don\'t have to film with my phone.','source_text'=>'DJI, nak beli DJI Osmo Pocket 4 Pro supaya saya tak perlu rakam guna telefon saya.','order'=>176],
            ['start_time'=>443.04,'end_time'=>445.98,'target_text'=>'And maybe a smartwatch and maybe like clothing and stuff.','source_text'=>'Dan mungkin jam tangan pintar dan mungkin pakaian dan sebagainya.','order'=>177],
            ['start_time'=>446.08,'end_time'=>448.94,'target_text'=>'Oh, also, isn\'t China known for like their silk?','source_text'=>'Oh, lagipun, China bukan terkenal dengan sutera mereka ke?','order'=>178],
            ['start_time'=>449.04,'end_time'=>453.5,'target_text'=>'Yeah, there\'s a place called Silk Street that we\'re going to go to on our shopping day.','source_text'=>'Ya, ada tempat bernama Silk Street yang kita akan pergi pada hari membeli-belah kita.','order'=>179],
            ['start_time'=>453.6,'end_time'=>456.7,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, cuz I lowkey like wearing like silk bandanas now.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, sebab saya sekarang suka pakai bandana sutera.','order'=>180],
            ['start_time'=>456.8,'end_time'=>463.42,'target_text'=>'So, I want to buy more and I want it to be like a real authentic like silk bandana cuz I know there are a lot of fakes.','source_text'=>'Jadi, saya nak beli lagi dan saya nak yang sutera asli betul-betul sebab saya tahu banyak yang tiruan.','order'=>181],
            ['start_time'=>463.52,'end_time'=>471.1,'target_text'=>'So, it\'s just hard to find one that\'s real cuz I found some really nice ones in Hanoi when I was in Hanoi with our mom, but','source_text'=>'Jadi susah nak cari yang betul-betul asli sebab saya ada jumpa beberapa yang sangat cantik di Hanoi masa saya di Hanoi dengan mak kita, tapi','order'=>182],
            ['start_time'=>471.2,'end_time'=>472.94,'target_text'=>'uh the style was like busted.','source_text'=>'gayanya macam tak elok sangat.','order'=>183],
            ['start_time'=>473.04,'end_time'=>473.98,'target_text'=>'Did you see them?','source_text'=>'Awak ada nampak tak?','order'=>184],
            ['start_time'=>474.08,'end_time'=>474.48,'target_text'=>'>> I did.','source_text'=>'>> Ada, saya nampak.','order'=>185],
            ['start_time'=>474.56,'end_time'=>474.96,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>186],
            ['start_time'=>474.96,'end_time'=>481.26,'target_text'=>'But me and mom were there and we looked at that like whole Silk Street and a lot of the shops were like, \\\"Uh, is this real?\\\"','source_text'=>'Tapi saya dan mak pergi ke sana dan kami tengok sepanjang Silk Street tu dan banyak kedai yang buat kami rasa, \'Betul ke ini asli?\'','order'=>187],
            ['start_time'=>481.36,'end_time'=>484.94,'target_text'=>'But some of them were like, \\\"Okay, these are like nice.\\\" But obviously that comes with the price.','source_text'=>'Tapi ada sesetengah yang memang elok dan berkualiti. Tapi tentulah harganya lebih mahal.','order'=>188],
            ['start_time'=>485.04,'end_time'=>485.82,'target_text'=>'It\'s more expensive.','source_text'=>'Jauh lebih mahal.','order'=>189],
            ['start_time'=>485.92,'end_time'=>487.58,'target_text'=>'But I didn\'t like the design personally.','source_text'=>'Tapi saya secara peribadi tak suka reka bentuknya.','order'=>190],
            ['start_time'=>487.68,'end_time'=>489.1,'target_text'=>'It\'s not really my style.','source_text'=>'Bukan gaya saya sangat.','order'=>191],
            ['start_time'=>489.2,'end_time'=>491.1,'target_text'=>'I like the design of the bandana I have.','source_text'=>'Saya suka reka bentuk bandana yang saya pakai ni.','order'=>192],
            ['start_time'=>491.2,'end_time'=>493.66,'target_text'=>'I want that style but in different colors.','source_text'=>'Saya nak gaya macam tu tapi dalam warna yang berbeza.','order'=>193],
            ['start_time'=>493.76,'end_time'=>494.22,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya betul.','order'=>194],
            ['start_time'=>494.32,'end_time'=>497.42,'target_text'=>'>> Is there anything else you want to see in in Beijing?','source_text'=>'>> Ada apa-apa lagi yang awak nak tengok di Beijing?','order'=>195],
            ['start_time'=>497.52,'end_time'=>501.98,'target_text'=>'>> Uh, there\'s a really cool auto museum, a car museum that they have there.','source_text'=>'>> Ada muzium kereta yang sangat gempak di sana.','order'=>196],
            ['start_time'=>502.08,'end_time'=>506.14,'target_text'=>'It\'s like Chinese vehicles, but they have like some exhibitions going on right now.','source_text'=>'Muzium kenderaan buatan China, tapi mereka ada beberapa pameran khas yang sedang berlangsung sekarang.','order'=>197],
            ['start_time'=>506.24,'end_time'=>506.64,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, really?','source_text'=>'>> Oh ya ke?','order'=>198],
            ['start_time'=>506.72,'end_time'=>507.82,'target_text'=>'>> With robotics.','source_text'=>'>> Berkenaan robotik.','order'=>199],
            ['start_time'=>507.92,'end_time'=>508.24,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>200],
            ['start_time'=>508.24,'end_time'=>509.34,'target_text'=>'At at the museum.','source_text'=>'Di muzium tu.','order'=>201],
            ['start_time'=>509.44,'end_time'=>515.82,'target_text'=>'>> I should really search what else to do cuz we\'re going in 3 days and I haven\'t really like checked what there is that much.','source_text'=>'>> Saya patut buat carian apa lagi aktiviti lain sebab kita nak pergi 3 hari lagi dan saya belum sempat semak sangat apa yang ada.','order'=>202],
            ['start_time'=>515.92,'end_time'=>516.94,'target_text'=>'Just like the big things.','source_text'=>'Cuma tahu tempat-tempat tumpuan utama je.','order'=>203],
            ['start_time'=>517.04,'end_time'=>518.46,'target_text'=>'>> Well, I have a pretty packed schedule.','source_text'=>'>> Saya dah ada jadual yang agak padat.','order'=>204],
            ['start_time'=>518.56,'end_time'=>521.34,'target_text'=>'So, you can do >> read over the document I made.','source_text'=>'Jadi awak boleh baca dokumen yang saya dah buat.','order'=>205],
            ['start_time'=>521.44,'end_time'=>521.9,'target_text'=>'But, >> yeah.','source_text'=>'Tapi >> ya.','order'=>206],
            ['start_time'=>522,'end_time'=>526.54,'target_text'=>'One of the things I really want to get though is that camera cuz then I can use it as well.','source_text'=>'Satu benda yang saya teringin sangat nak beli ialah kamera tu sebab lepas tu saya pun boleh guna.','order'=>207],
            ['start_time'=>526.64,'end_time'=>531.5,'target_text'=>'It\'s just so convenient to film with a small camera, you know, instead of like carrying that big camera around.','source_text'=>'Sangat senang nak rakam video guna kamera kecil, daripada usung kamera besar ke sana sini.','order'=>208],
            ['start_time'=>531.6,'end_time'=>536.14,'target_text'=>'Although this looks nicer, it\'s just sometimes it\'s convenient, you know.','source_text'=>'Walaupun kamera besar kualitinya lebih cantik, tapi kamera kecil lebih mudah dan praktikal.','order'=>209],
            ['start_time'=>536.24,'end_time'=>538.38,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, for vlogs especially.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, terutamanya untuk vlog.','order'=>210],
            ['start_time'=>538.48,'end_time'=>540.46,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, also guys, >> what kind of car is that?','source_text'=>'>> Oh lagi satu kawan-kawan, >> kereta apa tu?','order'=>211],
            ['start_time'=>540.56,'end_time'=>540.96,'target_text'=>'>> I\'m blind.','source_text'=>'>> Mata saya kabur.','order'=>212],
            ['start_time'=>541.04,'end_time'=>541.98,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s a Rolls-Royce.','source_text'=>'>> Itu kereta Rolls-Royce.','order'=>213],
            ['start_time'=>542.08,'end_time'=>542.78,'target_text'=>'>> I\'m literally blind.','source_text'=>'>> Mata saya memang betul-betul kabur.','order'=>214],
            ['start_time'=>542.88,'end_time'=>543.66,'target_text'=>'I need glasses.','source_text'=>'Saya perlukan cermin mata.','order'=>215],
            ['start_time'=>543.76,'end_time'=>547.34,'target_text'=>'Okay, now I\'m blind is an exaggeration, but I just don\'t have very good vision.','source_text'=>'Okay, perkataan buta tadi sekadar melebih-lebih, tapi penglihatan saya memang tak berapa jelas.','order'=>216],
            ['start_time'=>547.44,'end_time'=>549.82,'target_text'=>'Now, this question is specifically for you guys.','source_text'=>'Sekarang, soalan ini khas untuk korang.','order'=>217],
            ['start_time'=>549.92,'end_time'=>552.86,'target_text'=>'Do you have other city recommendations in China?','source_text'=>'Korang ada cadangan bandar-bandar lain di China?','order'=>218],
            ['start_time'=>552.96,'end_time'=>554.7,'target_text'=>'Like what other cities to like visit?','source_text'=>'Macam bandar apa lagi yang menarik untuk dilawati?','order'=>219],
            ['start_time'=>554.8,'end_time'=>559.98,'target_text'=>'So, not just Beijing, cuz we\'re probably going to go to China again, depending on how well the situation is with the Wi-Fi','source_text'=>'Bukan sekadar Beijing, sebab kita mungkin akan pergi ke China lagi, bergantung kepada keadaan Wi-Fi','order'=>220],
            ['start_time'=>560.08,'end_time'=>562.06,'target_text'=>'and stuff, but we\'ll probably go for a month.','source_text'=>'dan sebagainya, tapi kemungkinan besar kita akan pergi selama sebulan.','order'=>221],
            ['start_time'=>562.16,'end_time'=>564.46,'target_text'=>'So, I really want to see as much of China as I can.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya teringin nak tengok seberapa banyak tempat di China yang saya mampu.','order'=>222],
            ['start_time'=>564.56,'end_time'=>572.94,'target_text'=>'So, give me recommendations, please, on activities, places to go, a good time to go, like events or like festivals, like something','source_text'=>'Jadi tolong berikan saya cadangan aktiviti, tempat menarik, waktu yang sesuai untuk pergi, seperti acara atau festival tradisional,','order'=>223],
            ['start_time'=>573.04,'end_time'=>576.94,'target_text'=>'traditional, things to eat, where to eat them, any recommendation really.','source_text'=>'makanan yang patut dicuba, tempat makan terbaik, apa-apa sahaja cadangan.','order'=>224],
            ['start_time'=>577.04,'end_time'=>577.98,'target_text'=>'Same thing for India.','source_text'=>'Perkara yang sama juga untuk India.','order'=>225],
            ['start_time'=>578.08,'end_time'=>583.34,'target_text'=>'We\'re also probably most likely going to go to India, India as well for a month.','source_text'=>'Kemungkinan besar kita juga akan pergi ke India selama sebulan.','order'=>226],
            ['start_time'=>583.44,'end_time'=>591.34,'target_text'=>'So if you have a recommendations for India, things to see, places to visit, activities to do, food to try, festivals or cultural','source_text'=>'Jadi kalau korang ada cadangan untuk India, tempat menarik, aktiviti, makanan untuk dicuba, festival atau acara kebudayaan','order'=>227],
            ['start_time'=>591.44,'end_time'=>597.82,'target_text'=>'like events or anything to attend, hidden gems, like things like that, things that only a local would know, let me know in','source_text'=>'yang patut dihadiri, tempat menarik tersembunyi (hidden gems) yang hanya orang tempatan tahu, beritahu saya di ruangan','order'=>228],
            ['start_time'=>597.92,'end_time'=>601.02,'target_text'=>'the comments and uh I\'ll really appreciate that.','source_text'=>'komen dan saya akan sangat menghargainya.','order'=>229],
            ['start_time'=>601.12,'end_time'=>604.38,'target_text'=>'And after that, we might go to Philippines and Japan.','source_text'=>'Dan selepas itu, kita mungkin akan ke Filipina dan Jepun.','order'=>230],
            ['start_time'=>604.48,'end_time'=>607.18,'target_text'=>'So if you have recommendations for those countries as well, let me know.','source_text'=>'Jadi kalau korang ada cadangan untuk negara-negara tersebut juga, beritahu saya.','order'=>231],
            ['start_time'=>607.28,'end_time'=>608.7,'target_text'=>'Obviously, I want to visit every country.','source_text'=>'Mestilah saya teringin nak melawat setiap negara di dunia.','order'=>232],
            ['start_time'=>608.8,'end_time'=>610.38,'target_text'=>'I know I always read you guys\' comments.','source_text'=>'Saya selalu baca komen-komen korang.','order'=>233],
            ['start_time'=>610.48,'end_time'=>620.7,'target_text'=>'So I see people saying come to Bangladesh, come to Pakistan, come to Brazil, come to Algeria, come to Europe.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya nampak orang kata jemputlah ke Bangladesh, jemput ke Pakistan, jemput ke Brazil, jemput ke Algeria, jemput ke Eropah.','order'=>234],
            ['start_time'=>620.8,'end_time'=>621.98,'target_text'=>'Just Europe in general.','source_text'=>'Kawasan Eropah secara umum.','order'=>235],
            ['start_time'=>622.08,'end_time'=>624.14,'target_text'=>'>> Uh the United States.','source_text'=>'>> Amerika Syarikat.','order'=>236],
            ['start_time'=>624.24,'end_time'=>626.06,'target_text'=>'>> The United States of America.','source_text'=>'>> Amerika Syarikat.','order'=>237],
            ['start_time'=>626.16,'end_time'=>626.56,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>238],
            ['start_time'=>626.56,'end_time'=>631.02,'target_text'=>'Obviously, I want to visit every single country I can in my life, but it just takes time.','source_text'=>'Sudah tentu saya nak melawat setiap negara yang termampu sepanjang hidup saya, cuma ia perlukan masa.','order'=>239],
            ['start_time'=>631.12,'end_time'=>635.18,'target_text'=>'I can\'t go to every country in like a year or I can\'t go to every country in a month.','source_text'=>'Saya tak boleh pergi ke semua negara dalam masa setahun atau sebulan.','order'=>240],
            ['start_time'=>635.28,'end_time'=>641.82,'target_text'=>'And I like to spend like a decent amount of time in a country so I could really like explore it and see things and stuff like','source_text'=>'Dan saya suka luangkan masa yang mencukupi di sesebuah negara supaya saya dapat benar-benar meneroka dan melihat pelbagai perkara','order'=>241],
            ['start_time'=>641.92,'end_time'=>642.38,'target_text'=>'that.','source_text'=>'seperti itu.','order'=>242],
            ['start_time'=>642.48,'end_time'=>646.38,'target_text'=>'So let me know and I will make sure to try to visit every country.','source_text'=>'Jadi beritahu saya dan saya akan pastikan untuk cuba melawat setiap negara.','order'=>243],
            ['start_time'=>646.48,'end_time'=>652.46,'target_text'=>'Don\'t ever be shy about talking in English and speaking in English, especially to really anyone cuz no one\'s going to judge','source_text'=>'Jangan sesekali rasa malu untuk bercakap dalam Bahasa Inggeris terutamanya dengan sesiapa sahaja sebab tiada siapa yang akan menilai','order'=>244],
            ['start_time'=>652.56,'end_time'=>654.06,'target_text'=>'you if you can\'t speak English well.','source_text'=>'anda kalau anda belum fasih berbahasa Inggeris.','order'=>245],
            ['start_time'=>654.16,'end_time'=>656.36,'target_text'=>'And if they do,','source_text'=>'Dan kalau ada yang menilai,','order'=>246],
            ['start_time'=>656.72,'end_time'=>660.54,'target_text'=>'okay, so now we\'re standing in a gazebo right now.','source_text'=>'okay, sekarang kita sedang berdiri di dalam sebuah gazebo.','order'=>247],
            ['start_time'=>660.64,'end_time'=>666.06,'target_text'=>'You can see there is just a roof over our heads and these pillars supporting it.','source_text'=>'Awak boleh nampak ada bumbung di atas kepala kita dan tiang-tiang ini yang menyokongnya.','order'=>248],
            ['start_time'=>666.16,'end_time'=>668.3,'target_text'=>'But there are no walls.','source_text'=>'Tapi tiada dinding.','order'=>249],
            ['start_time'=>668.4,'end_time'=>669.58,'target_text'=>'There are no walls.','source_text'=>'Tiada sebarang dinding.','order'=>250],
            ['start_time'=>669.68,'end_time'=>672.54,'target_text'=>'But there are these wooden beams.','source_text'=>'Tapi ada rasuk kayu ini.','order'=>251],
            ['start_time'=>672.64,'end_time'=>674.22,'target_text'=>'This isn\'t wood.','source_text'=>'Ini bukan kayu.','order'=>252],
            ['start_time'=>674.32,'end_time'=>675.34,'target_text'=>'This is plastic.','source_text'=>'Ini adalah plastik.','order'=>253],
            ['start_time'=>675.44,'end_time'=>676.46,'target_text'=>'>> Is it?','source_text'=>'>> Ya ke?','order'=>254],
            ['start_time'=>676.56,'end_time'=>676.96,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>255],
            ['start_time'=>676.96,'end_time'=>680.86,'target_text'=>'>> I guess inside it\'s probably just a metal pole and it doesn\'t look very nice.','source_text'=>'>> Saya rasa bahagian dalamnya mungkin sekadar tiang besi dan ia nampak kurang cantik.','order'=>256],
            ['start_time'=>680.96,'end_time'=>682.22,'target_text'=>'So they made it look like wood.','source_text'=>'Jadi mereka buat ia nampak seperti kayu.','order'=>257],
            ['start_time'=>682.32,'end_time'=>683.74,'target_text'=>'This right here though is wood.','source_text'=>'Tapi yang ini memang kayu betul.','order'=>258],
            ['start_time'=>683.84,'end_time'=>684.86,'target_text'=>'This is a wood bench.','source_text'=>'Ini bangku kayu.','order'=>259],
            ['start_time'=>684.96,'end_time'=>686.78,'target_text'=>'But let\'s go check out these yachts.','source_text'=>'Tapi jom kita pergi tengok kapal persiaran (yacht) di sana.','order'=>260],
