            ['start_time'=>689.68,'end_time'=>691.02,'target_text'=>'No, I have not.','source_text'=>'Belum, saya tak pernah naik.','order'=>263],
            ['start_time'=>691.12,'end_time'=>692.62,'target_text'=>'>> This is a marina.','source_text'=>'>> Ini adalah marina.','order'=>264],
            ['start_time'=>692.72,'end_time'=>693.66,'target_text'=>'This is a marina.','source_text'=>'Ini adalah marina.','order'=>265],
            ['start_time'=>693.76,'end_time'=>697.1,'target_text'=>'So, this is a place where boats come and dock.','source_text'=>'Iaitu tempat untuk bot datang dan berlabuh.','order'=>266],
            ['start_time'=>697.2,'end_time'=>698.3,'target_text'=>'So, this is a marina.','source_text'=>'Jadi, ini adalah marina.','order'=>267],
            ['start_time'=>698.4,'end_time'=>700.22,'target_text'=>'Vinhome Central Park Marina.','source_text'=>'Marina Vinhome Central Park.','order'=>268],
            ['start_time'=>700.32,'end_time'=>701.34,'target_text'=>'That is the name of it.','source_text'=>'Itulah namanya.','order'=>269],
            ['start_time'=>701.44,'end_time'=>703.18,'target_text'=>'>> I think this is a yacht club, too.','source_text'=>'>> Saya rasa ini kelab bot mewah juga.','order'=>270],
            ['start_time'=>703.28,'end_time'=>703.98,'target_text'=>'>> A yacht club?','source_text'=>'>> Kelab yacht?','order'=>271],
            ['start_time'=>704.08,'end_time'=>704.48,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>272],
            ['start_time'=>704.48,'end_time'=>705.26,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, probably.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, mungkin.','order'=>273],
            ['start_time'=>705.36,'end_time'=>707.9,'target_text'=>'I\'ve never been on a yacht.','source_text'=>'Saya tak pernah naik yacht.','order'=>274],
            ['start_time'=>708,'end_time'=>709.1,'target_text'=>'Like a luxury yacht.','source_text'=>'Maksud saya yacht mewah.','order'=>275],
            ['start_time'=>709.2,'end_time'=>710.38,'target_text'=>'I\'ve been on cruise ships.','source_text'=>'Saya pernah naik kapal persiaran besar (cruise ship).','order'=>276],
            ['start_time'=>710.48,'end_time'=>711.02,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>277],
            ['start_time'=>711.12,'end_time'=>713.74,'target_text'=>'Like in the Gopagos and places like that.','source_text'=>'Macam di Galapagos dan tempat-tempat seumpamanya.','order'=>278],
            ['start_time'=>713.84,'end_time'=>716.3,'target_text'=>'I honestly I think I\'ve just been on one cruise ship.','source_text'=>'Sejujurnya saya rasa saya baru naik satu kapal cruise.','order'=>279],
            ['start_time'=>716.4,'end_time'=>717.5,'target_text'=>'That was in the Gopagos.','source_text'=>'Iaitu di Galapagos.','order'=>280],
            ['start_time'=>717.6,'end_time'=>718.78,'target_text'=>'Actually, also in Vietnam.','source_text'=>'Sebenarnya di Vietnam pun ada.','order'=>281],
            ['start_time'=>718.88,'end_time'=>721.98,'target_text'=>'I\'ve been on cruise ships twice in Vietnam, so three times in total.','source_text'=>'Saya pernah naik kapal cruise dua kali di Vietnam, jadi semuanya tiga kali.','order'=>282],
            ['start_time'=>722.08,'end_time'=>728.06,'target_text'=>'They\'re pretty nice, but I haven\'t been on like, you know, those like huge like huge cruise ships like that are like floating','source_text'=>'Memang seronok, tapi saya belum pernah naik kapal persiaran gergasi yang macam bandar terapung','order'=>283],
            ['start_time'=>728.16,'end_time'=>730.14,'target_text'=>'cities like Carnival cruises and stuff.','source_text'=>'seperti kapal Carnival Cruise dan sebagainya.','order'=>284],
            ['start_time'=>730.24,'end_time'=>733.32,'target_text'=>'>> Ocean ship >> intercontinental','source_text'=>'>> Kapal lautan >> kapal cruise','order'=>285],
            ['start_time'=>733.44,'end_time'=>734.14,'target_text'=>'cruise ships.','source_text'=>'antara benua.','order'=>286],
            ['start_time'=>734.24,'end_time'=>737.18,'target_text'=>'>> Well, what\'s like the ocean version of intercontinental?','source_text'=>'>> Apa panggilan untuk versi lautan bagi rentas benua?','order'=>287],
            ['start_time'=>737.28,'end_time'=>737.68,'target_text'=>'>> I don\'t know.','source_text'=>'>> Entahlah.','order'=>288],
            ['start_time'=>737.76,'end_time'=>740.94,'target_text'=>'I\'m not a fisherman, >> but those cruise ships are huge.','source_text'=>'Saya bukan nelayan, >> tapi kapal-kapal cruise tu memang sangat besar.','order'=>289],
            ['start_time'=>741.04,'end_time'=>745.82,'target_text'=>'I think I would want to go on a cruise ship once in my life just to experience it, but I don\'t know.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa saya teringin nak naik kapal cruise sekali seumur hidup untuk rasai pengalamannya, tapi entahlah.','order'=>290],
            ['start_time'=>745.92,'end_time'=>747.9,'target_text'=>'Sometimes it doesn\'t look that fun.','source_text'=>'Kadang-kadang nampak macam tak berapa seronok sangat.','order'=>291],
            ['start_time'=>748,'end_time'=>751.66,'target_text'=>'No, but you know which one which cruise I want to really go on?','source_text'=>'Bukan, tapi awak tahu cruise mana yang saya teringin sangat nak pergi?','order'=>292],
            ['start_time'=>751.76,'end_time'=>752.3,'target_text'=>'>> Which one?','source_text'=>'>> Yang mana satu?','order'=>293],
            ['start_time'=>752.4,'end_time'=>754.22,'target_text'=>'>> The Antarctic cruise.','source_text'=>'>> Cruise ke Antartika.','order'=>294],
            ['start_time'=>754.32,'end_time'=>754.94,'target_text'=>'>> Antarctic.','source_text'=>'>> Antartika.','order'=>295],
            ['start_time'=>755.04,'end_time'=>755.2,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>296],
            ['start_time'=>755.2,'end_time'=>757.34,'target_text'=>'That best ever food review show went on.','source_text'=>'Yang dalam rancangan Best Ever Food Review Show tu.','order'=>297],
            ['start_time'=>757.44,'end_time'=>757.76,'target_text'=>'>> Really?','source_text'=>'>> Betul ke?','order'=>298],
            ['start_time'=>757.76,'end_time'=>758,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>299],
            ['start_time'=>758,'end_time'=>764.38,'target_text'=>'They left from the tip of I think it\'s Chile in South America and then they went down to Antarctica.','source_text'=>'Mereka bertolak dari hujung negara Chile di Amerika Selatan dan kemudian belayar turun ke Antartika.','order'=>300],
            ['start_time'=>764.48,'end_time'=>767.58,'target_text'=>'Went onto the continent of Antarctica.','source_text'=>'Mendarat di benua Antartika.','order'=>301],
            ['start_time'=>767.68,'end_time'=>768.78,'target_text'=>'Checked out penguins.','source_text'=>'Tengok penguin.','order'=>302],
            ['start_time'=>768.88,'end_time'=>769.2,'target_text'=>'>> Wow.','source_text'=>'>> Wah.','order'=>303],
            ['start_time'=>769.2,'end_time'=>772.14,'target_text'=>'>> I think they might have even jumped into the water too.','source_text'=>'>> Saya rasa mereka ada terjun masuk ke dalam air juga.','order'=>304],
            ['start_time'=>772.24,'end_time'=>774.14,'target_text'=>'But that was that\'s a cool cruise.','source_text'=>'Tapi itu memang pengalaman cruise yang sangat gempak.','order'=>305],
            ['start_time'=>774.24,'end_time'=>777.98,'target_text'=>'But it was like $40,000 I think >> each >> per person.','source_text'=>'Tapi harganya sekitar $40,000 saya rasa >> setiap seorang >> untuk seorang.','order'=>306],
            ['start_time'=>778.08,'end_time'=>778.4,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>307],
            ['start_time'=>778.4,'end_time'=>779.82,'target_text'=>'>> Oh my gosh.','source_text'=>'>> Ya ampun.','order'=>308],
            ['start_time'=>779.92,'end_time'=>781.02,'target_text'=>'>> $40,000.','source_text'=>'>> $40,000.','order'=>309],
            ['start_time'=>781.12,'end_time'=>783.02,'target_text'=>'And it probably wasn\'t even for that long.','source_text'=>'Dan tempohnya mungkin tak berapa lama pun.','order'=>310],
            ['start_time'=>783.12,'end_time'=>783.36,'target_text'=>'>> No.','source_text'=>'>> Tak lama.','order'=>311],
            ['start_time'=>783.36,'end_time'=>784.3,'target_text'=>'>> How long was it for?','source_text'=>'>> Berapa hari je?','order'=>312],
            ['start_time'=>784.4,'end_time'=>785.42,'target_text'=>'>> Like 3 days maybe?','source_text'=>'>> Dalam 3 hari rasanya?','order'=>313],
            ['start_time'=>785.52,'end_time'=>786.06,'target_text'=>'>> 3 days.','source_text'=>'>> 3 hari.','order'=>314],
            ['start_time'=>786.16,'end_time'=>787.02,'target_text'=>'>> 3 4 days.','source_text'=>'>> 3 atau 4 hari.','order'=>315],
            ['start_time'=>787.12,'end_time'=>791.34,'target_text'=>'>> I mean, I guess it\'s just expensive to go to that part of the world since almost no one goes there.','source_text'=>'>> Saya rasa memang mahal untuk pergi ke bahagian dunia sebelah sana sebab hampir tiada siapa yang ke sana.','order'=>316],
            ['start_time'=>791.44,'end_time'=>795.18,'target_text'=>'I feel like if I go on a cruise, I want it to be like warm outside.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa kalau saya nak naik cruise, saya nak cuaca di luar panas dan selesa.','order'=>317],
            ['start_time'=>795.28,'end_time'=>799.82,'target_text'=>'So when I go out on the deck, I\'m just like it\'s just nice and warm, you know?','source_text'=>'Supaya bila saya keluar ke dek kapal, suasananya nyaman dan hangat, kan?','order'=>318],
            ['start_time'=>799.92,'end_time'=>804.78,'target_text'=>'But I would like to go on one of those mega cruises like Carnival or something like that.','source_text'=>'Tapi saya teringin nak naik kapal cruise mega seperti Carnival atau seumpamanya.','order'=>319],
            ['start_time'=>804.88,'end_time'=>807.26,'target_text'=>'But I know they do get super super busy.','source_text'=>'Cuma saya tahu tempat macam tu akan jadi terlalu padat dan sibuk.','order'=>320],
            ['start_time'=>807.36,'end_time'=>807.82,'target_text'=>'But I don\'t know.','source_text'=>'Tapi entahlah.','order'=>321],
            ['start_time'=>807.92,'end_time'=>809.34,'target_text'=>'I think it would just be a cool experience.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa ia satu pengalaman yang menarik.','order'=>322],
            ['start_time'=>809.44,'end_time'=>810.38,'target_text'=>'Maybe for like a week.','source_text'=>'Mungkin untuk tempoh seminggu.','order'=>323],
            ['start_time'=>810.48,'end_time'=>811.66,'target_text'=>'Maybe I\'ll make a video out of it.','source_text'=>'Mungkin saya boleh buat video mengenainya.','order'=>324],
            ['start_time'=>811.76,'end_time'=>814.62,'target_text'=>'But yeah, these are some yachts around here.','source_text'=>'Tapi ya, inilah beberapa buah yacht di sekitar sini.','order'=>325],
            ['start_time'=>814.72,'end_time'=>815.58,'target_text'=>'Some yachts.','source_text'=>'Beberapa buah yacht.','order'=>326],
            ['start_time'=>815.68,'end_time'=>816.46,'target_text'=>'>> What\'s that boat there?','source_text'=>'>> Bot apa yang ada kat sana tu?','order'=>327],
            ['start_time'=>816.56,'end_time'=>818.46,'target_text'=>'It looks a little different from the rest.','source_text'=>'Nampak lain sikit daripada yang lain.','order'=>328],
            ['start_time'=>818.56,'end_time'=>820.38,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, that\'s called a catamarang.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, itu dipanggil bot katamaran (catamaran).','order'=>329],
            ['start_time'=>820.48,'end_time'=>823.58,'target_text'=>'So you can see these ships just have one hole.','source_text'=>'Awak boleh nampak kapal-kapal biasa cuma ada satu lunas (hull).','order'=>330],
            ['start_time'=>823.68,'end_time'=>825.42,'target_text'=>'That catamarang has two.','source_text'=>'Katamaran tu ada dua lunas.','order'=>331],
            ['start_time'=>825.52,'end_time'=>826.86,'target_text'=>'>> And you know why they do that?','source_text'=>'>> Awak tahu kenapa mereka buat macam tu?','order'=>332],
            ['start_time'=>826.96,'end_time'=>828.86,'target_text'=>'>> They do that to keep the boat more steady.','source_text'=>'>> Mereka buat macam tu untuk jadikan bot lebih stabil dan tenang.','order'=>333],
            ['start_time'=>828.96,'end_time'=>835.9,'target_text'=>'So, if you get seasick often or you have a weak stomach, those boats are for you because they\'re a lot more stable, which','source_text'=>'Jadi kalau awak jenis mudah mabuk laut atau perut sensitif, bot macam tu sangat sesuai untuk awak sebab ia jauh lebih stabil,','order'=>334],
            ['start_time'=>836,'end_time'=>839.5,'target_text'=>'makes sense cuz instead of like a normal boat like this, it\'s like this.','source_text'=>'dan memang masuk akal sebab daripada bot biasa yang macam ni, ia ada dua tapak macam ni.','order'=>335],
            ['start_time'=>839.6,'end_time'=>841.18,'target_text'=>'So, it\'s more stable.','source_text'=>'Jadi ia lebih stabil.','order'=>336],
            ['start_time'=>841.28,'end_time'=>842.78,'target_text'=>'But yeah, interesting.','source_text'=>'Tapi ya, menarik sungguh.','order'=>337],
            ['start_time'=>842.88,'end_time'=>846.22,'target_text'=>'I did not know they had yachts here cuz this isn\'t even the ocean.','source_text'=>'Saya tak sangka mereka ada yacht di sini sebab ini bukan laut pun.','order'=>338],
            ['start_time'=>846.32,'end_time'=>847.5,'target_text'=>'This is just a river.','source_text'=>'Ini cuma sebatang sungai.','order'=>339],
            ['start_time'=>847.6,'end_time'=>850.62,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, >> but it\'s the Mikong Delta.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, >> tapi ini Delta Mekong.','order'=>340],
            ['start_time'=>850.72,'end_time'=>852.38,'target_text'=>'>> Uh, no.','source_text'=>'>> Bukan.','order'=>341],
            ['start_time'=>852.48,'end_time'=>855.1,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, >> this isn\'t the >> It leads to the Meong Mikong Delta.','source_text'=>'>> Oh, >> ini bukan >> Sungai ini mengalir ke Delta Mekong.','order'=>342],
            ['start_time'=>855.2,'end_time'=>856.62,'target_text'=>'>> No, it\'s like an hour ride from here.','source_text'=>'>> Bukan, dari sini ke sana ambil masa kira-kira sejam perjalanan.','order'=>343],
            ['start_time'=>856.72,'end_time'=>860.7,'target_text'=>'But uh this river is called the Saigon River.','source_text'=>'Tapi sungai ini dinamakan Sungai Saigon.','order'=>344],
            ['start_time'=>860.8,'end_time'=>861.74,'target_text'=>'>> That\'s what I said.','source_text'=>'>> Itulah yang saya maksudkan tadi.','order'=>345],
            ['start_time'=>861.84,'end_time'=>862.78,'target_text'=>'Saigon River.','source_text'=>'Sungai Saigon.','order'=>346],
            ['start_time'=>862.88,'end_time'=>865.58,'target_text'=>'>> But it\'s the Mikong >> Delta.','source_text'=>'>> Tapi ini laluan Mekong >> Delta.','order'=>347],
            ['start_time'=>865.68,'end_time'=>866.22,'target_text'=>'>> That\'s the one.','source_text'=>'>> Itulah dia.','order'=>348],
            ['start_time'=>866.32,'end_time'=>867.9,'target_text'=>'>> Have you been to the Mikong?','source_text'=>'>> Awak pernah pergi ke Mekong?','order'=>349],
            ['start_time'=>868,'end_time'=>868.62,'target_text'=>'>> No, I haven\'t.','source_text'=>'>> Belum, saya belum pernah pergi.','order'=>350],
            ['start_time'=>868.72,'end_time'=>870.22,'target_text'=>'I also want to go to the Chuchi Tunnels.','source_text'=>'Saya teringin juga nak melawat Terowong Cu Chi.','order'=>351],
            ['start_time'=>870.32,'end_time'=>870.78,'target_text'=>'Have you been there?','source_text'=>'Awak pernah pergi ke sana?','order'=>352],
            ['start_time'=>870.88,'end_time'=>871.28,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Pernah.','order'=>353],
            ['start_time'=>871.36,'end_time'=>872.06,'target_text'=>'It\'s amazing.','source_text'=>'Tempat tu memang menakjubkan.','order'=>354],
            ['start_time'=>872.16,'end_time'=>874.22,'target_text'=>'It\'s probably one of the best experiences.','source_text'=>'Ia mungkin antara pengalaman terbaik.','order'=>355],
            ['start_time'=>874.32,'end_time'=>874.78,'target_text'=>'>> The tunnels.','source_text'=>'>> Terowong tu.','order'=>356],
            ['start_time'=>874.88,'end_time'=>875.28,'target_text'=>'>> Vietnam.','source_text'=>'>> Di Vietnam.','order'=>357],
            ['start_time'=>875.36,'end_time'=>875.76,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>358],
            ['start_time'=>875.76,'end_time'=>876.78,'target_text'=>'>> It looks really cool.','source_text'=>'>> Nampak sangat menarik.','order'=>359],
            ['start_time'=>876.88,'end_time'=>877.58,'target_text'=>'I really want to go.','source_text'=>'Saya teringin sangat nak pergi.','order'=>360],
            ['start_time'=>877.68,'end_time'=>878.86,'target_text'=>'I I\'ve never been.','source_text'=>'Saya belum pernah sampai lagi.','order'=>361],
            ['start_time'=>878.96,'end_time'=>879.66,'target_text'=>'I\'ve never been.','source_text'=>'Belum pernah sampai.','order'=>362],
            ['start_time'=>879.76,'end_time'=>882.3,'target_text'=>'But I\'ve been to Vietnam before, but I just have never been there.','source_text'=>'Saya pernah ke Vietnam sebelum ini, cuma saya belum pernah melawat terowong tu.','order'=>363],
            ['start_time'=>882.4,'end_time'=>887.44,'target_text'=>'And we\'ve been in Vietnam for like a month, two months, and we still haven\'t even seen that.','source_text'=>'Dan kita dah berada di Vietnam selama sebulan dua, tapi masih belum sempat tengok tempat tu.','order'=>364],
            ['start_time'=>887.54,'end_time'=>888.78,'target_text'=>'[snorts] I should go see it.','source_text'=>'Saya patut pergi tengok.','order'=>365],
            ['start_time'=>888.88,'end_time'=>889.42,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya betul.','order'=>366],
            ['start_time'=>889.52,'end_time'=>891.34,'target_text'=>'>> Next month after China.','source_text'=>'>> Bulan depan selepas kita balik dari China.','order'=>367],
            ['start_time'=>891.44,'end_time'=>892.22,'target_text'=>'>> Oh yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya betul.','order'=>368],
            ['start_time'=>892.32,'end_time'=>895.02,'target_text'=>'What else do you want to do once you come back from China?','source_text'=>'Apa lagi yang awak nak buat lepas balik dari China nanti?','order'=>369],
            ['start_time'=>895.12,'end_time'=>898.7,'target_text'=>'>> I want to go to Hoyan and get like leather goods made.','source_text'=>'>> Saya nak pergi ke Hoi An dan tempah barangan kulit.','order'=>370],
            ['start_time'=>898.8,'end_time'=>900.3,'target_text'=>'I want to get like a leather bag.','source_text'=>'Saya nak dapatkan sebuah beg kulit.','order'=>371],
            ['start_time'=>900.4,'end_time'=>902.7,'target_text'=>'>> And why that town specifically?','source_text'=>'>> Kenapa bandar tu secara khusus?','order'=>372],
            ['start_time'=>902.8,'end_time'=>908.78,'target_text'=>'>> Because Hoyan is known for like according to what I\'ve seen online like their leather goods and craftsmanship.','source_text'=>'>> Sebab Hoi An terkenal, berdasarkan apa yang saya lihat di internet, dengan barangan kulit dan pertukangan seninya.','order'=>373],
            ['start_time'=>908.88,'end_time'=>912.7,'target_text'=>'and they just could make a lot of like custom leather products for you.','source_text'=>'Dan mereka boleh buat banyak barangan kulit tempahan khas untuk awak.','order'=>374],
            ['start_time'=>912.8,'end_time'=>916.54,'target_text'=>'Specifically like bags or jackets, like leather jackets and stuff like that.','source_text'=>'Khususnya seperti beg atau jaket kulit dan sebagainya.','order'=>375],
            ['start_time'=>916.64,'end_time'=>918.7,'target_text'=>'Maybe I\'ll get a leather jacket, too.','source_text'=>'Mungkin saya akan tempah jaket kulit sekali.','order'=>376],
            ['start_time'=>918.8,'end_time'=>919.9,'target_text'=>'But let\'s sit down on this bench.','source_text'=>'Tapi jom kita duduk atas bangku ni.','order'=>377],
            ['start_time'=>920,'end_time'=>923.02,'target_text'=>'I could lowkey use like something to drink.','source_text'=>'Sedap juga kalau dapat minum sesuatu sekarang.','order'=>378],
            ['start_time'=>923.12,'end_time'=>924.46,'target_text'=>'What about you?','source_text'=>'Awak pula macam mana?','order'=>379],
            ['start_time'=>924.56,'end_time'=>927.66,'target_text'=>'Don\'t just watch this lesson and forget it.','source_text'=>'Jangan sekadar tonton video pembelajaran ini dan melupakannya begitu sahaja.','order'=>380],
            ['start_time'=>927.76,'end_time'=>935.02,'target_text'=>'Get the workbook for this video on my website and practice everything from the lesson more deeply.','source_text'=>'Dapatkan buku latihan (workbook) untuk video ini di laman web saya dan latih semua isi pelajaran dengan lebih mendalam.','order'=>381],
            ['start_time'=>935.12,'end_time'=>944.7,'target_text'=>'Inside, you\'ll review the grammar, vocabulary, tenses, sentence patterns, comprehension questions, and real English from this','source_text'=>'Di dalamnya, anda akan mengulang kaji tatabahasa, kosa kata, kala masa (tenses), pola ayat, soalan kefahaman, dan Bahasa Inggeris sebenar daripada','order'=>382],
            ['start_time'=>944.8,'end_time'=>949.18,'target_text'=>'video with clear explanations and exercises.','source_text'=>'video ini berserta penerangan yang jelas dan latihan praktikal.','order'=>383],
            ['start_time'=>949.28,'end_time'=>954.38,'target_text'=>'Watching helps you understand, but practicing helps you remember.','source_text'=>'Menonton membantu anda memahami, tetapi membuat latihan membantu anda mengingati.','order'=>384],
            ['start_time'=>954.48,'end_time'=>959.66,'target_text'=>'And when you buy five or more workbooks, you automatically get 30% off at checkout.','source_text'=>'Dan apabila anda membeli lima atau lebih buku latihan, anda akan mendapat potongan 30% secara automatik semasa pembayaran.','order'=>385],
            ['start_time'=>959.76,'end_time'=>963.64,'target_text'=>'The link is in the description or at vulca.com.','source_text'=>'Pautannya ada di ruangan deskripsi atau di vulca.com.','order'=>386],
            ['start_time'=>964.16,'end_time'=>966.46,'target_text'=>'Yeah, I did drink a lot of water.','source_text'=>'Ya, saya tadi dah minum banyak air.','order'=>387],
            ['start_time'=>966.56,'end_time'=>966.88,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>388],
            ['start_time'=>966.88,'end_time'=>967.9,'target_text'=>'>> So, I think I\'m okay now.','source_text'=>'>> Jadi saya rasa saya okay sekarang.','order'=>389],
            ['start_time'=>968,'end_time'=>972.62,'target_text'=>'>> I I drank water and I drank electrolytes before coming here, but I\'m still kind of like thirsty.','source_text'=>'>> Saya dah minum air dan minum minuman elektrolit sebelum datang ke sini, tapi saya masih rasa dahaga.','order'=>390],
            ['start_time'=>972.72,'end_time'=>973.9,'target_text'=>'Eh, >> are you sweating?','source_text'=>'Awak berpeluh tak?','order'=>391],
            ['start_time'=>974,'end_time'=>974.94,'target_text'=>'>> I\'m actually not sweating.','source_text'=>'>> Sebenarnya saya tak berpeluh pun.','order'=>392],
            ['start_time'=>975.04,'end_time'=>976.46,'target_text'=>'No, I\'m just like thirsty.','source_text'=>'Cuma saya rasa dahaga.','order'=>393],
            ['start_time'=>976.56,'end_time'=>979.74,'target_text'=>'I think I\'ve been drinking too much water cuz I\'m thirsty all the time now.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa saya dah terlebih minum air sebab sekarang saya asyik rasa dahaga sepanjang masa.','order'=>394],
            ['start_time'=>979.84,'end_time'=>981.5,'target_text'=>'And it\'s not like thirsty like, oh, I need a drink.','source_text'=>'Dan bukan dahaga biasa macam, \'Oh, nak minum sikit.\'','order'=>395],
            ['start_time'=>981.6,'end_time'=>983.18,'target_text'=>'It\'s thirsty like I need to drink.','source_text'=>'Ini rasa dahaga yang macam saya betul-betul kena minum.','order'=>396],
            ['start_time'=>983.28,'end_time'=>985.9,'target_text'=>'Like I\'m just like so like parched.','source_text'=>'Macam tekak saya betul-betul kering kontang.','order'=>397],
            ['start_time'=>986,'end_time'=>987.02,'target_text'=>'I\'m just so thirsty.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa tersangatlah dahaga.','order'=>398],
            ['start_time'=>987.12,'end_time'=>987.52,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know.','source_text'=>'Entahlah.','order'=>399],
            ['start_time'=>987.52,'end_time'=>988.38,'target_text'=>'Have you felt like that?','source_text'=>'Awak pernah rasa macam tu tak?','order'=>400],
            ['start_time'=>988.48,'end_time'=>992.89,'target_text'=>'>> I felt like that before and that was usually because I was like mineral depleted.','source_text'=>'>> Saya pernah rasa macam tu sebelum ni dan biasanya sebab saya kekurangan mineral.','order'=>401],
            ['start_time'=>992.99,'end_time'=>995.1,'target_text'=>'[snorts] Not because I was actually thirsty.','source_text'=>'Bukan sebab saya betul-betul dahagakan air.','order'=>402],
            ['start_time'=>995.2,'end_time'=>998.62,'target_text'=>'>> Low key, I think I\'m I\'m low on minerals like sodium.','source_text'=>'>> Saya rasa badan saya kekurangan mineral seperti natrium (garam).','order'=>403],
            ['start_time'=>998.72,'end_time'=>1000.38,'target_text'=>'Maybe I should eat more salty food.','source_text'=>'Mungkin saya patut makan makanan yang lebih masin.','order'=>404],
            ['start_time'=>1000.48,'end_time'=>1002.38,'target_text'=>'>> Sodium, magnesium for sure.','source_text'=>'>> Natrium dan magnesium sudah semestinya.','order'=>405],
            ['start_time'=>1002.48,'end_time'=>1003.74,'target_text'=>'>> What\'s a good source?','source_text'=>'>> Dari mana sumber yang baik?','order'=>406],
            ['start_time'=>1003.84,'end_time'=>1005.82,'target_text'=>'I guess electrolyte drinks.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa minuman elektrolit.','order'=>407],
            ['start_time'=>1005.92,'end_time'=>1007.26,'target_text'=>'>> No, like for what?','source_text'=>'>> Bukan, untuk apa?','order'=>408],
            ['start_time'=>1007.36,'end_time'=>1007.98,'target_text'=>'Sodium.','source_text'=>'Natrium.','order'=>409],
            ['start_time'=>1008.08,'end_time'=>1009.26,'target_text'=>'>> Coconut water.','source_text'=>'>> Air kelapa.','order'=>410],
            ['start_time'=>1009.36,'end_time'=>1009.9,'target_text'=>'>> Meat.','source_text'=>'>> Daging.','order'=>411],
            ['start_time'=>1010,'end_time'=>1011.26,'target_text'=>'>> McDonald\'s.','source_text'=>'>> McDonald\'s.','order'=>412],
            ['start_time'=>1011.36,'end_time'=>1012.78,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, it\'s pretty salty.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, makanan tu memang masin.','order'=>413],
            ['start_time'=>1012.88,'end_time'=>1013.42,'target_text'=>'>> Jollibee.','source_text'=>'>> Jollibee.','order'=>414],
            ['start_time'=>1013.52,'end_time'=>1013.92,'target_text'=>'Low key.','source_text'=>'Secara jujurnya.','order'=>415],
            ['start_time'=>1014,'end_time'=>1015.98,'target_text'=>'We had Jollibee a week ago or something.','source_text'=>'Kita ada makan Jollibee kira-kira seminggu lepas.','order'=>416],
            ['start_time'=>1016.08,'end_time'=>1016.7,'target_text'=>'Kind of good.','source_text'=>'Boleh tahan sedap.','order'=>417],
            ['start_time'=>1016.8,'end_time'=>1018.54,'target_text'=>'Very sweet, but it was good.','source_text'=>'Sangat manis, tapi memang sedap.','order'=>418],
            ['start_time'=>1018.64,'end_time'=>1020.78,'target_text'=>'But that was like Filipino spaghetti.','source_text'=>'Tapi itu spageti gaya Filipina.','order'=>419],
            ['start_time'=>1020.88,'end_time'=>1023.34,'target_text'=>'Yeah, >> cuz they use uh banana ketchup in it.','source_text'=>'Ya, >> sebab mereka gunakan sos tomato pisang (banana ketchup) di dalamnya.','order'=>420],
            ['start_time'=>1023.44,'end_time'=>1024.38,'target_text'=>'That\'s why it\'s so sweet.','source_text'=>'Sebab tu rasanya sangat manis.','order'=>421],
            ['start_time'=>1024.48,'end_time'=>1026.22,'target_text'=>'>> It was really sweet and also like very red.','source_text'=>'>> Rasanya memang manis dan warnanya pun sangat merah.','order'=>422],
            ['start_time'=>1026.32,'end_time'=>1026.94,'target_text'=>'But it it was good.','source_text'=>'Tapi rasanya sedap.','order'=>423],
            ['start_time'=>1027.04,'end_time'=>1030.22,'target_text'=>'It was my first time having Jollibee spaghetti and chicken.','source_text'=>'Itu kali pertama saya makan spageti dan ayam goreng Jollibee.','order'=>424],
            ['start_time'=>1030.32,'end_time'=>1032.22,'target_text'=>'>> You missed out on the hamburgers.','source_text'=>'>> Awak terlepas rasa burger dia.','order'=>425],
            ['start_time'=>1032.32,'end_time'=>1034.06,'target_text'=>'They don\'t have them here in Vietnam.','source_text'=>'Mereka tak jual burger tu di Vietnam.','order'=>426],
            ['start_time'=>1034.16,'end_time'=>1036.38,'target_text'=>'But the hamburger, they call it a yum burger.','source_text'=>'Tapi burger tu dinamakan Yum Burger.','order'=>427],
            ['start_time'=>1036.48,'end_time'=>1037.02,'target_text'=>'>> Yum.','source_text'=>'>> Yum.','order'=>428],
            ['start_time'=>1037.12,'end_time'=>1037.66,'target_text'=>'>> Yum burger.','source_text'=>'>> Yum burger.','order'=>429],
            ['start_time'=>1037.76,'end_time'=>1038.22,'target_text'=>'Like yummy.','source_text'=>'Maksudnya sedap.','order'=>430],
            ['start_time'=>1038.32,'end_time'=>1042.94,'target_text'=>'And it\'s a beef burger with just beef, cheese, and this like really good sauce.','source_text'=>'Dan ia burger daging dengan hanya daging lembu, keju, dan sos istimewa yang sangat sedap.','order'=>431],
            ['start_time'=>1043.04,'end_time'=>1044.3,'target_text'=>'They call it yum sauce.','source_text'=>'Mereka panggil ia sos Yum.','order'=>432],
            ['start_time'=>1044.4,'end_time'=>1044.94,'target_text'=>'>> Yum.','source_text'=>'>> Yum.','order'=>433],
            ['start_time'=>1045.04,'end_time'=>1045.74,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s like a slider.','source_text'=>'>> Saiznya macam burger mini (slider).','order'=>434],
            ['start_time'=>1045.84,'end_time'=>1046.86,'target_text'=>'It\'s so good.','source_text'=>'Memang sedap sangat.','order'=>435],
            ['start_time'=>1046.96,'end_time'=>1048.38,'target_text'=>'M yum.','source_text'=>'Mmm sedap.','order'=>436],
            ['start_time'=>1048.48,'end_time'=>1051.34,'target_text'=>'So, >> if you\'re Filipino, like you know what I\'m talking about.','source_text'=>'Jadi, >> kalau korang orang Filipina, korang pasti tahu apa yang saya maksudkan.','order'=>437],
            ['start_time'=>1051.44,'end_time'=>1053.18,'target_text'=>'>> If you\'re Filipino, let me know.','source_text'=>'>> Kalau korang orang Filipina, beritahu saya.','order'=>438],
            ['start_time'=>1053.28,'end_time'=>1057.18,'target_text'=>'Do you love Jollibee or do you just like it?','source_text'=>'Korang memang suka sangat Jollibee atau sekadar suka biasa?','order'=>439],
            ['start_time'=>1057.28,'end_time'=>1059.9,'target_text'=>'Let me know cuz I assume you guys love it.','source_text'=>'Beritahu saya sebab saya yakin korang mesti sukakannya.','order'=>440],
            ['start_time'=>1060,'end_time'=>1061.42,'target_text'=>'I\'m not Filipino and I love it.','source_text'=>'Saya bukan orang Filipina tapi saya memang sukakannya.','order'=>441],
            ['start_time'=>1061.52,'end_time'=>1065.5,'target_text'=>'And I feel like a lot of non-Filipinos like it too, so I don\'t think that\'s even a requirement.','source_text'=>'Dan saya rasa ramai orang bukan Filipina pun sukakannya juga, jadi itu bukan satu syarat pun.','order'=>442],
            ['start_time'=>1065.6,'end_time'=>1065.92,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya betul.','order'=>443],
            ['start_time'=>1065.92,'end_time'=>1066.78,'target_text'=>'>> No, but it\'s actually good.','source_text'=>'>> Memang sedap pun.','order'=>444],
            ['start_time'=>1066.88,'end_time'=>1070.3,'target_text'=>'>> Every fast food restaurant I see here has fried chicken and spaghetti.','source_text'=>'>> Setiap restoran makanan segera yang saya nampak di sini ada ayam goreng dan spageti.','order'=>445],
            ['start_time'=>1070.4,'end_time'=>1076.86,'target_text'=>'McDonald\'s, KFC, Loia, obviously, uh, Jollibee, but spaghetti is Jollibee\'s thing.','source_text'=>'McDonald\'s, KFC, Lotteria, dan sudah tentu Jollibee, tapi spageti memang menu khas Jollibee.','order'=>446],
            ['start_time'=>1076.96,'end_time'=>1078.38,'target_text'=>'>> Jollibee.','source_text'=>'>> Jollibee.','order'=>447],
            ['start_time'=>1078.48,'end_time'=>1078.88,'target_text'=>'Yeah, I know.','source_text'=>'Ya, saya tahu.','order'=>448],
            ['start_time'=>1078.96,'end_time'=>1080.38,'target_text'=>'I always see Jollibee on Tik Tok.','source_text'=>'Saya selalu nampak Jollibee di TikTok.','order'=>449],
            ['start_time'=>1080.48,'end_time'=>1086.06,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know if you ever see it cuz I feel like it\'s such a random thing for a fast food place to just have spaghetti.','source_text'=>'Saya tak tahu kalau awak selalu nampak sebab rasa macam pelik bila restoran makanan segera sediakan menu spageti.','order'=>450],
            ['start_time'=>1086.16,'end_time'=>1087.9,'target_text'=>'>> That\'s why it\'s just like so like unique.','source_text'=>'>> Sebab tu lah ia jadi sangat unik.','order'=>451],
            ['start_time'=>1088,'end_time'=>1088.4,'target_text'=>'>> Exactly.','source_text'=>'>> Tepat sekali.','order'=>452],
            ['start_time'=>1088.48,'end_time'=>1095.9,'target_text'=>'Like their main things are the fried chicken obviously, the spaghetti, the yum burger, and then this pineapple juice that','source_text'=>'Menu utama mereka sudah tentu ayam goreng, spageti, burger Yum, dan juga jus nanas','order'=>453],
            ['start_time'=>1096,'end_time'=>1097.98,'target_text'=>'they have that\'s so delicious.','source_text'=>'yang mereka sediakan yang sangat lazat.','order'=>454],
            ['start_time'=>1098.08,'end_time'=>1099.58,'target_text'=>'>> Did they have it when we went?','source_text'=>'>> Ada ke jus tu masa kita pergi hari tu?','order'=>455],
            ['start_time'=>1099.68,'end_time'=>1103.98,'target_text'=>'No, I\'ve only had it in uh Canada and the Philippines.','source_text'=>'Tak ada, saya cuma pernah minum di Kanada dan Filipina.','order'=>456],
            ['start_time'=>1104.08,'end_time'=>1105.42,'target_text'=>'>> Let\'s go to the Philippines.','source_text'=>'>> Jom kita pergi ke Filipina.','order'=>457],
            ['start_time'=>1105.52,'end_time'=>1106.94,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, >> I love Filipino food.','source_text'=>'>> Jom, >> saya suka makanan Filipina.','order'=>458],
            ['start_time'=>1107.04,'end_time'=>1109.82,'target_text'=>'>> Do you have a favorite Filipino dish or do you not know that many?','source_text'=>'>> Awak ada hidangan Filipina kegemaran atau awak tak tahu banyak sangat?','order'=>459],
            ['start_time'=>1109.92,'end_time'=>1115.74,'target_text'=>'>> Dude, I I don\'t even know I don\'t know any I don\'t know the name of any Filipino dish, but I just know that it\'s good.','source_text'=>'>> Bro, saya langsung tak tahu nama mana-mana hidangan Filipina, tapi saya cuma tahu makanannya memang sedap.','order'=>460],
            ['start_time'=>1115.84,'end_time'=>1117.18,'target_text'=>'>> I could tell you my favorite then.','source_text'=>'>> Kalau macam tu saya boleh beritahu makanan kegemaran saya.','order'=>461],
            ['start_time'=>1117.28,'end_time'=>1117.6,'target_text'=>'What is it?','source_text'=>'Apa dia?','order'=>462],
            ['start_time'=>1117.6,'end_time'=>1125.66,'target_text'=>'It\'s uh called seaig and it\'s basically all the meat from the head of a pig that\'s chopped up mixed with some onions and they','source_text'=>'Namanya Sisig, dan ia pada asasnya daging daripada bahagian kepala babi yang dicincang halus dan dicampur dengan bawang,','order'=>463],
            ['start_time'=>1125.76,'end_time'=>1132.54,'target_text'=>'they fry it up a little bit and then they put like this nice sauce on it and serve that with rice and it\'s so good.','source_text'=>'kemudian digoreng sedikit dan diletakkan sos yang sangat sedap lalu dihidangkan bersama nasi putih, memang padu.','order'=>464],
            ['start_time'=>1132.64,'end_time'=>1133.58,'target_text'=>'It\'s a little bit sweet.','source_text'=>'Rasanya ada manis sedikit.','order'=>465],
            ['start_time'=>1133.68,'end_time'=>1135.98,'target_text'=>'It\'s like nice and fatty from all the head meat.','source_text'=>'Berlemak dan sedap daripada bahagian daging tersebut.','order'=>466],
            ['start_time'=>1136.08,'end_time'=>1137.1,'target_text'=>'It\'s just delicious.','source_text'=>'Memang sangat lazat.','order'=>467],
            ['start_time'=>1137.2,'end_time'=>1140.3,'target_text'=>'>> What\'s your favorite uh cuisine in the world?','source_text'=>'>> Apa hidangan masakan kegemaran awak di dunia?','order'=>468],
            ['start_time'=>1140.4,'end_time'=>1142.78,'target_text'=>'Give me your top three in order.','source_text'=>'Beri saya tiga yang teratas mengikut susunan.','order'=>469],
            ['start_time'=>1142.88,'end_time'=>1144.06,'target_text'=>'>> I can\'t give it an order.','source_text'=>'>> Saya tak boleh susun mengikut urutan.','order'=>470],
            ['start_time'=>1144.16,'end_time'=>1148.46,'target_text'=>'Korean food and um probably Vietnamese food.','source_text'=>'Makanan Korea dan mungkin makanan Vietnam.','order'=>471],
            ['start_time'=>1148.56,'end_time'=>1149.26,'target_text'=>'What about you?','source_text'=>'Awak pula?','order'=>472],
            ['start_time'=>1149.36,'end_time'=>1150.54,'target_text'=>'>> Indian and Korean food.','source_text'=>'>> Makanan India dan makanan Korea.','order'=>473],
            ['start_time'=>1150.64,'end_time'=>1152.7,'target_text'=>'I think it\'s hard, man.','source_text'=>'Bagi saya susah nak pilih, bro.','order'=>474],
            ['start_time'=>1152.8,'end_time'=>1154.38,'target_text'=>'I think Korean food number one.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa makanan Korea nombor satu.','order'=>475],
            ['start_time'=>1154.48,'end_time'=>1155.9,'target_text'=>'I mean, I just spent so long in Korean.','source_text'=>'Sebab saya dah tinggal agak lama di Korea.','order'=>476],
            ['start_time'=>1156,'end_time'=>1156.86,'target_text'=>'I just love Korean food.','source_text'=>'Saya memang sangat suka makanan Korea.','order'=>477],
            ['start_time'=>1156.96,'end_time'=>1157.98,'target_text'=>'Korean food number one.','source_text'=>'Makanan Korea nombor satu.','order'=>478],
            ['start_time'=>1158.08,'end_time'=>1159.26,'target_text'=>'Indian food number two.','source_text'=>'Makanan India nombor dua.','order'=>479],
            ['start_time'=>1159.36,'end_time'=>1160.78,'target_text'=>'And probably Oh, dude.','source_text'=>'Dan mungkin... Aduh bro.','order'=>480],
            ['start_time'=>1160.88,'end_time'=>1161.66,'target_text'=>'Number three is so hard.','source_text'=>'Nombor tiga susah gila nak pilih.','order'=>481],
            ['start_time'=>1161.76,'end_time'=>1165.1,'target_text'=>'Like, honestly, it\'s so hard to choose cuz I >> say I could say Greek food, too.','source_text'=>'Sejujurnya susah sangat nak buat pilihan sebab saya >> boleh kata makanan Yunani (Greek) juga.','order'=>482],
            ['start_time'=>1165.2,'end_time'=>1167.18,'target_text'=>'>> But I would say overall probably Chinese food.','source_text'=>'>> Tapi secara keseluruhannya saya rasa mungkin makanan Cina.','order'=>483],
            ['start_time'=>1167.28,'end_time'=>1170.06,'target_text'=>'And I know that\'s very broad, but >> what about Italian food?','source_text'=>'Dan saya tahu pilihan tu sangat luas, tapi >> bagaimana pula dengan makanan Itali?','order'=>484],
            ['start_time'=>1170.16,'end_time'=>1176.78,'target_text'=>'No, I like Italian food that\'s made outside of Italy, but when I I don\'t know if there are any Italians watching, I hope you\'re','source_text'=>'Saya suka makanan Itali yang dimasak di luar negara Itali, tapi bila saya... Saya tak tahu kalau ada penonton orang Itali di sini, saya harap anda','order'=>485],
            ['start_time'=>1176.88,'end_time'=>1177.34,'target_text'=>'not offended.','source_text'=>'tak berkecil hati.','order'=>486],
            ['start_time'=>1177.44,'end_time'=>1178.3,'target_text'=>'You probably are.','source_text'=>'Mungkin korang akan terasa juga.','order'=>487],
            ['start_time'=>1178.4,'end_time'=>1179.98,'target_text'=>'I was in Italy for two weeks.','source_text'=>'Saya pernah berada di Itali selama dua minggu.','order'=>488],
            ['start_time'=>1180.08,'end_time'=>1186.46,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know if it\'s just the restaurants I went to, but I just found everything so salty, but the pizzas pizzas were good.','source_text'=>'Saya tak tahu sama ada cuma restoran yang saya pergi tu yang bermasalah, tapi saya dapati semuanya agak masin, tapi pizanya sedap.','order'=>489],
            ['start_time'=>1186.56,'end_time'=>1189.72,'target_text'=>'But one thing I\'ll say is that tiramisu','source_text'=>'Tapi satu benda yang saya nak puji ialah tiramisunya','order'=>490],
            ['start_time'=>1190,'end_time'=>1190.7,'target_text'=>'elite, dude.','source_text'=>'memang bertaraf tinggi, bro.','order'=>491],
            ['start_time'=>1190.8,'end_time'=>1193.1,'target_text'=>'I had so much tiramisu in Italy.','source_text'=>'Saya makan banyak gila tiramisu masa di Itali.','order'=>492],
            ['start_time'=>1193.2,'end_time'=>1194.62,'target_text'=>'Gelato amazing.','source_text'=>'Aiskrim gelato dia sangat menakjubkan.','order'=>493],
            ['start_time'=>1194.72,'end_time'=>1195.12,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know.','source_text'=>'Entahlah.','order'=>494],
            ['start_time'=>1195.12,'end_time'=>1197.26,'target_text'=>'I just felt like the pasta disappointed me.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa pastanya agak mengecewakan saya.','order'=>495],
            ['start_time'=>1197.36,'end_time'=>1197.9,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know.','source_text'=>'Entahlah.','order'=>496],
            ['start_time'=>1198,'end_time'=>1199.02,'target_text'=>'The pasta for sure.','source_text'=>'Pastanya memang mengecewakan.','order'=>497],
            ['start_time'=>1199.12,'end_time'=>1199.52,'target_text'=>'pizza.','source_text'=>'Piza.','order'=>498],
            ['start_time'=>1199.6,'end_time'=>1201.26,'target_text'=>'The pizza was great, but it\'s just not my taste.','source_text'=>'Pizanya sedap, tapi cuma bukan menepati selera saya.','order'=>499],
            ['start_time'=>1201.36,'end_time'=>1203.1,'target_text'=>'I think I just prefer North American pizza.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa saya lebih gemar piza gaya Amerika Utara.','order'=>500],
            ['start_time'=>1203.2,'end_time'=>1204.62,'target_text'=>'I mean, I love Hawaiian pizza.','source_text'=>'Maksud saya, saya suka piza Hawaiian.','order'=>501],
            ['start_time'=>1204.72,'end_time'=>1205.58,'target_text'=>'That\'s my favorite pizza.','source_text'=>'Itulah piza kegemaran saya.','order'=>502],
            ['start_time'=>1205.68,'end_time'=>1207.1,'target_text'=>'So, that should tell you all you need to know.','source_text'=>'Jadi itu dah cukup untuk terangkan segalanya kepada awak.','order'=>503],
            ['start_time'=>1207.2,'end_time'=>1208.3,'target_text'=>'That\'s my favorite pizza.','source_text'=>'Itulah piza kegemaran saya.','order'=>504],
            ['start_time'=>1208.4,'end_time'=>1209.42,'target_text'=>'I love Hawaiian pizza.','source_text'=>'Saya suka piza Hawaiian.','order'=>505],
            ['start_time'=>1209.52,'end_time'=>1212.7,'target_text'=>'I love like sweetness and I love like a lot of tomato sauce.','source_text'=>'Saya suka rasa manis dan saya suka sos tomato yang banyak.','order'=>506],
            ['start_time'=>1212.8,'end_time'=>1217.58,'target_text'=>'Italian pizza is good, but it\'s not my taste, but I feel like the pasta pasta let me down.','source_text'=>'Piza Itali sedap, tapi bukan selera saya, tapi saya rasa pastanya memang menghampakan.','order'=>507],
            ['start_time'=>1217.68,'end_time'=>1219.66,'target_text'=>'Pasta let me down cuz I love pasta, dude.','source_text'=>'Pastanya menghampakan sebab saya memang peminat pasta, bro.','order'=>508],
            ['start_time'=>1219.76,'end_time'=>1221.82,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know why in Italy it just it wasn\'t hitting.','source_text'=>'Saya tak tahu kenapa di Itali rasanya tak sampai.','order'=>509],
            ['start_time'=>1221.92,'end_time'=>1223.02,'target_text'=>'Just did not slap.','source_text'=>'Langsung tak kena dengan selera.','order'=>510],
            ['start_time'=>1223.12,'end_time'=>1223.74,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know why.','source_text'=>'Saya tak tahu kenapa.','order'=>511],
            ['start_time'=>1223.84,'end_time'=>1226.94,'target_text'=>'And also is expensive, bro.','source_text'=>'Lagipun harganya mahal, bro.','order'=>512],
            ['start_time'=>1227.04,'end_time'=>1228.06,'target_text'=>'>> You\'re paying euros.','source_text'=>'>> Awak bayar guna mata wang Euro.','order'=>513],
            ['start_time'=>1228.16,'end_time'=>1229.5,'target_text'=>'I was with my younger brother, dude.','source_text'=>'Masa tu saya bersama adik lelaki saya.','order'=>514],
            ['start_time'=>1229.6,'end_time'=>1230.46,'target_text'=>'It was expensive.','source_text'=>'Memang mahal.','order'=>515],
            ['start_time'=>1230.56,'end_time'=>1231.66,'target_text'=>'Every meal is so expensive.','source_text'=>'Setiap kali makan perbelanjaannya sangat tinggi.','order'=>516],
            ['start_time'=>1231.76,'end_time'=>1237.26,'target_text'=>'And it was just like, bro, I love carbonara so much, but I did not have one good carbonara in Italy.','source_text'=>'Dan saya rasa macam, bro, saya suka sangat pasta carbonara, tapi saya tak jumpa walau satu pun carbonara yang sedap di Itali.','order'=>517],
            ['start_time'=>1237.36,'end_time'=>1240.46,'target_text'=>'I feel like the tomato based sauces were better.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa sos berasaskan tomato lebih sedap di sana.','order'=>518],
            ['start_time'=>1240.56,'end_time'=>1241.98,'target_text'=>'Yeah, but carbonara, no.','source_text'=>'Ya, tapi kalau carbonara, memang tak kena.','order'=>519],
            ['start_time'=>1242.08,'end_time'=>1242.48,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know.','source_text'=>'Entahlah.','order'=>520],
            ['start_time'=>1242.48,'end_time'=>1245.58,'target_text'=>'I maybe I\'ll go back to Italy and try it again.','source_text'=>'Mungkin saya akan kembali ke Itali dan cuba lagi sekali.','order'=>521],
            ['start_time'=>1245.68,'end_time'=>1252.14,'target_text'=>'But I did go to a lot of very highly rated restaurants, but also a lot of just random random restaurants with no reviews.','source_text'=>'Tapi saya memang pergi ke banyak restoran yang mendapat penilaian sangat tinggi, dan juga banyak restoran rawak yang tiada sebarang ulasan.','order'=>522],
            ['start_time'=>1252.24,'end_time'=>1255.58,'target_text'=>'So, I\'ve went to restaurants across the board, but it was just always like, yeah.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya dah cuba pelbagai jenis restoran, tapi hasilnya tetap sama saja.','order'=>523],
            ['start_time'=>1255.68,'end_time'=>1256.94,'target_text'=>'But I will give it another shot.','source_text'=>'Tapi saya akan beri satu lagi peluang.','order'=>524],
            ['start_time'=>1257.04,'end_time'=>1258.46,'target_text'=>'Italy is is a nice country.','source_text'=>'Itali memang sebuah negara yang menarik.','order'=>525],
            ['start_time'=>1258.56,'end_time'=>1259.18,'target_text'=>'It\'s beautiful.','source_text'=>'Sangat cantik.','order'=>526],
            ['start_time'=>1259.28,'end_time'=>1265.02,'target_text'=>'I went to Rome, Florence, the coast, bleeding tower of Pisa, and Venice.','source_text'=>'Saya pergi ke Rome, Florence, kawasan persisiran pantai, Menara Condong Pisa, dan Venice.','order'=>527],
            ['start_time'=>1265.12,'end_time'=>1266.94,'target_text'=>'Venice is such a crazy city.','source_text'=>'Venice adalah bandar yang sangat luar biasa.','order'=>528],
            ['start_time'=>1267.04,'end_time'=>1272.94,'target_text'=>'Honestly, dude, Italy is probably my favorite country in Europe for architecture and like history and stuff, but because Rome,','source_text'=>'Sejujurnya bro, Itali mungkin negara kegemaran saya di Eropah dari segi seni bina dan sejarahnya, tapi sebab bandar Rome,','order'=>529],
            ['start_time'=>1273.04,'end_time'=>1274.86,'target_text'=>'that\'s probably my favorite city I\'ve ever been to.','source_text'=>'ia mungkin bandar kegemaran saya yang pernah saya lawati.','order'=>530],
            ['start_time'=>1274.96,'end_time'=>1280.22,'target_text'=>'Dude, Rome is like in terms of like architecture and history, Rome is insanely insanely beautiful.','source_text'=>'Bro, dari segi seni bina dan sejarah, Rome memang tersangat-sangat indah.','order'=>531],
            ['start_time'=>1280.32,'end_time'=>1282.22,'target_text'=>'Venice is such a cool city.','source_text'=>'Venice pun sebuah bandar yang sangat menarik.','order'=>532],
            ['start_time'=>1282.32,'end_time'=>1283.02,'target_text'=>'Florence, too.','source_text'=>'Florence juga sama.','order'=>533],
            ['start_time'=>1283.12,'end_time'=>1285.98,'target_text'=>'Every night we were in Florence, we\'d buy a pizza at the bottom of the hill.','source_text'=>'Setiap malam masa kami di Florence, kami akan beli piza di kaki bukit.','order'=>534],
            ['start_time'=>1286.08,'end_time'=>1289.02,'target_text'=>'We\'d walk up and there were a bunch of people sitting there.','source_text'=>'Kami akan berjalan naik ke atas dan ada ramai orang sedang duduk santai di sana.','order'=>535],
            ['start_time'=>1289.12,'end_time'=>1295.18,'target_text'=>'We\'d eat the pizza, watch the sunset, see the that big cathedral in Rome or in Florence, sorry.','source_text'=>'Kami makan piza sambil menyaksikan matahari terbenam dan melihat gereja katedral besar di Florence.','order'=>536],
            ['start_time'=>1295.28,'end_time'=>1296.46,'target_text'=>'Very, very beautiful.','source_text'=>'Sangat-sangat indah.','order'=>537],
            ['start_time'=>1296.56,'end_time'=>1297.26,'target_text'=>'Very nice.','source_text'=>'Sangat menyenangkan.','order'=>538],
            ['start_time'=>1297.36,'end_time'=>1298.06,'target_text'=>'I liked it.','source_text'=>'Saya menyukainya.','order'=>539],
            ['start_time'=>1298.16,'end_time'=>1299.58,'target_text'=>'It\'s very aesthetic.','source_text'=>'Pemandangannya sangat estetik.','order'=>540],
            ['start_time'=>1299.68,'end_time'=>1300.38,'target_text'=>'What else was I talking about?','source_text'=>'Pasal apa lagi yang saya borak tadi?','order'=>541],
            ['start_time'=>1300.48,'end_time'=>1300.8,'target_text'=>'Oh, yeah.','source_text'=>'Oh ya.','order'=>542],
            ['start_time'=>1300.8,'end_time'=>1303.02,'target_text'=>'I was giving you my top my top foods.','source_text'=>'Saya tengah kongsikan senarai makanan teratas saya.','order'=>543],
            ['start_time'=>1303.12,'end_time'=>1303.98,'target_text'=>'I got distracted.','source_text'=>'Fikiran saya terganggu tadi.','order'=>544],
            ['start_time'=>1304.08,'end_time'=>1305.74,'target_text'=>'Anyway, number one, Korean.','source_text'=>'Apa-apa pun, nombor satu, Korea.','order'=>545],
            ['start_time'=>1305.84,'end_time'=>1306.78,'target_text'=>'Shout out Korea.','source_text'=>'Terbaik Korea.','order'=>546],
            ['start_time'=>1306.88,'end_time'=>1307.82,'target_text'=>'Number two, India.','source_text'=>'Nombor dua, India.','order'=>547],
            ['start_time'=>1307.92,'end_time'=>1308.7,'target_text'=>'Shout out Korea.','source_text'=>'Terbaik Korea.','order'=>548],
            ['start_time'=>1308.8,'end_time'=>1310.38,'target_text'=>'Number three, probably Chinese.','source_text'=>'Nombor tiga, mungkin masakan Cina.','order'=>549],
            ['start_time'=>1310.48,'end_time'=>1311.5,'target_text'=>'I know that\'s broad.','source_text'=>'Saya tahu kategorinya luas.','order'=>550],
            ['start_time'=>1311.6,'end_time'=>1315.82,'target_text'=>'There are so many like different uh cuisines like Sichuan, Beijing, Shanghai.','source_text'=>'Ada banyak jenis masakan seperti Sichuan, Beijing, Shanghai.','order'=>551],
            ['start_time'=>1315.92,'end_time'=>1319.5,'target_text'=>'Like every place has their own cuisine, but I would say my favorite is Cantonese.','source_text'=>'Setiap tempat ada masakan khas mereka tersendiri, tapi saya boleh kata kegemaran saya ialah masakan Kantonis.','order'=>552],
            ['start_time'=>1319.6,'end_time'=>1321.42,'target_text'=>'So number three, Cantonese food.','source_text'=>'Jadi nombor tiga, makanan Kantonis.','order'=>553],
            ['start_time'=>1321.52,'end_time'=>1323.1,'target_text'=>'One of my best friends is Cantonese.','source_text'=>'Salah seorang kawan baik saya berketurunan Kantonis.','order'=>554],
            ['start_time'=>1323.2,'end_time'=>1325.82,'target_text'=>'We went to Hong Kong together and we tried so much food.','source_text'=>'Kami pernah pergi ke Hong Kong bersama-sama dan mencuba pelbagai jenis makanan.','order'=>555],
            ['start_time'=>1325.92,'end_time'=>1327.26,'target_text'=>'He was showing me a lot of food, man.','source_text'=>'Dia kenalkan banyak makanan kepada saya, kawan.','order'=>556],
            ['start_time'=>1327.36,'end_time'=>1327.76,'target_text'=>'Amazing.','source_text'=>'Memang hebat.','order'=>557],
            ['start_time'=>1327.84,'end_time'=>1329.34,'target_text'=>'And I\'ve always liked Cantonese food.','source_text'=>'Dan saya memang dari dulu suka makanan Kantonis.','order'=>558],
            ['start_time'=>1329.44,'end_time'=>1330.62,'target_text'=>'So dim sum and all that.','source_text'=>'Jadi dim sum dan semua hidangan itu.','order'=>559],
            ['start_time'=>1330.72,'end_time'=>1331.26,'target_text'=>'Amazing.','source_text'=>'Memang luar biasa.','order'=>560],
            ['start_time'=>1331.36,'end_time'=>1332.86,'target_text'=>'So yeah, number three, Cantonese.','source_text'=>'Jadi ya, nombor tiga, masakan Kantonis.','order'=>561],
            ['start_time'=>1332.96,'end_time'=>1334.54,'target_text'=>'Those are my top top three.','source_text'=>'Itulah tiga pilihan teratas saya.','order'=>562],
            ['start_time'=>1334.64,'end_time'=>1339.98,'target_text'=>'Let me know in the comments what are your top three favorite cuisines in the world.','source_text'=>'Beritahu saya di ruangan komen apa tiga hidangan masakan kegemaran korang di dunia.','order'=>563],
            ['start_time'=>1340.08,'end_time'=>1340.78,'target_text'=>'Let me know, guys.','source_text'=>'Kongsi dengan saya, kawan-kawan.','order'=>564],
            ['start_time'=>1340.88,'end_time'=>1344.3,'target_text'=>'So, we\'re exploring the park, but Leon has something to say.','source_text'=>'Jadi, kita sedang meneroka taman ini, tapi Leon ada sesuatu nak disampaikan.','order'=>565],
            ['start_time'=>1344.4,'end_time'=>1351.26,'target_text'=>'>> Guys, if you want some more English videos, I\'m making some on my channel as well at Nomadipedia','source_text'=>'>> Kawan-kawan, kalau korang nak tonton lebih banyak video Bahasa Inggeris, saya ada buat beberapa video di saluran saya juga iaitu Nomadipedia','order'=>566],
            ['start_time'=>1351.36,'end_time'=>1353.9,'target_text'=>'on YouTube and all the social medias.','source_text'=>'di YouTube dan semua media sosial.','order'=>567],
            ['start_time'=>1354,'end_time'=>1354.86,'target_text'=>'Check it out.','source_text'=>'Pergi tengok sekarang.','order'=>568],
            ['start_time'=>1354.96,'end_time'=>1359.18,'target_text'=>'So, make sure to follow Leon and watch his videos on YouTube and everywhere else.','source_text'=>'Jadi, pastikan korang ikuti Leon dan tonton videonya di YouTube dan platform lain.','order'=>569],
            ['start_time'=>1359.28,'end_time'=>1360.22,'target_text'=>'It\'s in the description.','source_text'=>'Pautannya ada di ruangan deskripsi.','order'=>570],
            ['start_time'=>1360.32,'end_time'=>1363.34,'target_text'=>'You can click on his channel and watch it after this video.','source_text'=>'Korang boleh klik pada salurannya dan tonton selepas selesai video ini.','order'=>571],
            ['start_time'=>1363.44,'end_time'=>1367.98,'target_text'=>'As always, guys, here is the last shadowing segment of today.','source_text'=>'Seperti biasa kawan-kawan, inilah segmen peniruan sebutan (shadowing) terakhir untuk hari ini.','order'=>572],
            ['start_time'=>1368.08,'end_time'=>1371.18,'target_text'=>'I\'m really happy you\'re walking with me today.','source_text'=>'Saya sangat gembira korang luangkan masa berjalan bersama saya hari ini.','order'=>573],
            ['start_time'=>1371.28,'end_time'=>1376.94,'target_text'=>'Just imagine that we\'re best friends spending the afternoon together in this park.','source_text'=>'Bayangkan sahaja yang kita adalah kawan baik yang sedang meluangkan waktu petang bersama di taman ini.','order'=>574],
            ['start_time'=>1377.04,'end_time'=>1383.18,'target_text'=>'The weather feels great, the trees look beautiful, and we have plenty of time to talk.','source_text'=>'Cuaca terasa sangat nyaman, pokok-pokok nampak sangat indah, dan kita ada banyak masa untuk berbual.','order'=>575],
            ['start_time'=>1383.28,'end_time'=>1388.78,'target_text'=>'Honestly, these simple moments are sometimes the best part of traveling.','source_text'=>'Sejujurnya, saat-saat ringkas seperti inilah kadangkala menjadi bahagian terbaik dalam aktiviti mengembara.','order'=>576],
            ['start_time'=>1388.88,'end_time'=>1393.58,'target_text'=>'I love traveling because every place feels completely different.','source_text'=>'Saya suka mengembara kerana setiap tempat memberikan suasana yang benar-benar berbeza.','order'=>577],
            ['start_time'=>1393.68,'end_time'=>1400.3,'target_text'=>'You can try new food, meet interesting people, and see things you\'ve never seen before.','source_text'=>'Anda boleh mencuba makanan baharu, bertemu orang yang menarik, dan melihat perkara yang belum pernah anda lihat sebelum ini.','order'=>578],
            ['start_time'=>1400.4,'end_time'=>1407.42,'target_text'=>'Sometimes traveling can be stressful, especially when you get lost or don\'t understand the language.','source_text'=>'Kadang-kadang mengembara boleh menjadi mencabar, terutamanya apabila anda tersesat atau tidak memahami bahasa tempatan.','order'=>579],
            ['start_time'=>1407.52,'end_time'=>1411.9,'target_text'=>'But those moments usually become the funniest stories later.','source_text'=>'Namun saat-saat itulah yang biasanya menjadi kisah paling lucu apabila dikenang kembali.','order'=>580],
            ['start_time'=>1412,'end_time'=>1415.74,'target_text'=>'Where would you travel if you could go anywhere right now?','source_text'=>'Ke manakah anda akan pergi jika anda boleh mengembara ke mana sahaja sekarang?','order'=>581],
            ['start_time'=>1415.84,'end_time'=>1421.9,'target_text'=>'I think I\'d choose somewhere with amazing food, beautiful nature, and friendly people.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa saya akan memilih tempat yang mempunyai makanan yang lazat, alam semula jadi yang indah, dan penduduk yang mesra.','order'=>582],
            ['start_time'=>1422,'end_time'=>1427.66,'target_text'=>'We could walk around the city, visit local markets, and try everything we see.','source_text'=>'Kita boleh berjalan di sekitar bandar, melawat pasar tempatan, dan mencuba setiap makanan yang kita nampak.','order'=>583],
            ['start_time'=>1427.76,'end_time'=>1434.14,'target_text'=>'It would be such a fun trip, especially if we could experience it together.','source_text'=>'Ia pasti akan menjadi percutian yang sangat menyeronokkan, terutamanya jika kita dapat melaluinya bersama-sama.','order'=>584],
            ['start_time'=>1434.24,'end_time'=>1438.06,'target_text'=>'And remember, guys, you will become fluent in English.','source_text'=>'Dan ingat kawan-kawan, anda pasti akan fasih berbahasa Inggeris.','order'=>585],
            ['start_time'=>1438.16,'end_time'=>1439.18,'target_text'=>'Bye, guys.','source_text'=>'Selamat tinggal semua.','order'=>586],
            ['start_time'=>1439.28,'end_time'=>1440.78,'target_text'=>'Yo, what are you working on?','source_text'=>'Yo, awak tengah buat apa tu?','order'=>587],
            ['start_time'=>1440.88,'end_time'=>1442.86,'target_text'=>'>> Yo, I\'m working on my channel right now.','source_text'=>'>> Yo, saya tengah uruskan saluran saya sekarang.','order'=>588],
            ['start_time'=>1442.96,'end_time'=>1443.5,'target_text'=>'I just started.','source_text'=>'Saya baru sahaja bermula.','order'=>589],
            ['start_time'=>1443.6,'end_time'=>1445.82,'target_text'=>'I\'m going to be posting once a week if you guys want to check it out.','source_text'=>'Saya akan muat naik video seminggu sekali kalau korang nak pergi tonton.','order'=>590],
            ['start_time'=>1445.92,'end_time'=>1450.3,'target_text'=>'>> I\'ll be posting my shadowing stories on my second channel, Vulca.','source_text'=>'>> Saya akan muat naik kisah-kisah shadowing di saluran kedua saya, Vulca.','order'=>591],
            ['start_time'=>1450.4,'end_time'=>1453.74,'target_text'=>'And I\'ve also started posting these videos as podcasts.','source_text'=>'Dan saya juga dah mula muat naik video-video ini dalam bentuk podcast.','order'=>592],
            ['start_time'=>1453.84,'end_time'=>1457.18,'target_text'=>'Do you understand English but feel nervous when you speak?','source_text'=>'Adakah anda faham Bahasa Inggeris tetapi berasa gementar apabila ingin bertutur?','order'=>593],
            ['start_time'=>1457.28,'end_time'=>1461.9,'target_text'=>'Join my Patreon for my speaking, pronunciation, and shadowing course.','source_text'=>'Sertai Patreon saya untuk kursus pertuturan, sebutan, dan latihan teknik shadowing.','order'=>594],
            ['start_time'=>1462,'end_time'=>1472.7,'target_text'=>'With over 90 video lessons, you\'ll practice pronunciation, accent, rhythm, and natural speaking with stepbystep video lessons,','source_text'=>'Dengan lebih 90 video pembelajaran, anda akan melatih sebutan, loghat, ritma, dan pertuturan semula jadi melalui panduan video langkah demi langkah,','order'=>595],
            ['start_time'=>1472.8,'end_time'=>1475.02,'target_text'=>'plus new lessons every week.','source_text'=>'disertakan pembelajaran baharu setiap minggu.','order'=>596],
            ['start_time'=>1475.12,'end_time'=>1477.8,'target_text'=>'Get it in the description.','source_text'=>'Dapatkan pautan di ruangan deskripsi.','order'=>597],
